INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (60, 'Custom Magnetic Closure Boxes', 'custom-magnetic-closure-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Magnetic Closure Gift Boxes Bulk — Luxury Packaging That Creates Unforgettable Unboxing Moments</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">First impressions are everything in business. When your customer lifts the lid of a magnetic closure box and hears that satisfying click, you have already delivered an experience that sets your brand apart from competitors. At Prime Packaging Boxes, we produce custom magnetic closure gift boxes in bulk for brands, businesses, and entrepreneurs who refuse to compromise on presentation or quality.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Magnetic closure boxes — also known as rigid magnetic boxes or snap-close gift boxes — are the gold standard in premium retail and gifting packaging. They are used by luxury fashion brands, high-end cosmetic companies, jewelry designers, artisan candle makers, corporate gifting programs, and wedding planners around the world. Now you can get the same caliber of packaging for your business, at competitive wholesale prices, with low minimum order quantities that work for brands at every stage of growth.</span> \n<h2><b>Magnetic Gift Boxes Wholesale — Premium Bulk Pricing for Every Brand Size</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our magnetic gift boxes wholesale program is designed for businesses that need consistent, high-quality luxury packaging at scale. Whether you need 100 boxes for a seasonal product launch or 10,000 boxes for a major retail rollout, Prime Packaging Boxes delivers with the same exceptional quality and rigorous attention to detail at every volume level.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing at Prime Packaging Boxes is transparent and straightforward. The more you order, the better your unit cost — but even at our lowest minimum quantities, our pricing makes luxury packaging accessible for growing and emerging brands. We do not believe that premium packaging should be reserved only for established corporations. Every brand, at every stage, deserves packaging that commands attention and builds customer trust.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our wholesale magnetic closure boxes are available in a comprehensive range of standard sizes or fully custom dimensions engineered around your specific product. Popular standard sizes include small gift box formats ideal for jewelry, cosmetics, and fragrance samples; medium sizes suited to candles, skincare gift sets, and specialty food products; and large luxury sizes perfect for clothing, hampers, premium electronics, and high-value corporate gifts. Every size can be fully customized with your branding, colors, interior configuration, and choice of exterior finishing.</span> \n<h2><b>Rigid Magnetic Closure Boxes Wholesale — Built to Protect, Designed to Impress</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The foundation of every magnetic closure box we produce at Prime Packaging Boxes is a premium rigid board construction. Our rigid magnetic closure boxes wholesale are manufactured from high-density greyboard chipboard wrapped in premium art paper, specialty textured paper, fabric, or luxury materials. This construction gives the box its characteristic weight, structural rigidity, and unmistakable premium feel — the kind of packaging that customers keep, reuse, and associate with quality brands.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Rigid construction provides more than just an impressive aesthetic — it delivers superior product protection that folding carton packaging simply cannot match. Unlike standard cardboard boxes that can bend, crush, or deform during shipping and handling, rigid magnetic boxes maintain their structural integrity completely throughout transit. This is particularly critical for fragile or high-value products including glass candle vessels, perfume bottles, delicate jewelry, premium skincare, electronics accessories, and artisan confectionery.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our rigid magnetic closure boxes are available with a full range of custom interior configurations designed to present and protect your specific product. Interior options include die-cut foam inserts molded to your product dimensions, satin and velvet fabric lining in custom colors, ribbon pull tabs for easy lid removal, cardboard dividers for multi-product sets, and molded pulp trays for sustainable luxury packaging solutions.</span> \n<h3><b>Exterior Finishing Options</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Every magnetic closure box from Prime Packaging Boxes can be finished with a range of premium treatments to achieve your desired brand aesthetic. Options include matte lamination for sophisticated understated elegance, gloss lamination for vibrant high-impact visual impact, soft-touch lamination for a premium velvety tactile experience, gold and silver hot foil stamping, holographic and specialty foil options, spot UV coating for selective gloss highlights, and three-dimensional embossing and debossing for logo and pattern effects. Full-color printing is available on all exterior and interior surfaces.</span> \n<h2><b>Luxury Magnetic Lid Rigid Boxes With Custom Printing — Elevate Your Product Experience</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">When customers invest in a premium product, they expect premium packaging to match. Luxury magnetic lid rigid boxes with custom printing deliver exactly that expectation — and then consistently exceed it. The moment your customer receives their order in a beautifully printed, perfectly constructed rigid box with a satisfying magnetic closure, their perception of your brand elevates immediately and permanently.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">At Prime Packaging Boxes, our luxury magnetic lid rigid boxes are produced using high-resolution printing technology capable of reproducing even the finest details of your brand design. Pantone color matching ensures your brand colors are faithfully reproduced with precision across every production run. Whether your brand aesthetic is clean and minimalist, bold and graphic, or ornate and deeply luxurious, we have the technical capability to produce the packaging that makes your vision real.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Interior custom printing is one of the most powerful and frequently overlooked branding opportunities in packaging design. Imagine your customer opening the box to find a beautifully printed interior surface bearing your brand story, a personal thank-you message, product care instructions, or an invitation to share their experience on social media. These interior details create a complete and immersive branded unboxing experience that reinforces your brand identity at every single touchpoint — and drives the kind of organic social sharing that money simply cannot buy.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Magnetic Boxes With Logo and No Minimum — For Startups and Growing Brands</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Starting a new product line or brand is an exciting undertaking — but it comes with the very real challenge of managing startup costs while still presenting a professional, premium image to customers from day one. That is precisely why Prime Packaging Boxes offers custom magnetic boxes with logo and no minimum order restrictions that force you to over-commit before you are ready.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">You can order as few as 50 boxes to launch your first product, test a new packaging design for an existing product, create a limited edition seasonal collection, or produce a small run of corporate gifting packages. No minimum order never means lower quality at Prime Packaging Boxes. Every box we produce — whether it is 50 units or 50,000 units — goes through the same quality assurance process, uses the same premium materials, and receives the same precision printing and finishing.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">This production flexibility is particularly valuable for brands launching seasonal gift collections, limited edition product runs, wedding favor packages, event-specific gift presentations, or inaugural product lines where initial order quantities are naturally conservative. Order exactly what your current sales plan requires, and scale your packaging orders in confident proportion with your growing sales volumes.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Magnetic Closure Boxes for Candles and Jewelry — Tailored for Your Product</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Different products have fundamentally different packaging requirements, and our custom magnetic closure boxes for candles and jewelry are precisely engineered to meet those specific needs. Candle packaging must accommodate the weight of glass vessels, provide reliable protection against scratches and impact damage, and create a premium unboxing experience that reflects the artisan quality and emotional resonance of handmade candles. Our candle magnetic boxes are available with custom foam inserts shaped to your specific jar dimensions, satin ribbon pulls, full interior color printing, and exterior finishes that communicate the character of your candle brand.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Jewelry packaging carries its own distinctive requirements. Ring boxes, necklace presentation boxes, bracelet boxes, earring boxes, and complete jewelry set packaging all need to display the jewelry beautifully and immediately while providing secure protection against movement, scratching, and damage. Our magnetic closure jewelry boxes are available with velvet and satin interior lining in custom colors, individual compartments engineered for specific piece types, ring roll inserts, pendant cushions, and chain management solutions. Every interior detail is designed with a single purpose: to make the jewelry look as extraordinary as possible in the moment of reveal.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Beyond candles and jewelry, we produce magnetic closure packaging for skincare and beauty gift sets, premium perfume and fragrance products, corporate recognition and gifting programs, subscription box brands, fine wine and spirits, tech accessories and electronics, and luxury artisan food and confectionery products. Whatever your product, our design team engineers the box around your specific product dimensions and presentation requirements — never the other way around.</span> \n<h2><b>Why Prime Packaging Boxes Is the Right Partner for Your Luxury Packaging</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes has built its reputation by delivering luxury-standard magnetic closure packaging to brands across the United States at pricing and minimum order quantities that make premium packaging genuinely accessible. Our clients range from independent entrepreneurs launching their first product to established retail brands with national distribution networks — and every client receives the same level of service, quality, and commitment.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our production process combines premium raw materials, state-of-the-art printing and finishing equipment, and a rigorous quality control program to ensure every box we ship meets the exacting standards our clients and their customers expect. From your first sample request to your ongoing reorders, Prime Packaging Boxes is your dedicated packaging partner. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to request your free sample kit, get a custom quote, and speak with our packaging specialists today.</span>', 'Premium custom magnetic closure boxes crafted from thick rigid board for a high-end unboxing experience. Perfect for gifts, electronics, and cosmetics. Fully customizable with logo, inserts, and premium finishes. Wholesale pricing with low MOQ.', 35, '/api/uploads/custom-magnetic-closure-boxes-wholesale.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-magnetic-closure-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/custom-magnetic-closure-boxes-with-logo.webp","/api/uploads/custom-magnetic-closure-boxes-with-logo-1.webp","/api/uploads/printed-magnetic-closure-boxes-bulk.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Magnetic Closure Boxes | Luxury Rigid Packaging', 'Premium custom magnetic closure boxes for gifts, cosmetics &amp; electronics. Luxury rigid packaging with logo printing. Wholesale pricing, fast USA delivery. Free quote!', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.987Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.788Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (1, 'Custom Clothing Boxes', 'custom-clothing-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Clothing Boxes With Logo for Small Boutique — Packaging That Dresses Your Brand</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Fashion is about presentation as much as it is about the garment itself. The experience of receiving a beautifully packaged piece of clothing — whether from a boutique counter, a gift wrap station, or an online order — is a fundamental part of the fashion brand experience. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom clothing boxes with logo for small boutiques are crafted to give independent fashion retailers, boutique clothing brands, and apparel entrepreneurs the premium packaging presentation that their clothing deserves and their customers expect.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Independent boutiques compete every day against fast fashion chains, department stores, and large online retailers with enormous packaging budgets and established brand recognition. In that competitive environment, packaging is one of the most powerful tools a small boutique has to differentiate its brand experience and build the kind of emotional customer loyalty that keeps people coming back. A beautifully crafted clothing box with your boutique''s logo communicates care, quality, and the personal touch that is the ultimate competitive advantage of an independent retailer.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Clothing Boxes Wholesale — Consistent Elegance for Every Garment</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom clothing boxes wholesale program serves independent boutiques, fashion brands, online clothing retailers, and apparel businesses that need consistent, high-quality branded packaging in regular supply at commercially competitive pricing. The wholesale program is structured to serve clothing businesses at every scale, from a single boutique location managing modest monthly packaging volumes to a multi-channel apparel brand with significant ongoing packaging requirements.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes makes premium branded clothing boxes commercially accessible for independent boutiques and small apparel brands that need professional packaging without large format supplier minimum order requirements. Our tiered pricing delivers better unit economics as quantities increase, while minimum wholesale quantities are set at levels that reflect the practical purchasing patterns of independent fashion retailers rather than the industrial volumes of fast fashion supply chains.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Clothing boxes wholesale from Prime Packaging Boxes are available in all standard garment sizes — small boxes for accessories, folded t-shirts, and lightweight knitwear; medium boxes for shirts, blouses, and lightweight dresses; large boxes for jackets, coats, heavier knitwear, and multiple garment sets; and extra-large boxes for full outfit sets, wedding party garments, and premium gift clothing packages. Every size is available with your full custom printing and choice of structural format.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Apparel Boxes With Logo — Your Brand Identity on Every Package</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Every clothing box that leaves your boutique or ships to your online customer carries your brand into your customer''s home and into their social network. Custom apparel boxes with logo printing from Prime Packaging Boxes ensure that your brand identity is presented consistently, professionally, and compellingly on every package — creating the accumulated brand impressions that build recognition, loyalty, and the word-of-mouth recommendation that grows boutique businesses most effectively.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Logo printing on clothing boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes is available in a range of approaches to match different brand aesthetics. Embossed logo treatments on matte or soft-touch laminated boxes create a sophisticated, tactile brand impression that communicates premium quality without relying on color or complex design. Foil-stamped logos on dark or light base colors create a dramatic metallic brand presence that photographs beautifully for marketing content. Full-color printed designs incorporating your complete brand identity — logo, brand colors, pattern, photography, and messaging — are available for brands that want maximum visual impact on their packaging.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The design of your clothing box exterior is a brand communication opportunity that extends beyond the logo. Brand taglines, care messaging, sustainability statements, and social media handles can all be incorporated into the exterior design to create packaging that communicates your brand values and invites ongoing customer engagement. Our design team works with boutique and apparel brand clients to develop packaging designs that reflect their brand personality authentically and compellingly.</span> \n<h3><b>Interior Presentation Options</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The interior presentation of a clothing box is as important as the exterior design for creating a premium unboxing experience. Prime Packaging Boxes offers several interior presentation options for clothing boxes. Custom tissue paper in brand colors or with custom printed patterns creates an immediate visual impact when the box is opened and wraps the garment in a layer of luxury that customers associate with premium retail. Ribbon or satin band closures inside the box hold tissue wrapping in place and add a gift-ready finishing touch. Custom printed cards or notes inside the box create a personal brand communication touchpoint. Interior color printing on the box base and walls creates a complete branded environment that surprises and delights customers at the moment of reveal.</span> \n<h2><b>Luxury Apparel Gift Boxes Custom With Tissue Paper — Gift-Ready From the Start</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Gift-giving drives a significant proportion of clothing retail sales, and customers who are buying clothing as a gift have specific packaging expectations that go beyond standard retail presentation. Luxury apparel gift boxes custom produced with tissue paper by Prime Packaging Boxes give fashion brands and boutiques packaging that is gift-ready from the moment it is assembled — no additional wrapping required, no effort from the customer to make the packaging feel appropriately special for gifting.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our luxury clothing gift boxes combine premium rigid or sturdy cardboard construction with coordinated tissue paper, ribbon closures, and custom printed brand details to create a complete gifting package that customers can present directly to the recipient with complete confidence in the quality of the presentation. The combination of beautiful box exterior and luxurious tissue paper interior creates a multi-layered unboxing experience that makes clothing gifts feel genuinely special.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Tissue paper for clothing gift boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes is available in a comprehensive range of colors to match or complement your brand palette. Custom printed tissue paper with your logo, brand pattern, or seasonal design is available for brands that want to extend their brand identity into every element of the packaging interior. The combination of a custom-printed exterior box and custom-printed tissue paper creates a fully cohesive branded experience that communicates investment in every detail of the customer experience.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom T-Shirt Packaging Boxes With Logo Wholesale — Elevate the Basics</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">T-shirts are one of the most widely sold garment categories in the world, and they are also one of the most commonly under-packaged. Most t-shirts are shipped in plain poly bags or generic brown mailer boxes — functional but entirely devoid of brand experience. Custom t-shirt packaging boxes with logo for wholesale from Prime Packaging Boxes give t-shirt brands, streetwear labels, promotional merchandise companies, and clothing businesses the opportunity to transform the delivery of their most basic garment into a complete brand experience.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">T-shirt packaging boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes are sized and structured specifically for folded t-shirts in standard sizes from XS through XXXL. The boxes are designed to present the folded t-shirt attractively when the box is opened, with the t-shirt sitting flat and visible rather than compressed or creased. This presentation approach is particularly effective for premium and designer t-shirt brands where the quality of the garment needs to be immediately apparent when the box is opened.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom logo printing on t-shirt boxes creates a branded touchpoint that generic poly bag packaging cannot achieve. For t-shirt brands building their identity in the competitive streetwear, lifestyle, and premium basics markets, the packaging box is a meaningful component of the brand experience that communicates the seriousness of the brand''s commitment to quality across every aspect of the product.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Clothing Subscription Boxes With Logo Printed — Monthly Brand Experiences</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The clothing subscription box market has created a new and rapidly growing category of apparel packaging demand. Subscription clothing services — monthly outfit curation boxes, seasonal wardrobe update subscriptions, kids clothing subscription programs, and specialty fashion subscription services — all require packaging that is consistently branded, reliably produced month after month, and capable of creating genuine excitement and anticipation with every delivery.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom clothing subscription boxes with logo printing from Prime Packaging Boxes are produced with the consistency and reliability that subscription businesses depend on. Monthly subscription services cannot afford packaging that varies between production runs or arrives late. Our subscription box program offers scheduled production runs aligned to your monthly fulfillment calendar, archived specification management that ensures consistency across every monthly production, and dedicated account management that proactively communicates production status and delivery timelines.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Subscription clothing box design can evolve seasonally while maintaining core brand identity elements that subscribers recognize and associate with their subscription experience. Prime Packaging Boxes works with subscription clothing brands to develop seasonal design variations that keep the packaging feeling fresh and exciting for subscribers while maintaining the brand consistency that builds subscription loyalty over time. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to discuss your clothing packaging requirements with our team and get started with your custom quote.</span>', 'Custom clothing boxes crafted from premium board for a polished apparel brand experience. Ideal for garments, t-shirts, and fashion retail. Full-color printing with ribbon, tissue, and insert options. Wholesale pricing available, low minimum order.', 1, '/api/uploads/clothing-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/clothing-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/clothing-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/custom-clothing-boxes-with-logo.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Clothing Boxes With Logo for Small Boutique | Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom clothing boxes with logo for your boutique or apparel brand. Luxury gift options with tissue paper, wholesale pricing, low MOQ. Prime Packaging Boxes USA.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.887Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.835Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (3, 'Custom Bread & Bakery Boxes', 'custom-bread-bakery-boxes', '<h2>Custom Bread & Bakery Boxes — Premium Food-Safe Packaging for Bakeries</h2>
<p>In the competitive bakery and food industry, packaging is just as important as the delicious treats inside. Custom Bread & Bakery Boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes are designed to keep your fresh-baked goods safe, fragrant, and visually irresistible. Whether you operate a boutique artisan bakery, a commercial pastry kitchen, or a wholesale food delivery brand, our custom-printed bakery packaging helps your products stand out on store shelves and delivery doorsteps.</p>

<h3>Why Custom Bakery Packaging Matters for Your Brand</h3>
<p>Bakery products require specialized packaging that balances breathability, grease resistance, structural durability, and brand aesthetic. Standard plain boxes fail to convey the quality of your handcrafted goods. With fully customized bakery boxes, you turn every cake, loaf, pastry, and cookie into a mobile billboard for your business. When customers carry your branded bakery box down the street or present it at a party, they are actively showcasing your brand to potential new customers.</p>

<h3>Key Features & Product Specifications</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Food-Grade & FDA Compliant:</strong> Manufactured using 100% food-safe virgin paperboard, Kraft, and corrugated materials free from harmful chemicals or toxic inks.</li>
  <li><strong>Grease & Moisture Resistant Coating:</strong> Optional inner oil-resistant barrier prevents butter, oils, and moisture from soaking through the box.</li>
  <li><strong>Clear Window Display Options:</strong> High-clarity PET/PLA transparent window cutouts allow customers to view your beautiful pastries without opening the box.</li>
  <li><strong>Custom Die-Cut Shapes & Sizes:</strong> Built to exact dimensions for sourdough loaves, baguettes, croissants, cupcakes, donuts, and multi-tier cakes.</li>
  <li><strong>Easy Assembly & Sturdy Stacking:</strong> Auto-lock bottoms and pop-up designs enable rapid assembly during peak bakery rush hours while offering superior stacking strength.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Material Options & Eco-Friendly Sustainable Choices</h3>
<p>We offer a versatile range of eco-friendly materials tailored to your product needs and sustainability goals:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Natural Brown Kraft Board:</strong> 100% recyclable, biodegradable, and compostable Kraft stock that provides an organic, rustic, eco-conscious presentation.</li>
  <li><strong>SBS (Solid Bleached Sulfate) Paperboard:</strong> Premium bright white paperboard ideal for high-definition full-color offset and digital printing.</li>
  <li><strong>Corrugated E-Flute / B-Flute:</strong> Extra-durable fluted cardboard designed for heavy multi-tier cakes, catering trays, and bulk delivery orders.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Custom Printing & Luxury Finishing Capabilities</h3>
<p>Transform your packaging into a luxury experience with our advanced printing technologies and surface treatments:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Full-Color CMYK & Pantone Spot Color Printing:</strong> Crisp, high-resolution printing inside and outside the box.</li>
  <li><strong>Gold & Silver Foil Stamping:</strong> Add metallic elegance to your logo, borders, or typography.</li>
  <li><strong>Spot UV & Embossing / Debossing:</strong> Create tactile 3D relief effects for premium brand identity.</li>
  <li><strong>Matte & Gloss Lamination:</strong> Protect the box exterior from scuffs while adding a smooth finish.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Wholesale Benefits & Ordering with Prime Packaging Boxes</h3>
<p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we make ordering custom bakery boxes effortless and affordable. Enjoy low minimum order quantities starting at just 100 units, fast turnarounds of 7 to 10 business days, free design support from our expert graphic design team, and free shipping across the USA. Contact our packaging specialists today to get a instant free quote for your custom bakery boxes!</p>', 'Premium custom bread and bakery packaging boxes designed for artisan bakeries, pastry shops, and food brands. FDA-compliant, grease-resistant, and fully customizable with vibrant logo printing.', 2, '/api/uploads/custom-bread-packaging-bakery-box.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-bread-packaging-bakery-box.webp","/api/uploads/printed-kraft-sourdough-bread-retail-box.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Sourdough Bread Boxes | Artisan Bakery Packaging | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom sourdough bread boxes with ventilation and logo printing. Kraft and coated options, low MOQ, fast USA delivery for artisan bakeries and home bakers.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.896Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.096Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (2, 'Wholesale Clothing Boxes', 'wholesale-clothing-boxes', '<h2>Wholesale Clothing Boxes — High-Quality Custom Packaging & Wholesale Boxes</h2>
<p>When it comes to elevating your product''s market presence, <strong>Wholesale Clothing Boxes</strong> from Prime Packaging Boxes offers the ultimate combination of structural durability, eye-catching visual aesthetics, and brand protection. Designed specifically for retail, e-commerce, and promotional applications, our custom packaging solutions ensure your product stands out on store shelves and creates an unforgettable unboxing experience for your customers.</p>

<h3>Why Choose Wholesale Clothing Boxes for Your Brand?</h3>
<p>In today''s competitive retail landscape, consumers make split-second buying decisions based on packaging presentation. High-quality custom packaging communicates professionalism, product value, and care. Our Wholesale Clothing Boxes is engineered using premium food-safe, eco-friendly, and heavy-duty materials tailored to your exact product dimensions and branding requirements. Whether launching a new product line or upgrading your existing packaging, Prime Packaging Boxes delivers unmatched quality and precision.</p>

<h3>Product Highlights & Features</h3>
<div><h2>Wholesale Clothing Boxes — Bulk Pricing for Fashion Brands</h2>
<p>Order custom clothing boxes in bulk and save more per unit without sacrificing quality. Our wholesale program is built for growing fashion brands, retail stores, and apparel distributors who need consistent, high-quality packaging at scale.</p>
<ul>
<li>Bulk pricing available from 100 units — better rates at 500, 1,000, and 5,000+</li>
<li>Consistent color and structural accuracy across all runs</li>
<li>Same premium materials: 14pt–24pt SBS, kraft, and recycled board</li>
<li>Custom sizes for any garment type — shirts, dresses, shoes, accessories</li>
<li>Rush production options available for seasonal campaigns</li>
<li>Dedicated account manager for wholesale orders</li>
</ul>
<p>Talk to our wholesale team to get volume pricing for your clothing boxes. We work with brands of all sizes across the USA, providing the same quality and turnaround whether you order 100 or 100,000 units.</p></div>


<h3>Key Specifications & Customization Capabilities</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Fully Custom Dimensions:</strong> Tailor-made length, width, and depth to fit your products snugly without movement during shipping.</li>
  <li><strong>Vibrant Full-Color Printing:</strong> High-definition CMYK and PMS Pantone color matching printed inside and outside the box.</li>
  <li><strong>Premium Material Stocks:</strong> Choose from 100% recyclable Kraft, Solid Bleached Sulfate (SBS) cardstock, rigid chipboard, or durable fluted corrugated board.</li>
  <li><strong>Luxury Finishing Options:</strong> Enhance your design with Gold/Silver Foil Stamping, Spot UV Coating, Embossing, Debossing, Matte Lamination, or Soft-Touch Velvet finish.</li>
  <li><strong>Custom Protective Inserts:</strong> Optional die-cut foam, cardboard partitions, or molded pulp trays to hold delicate items securely.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Sustainability & Eco-Friendly Materials</h3>
<p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we are committed to environmental responsibility. Our Wholesale Clothing Boxes options include 100% recyclable, biodegradable, and post-consumer recycled paperboard materials. We use non-toxic, eco-friendly vegetable and soy-based inks that deliver vivid color reproduction while minimizing environmental impact.</p>

<h3>Wholesale Benefits & Ordering with Prime Packaging Boxes</h3>
<p>Partnering with Prime Packaging Boxes means getting direct factory-direct wholesale pricing with no hidden fees. We provide:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Low Minimum Order Quantity:</strong> Order as few as 100 units to start your custom packaging run.</li>
  <li><strong>Fast Turnaround Times:</strong> Standard production in 7-10 business days with rush options available.</li>
  <li><strong>Free Design Support:</strong> Work directly with our expert structural and graphic packaging designers at zero extra cost.</li>
  <li><strong>Free 3D Digital Proofing:</strong> Review your artwork on a realistic 3D model before manufacturing begins.</li>
  <li><strong>Free Shipping Across USA:</strong> Fast, reliable doorstep delivery included with every order.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h3>
<p><strong>Q: What is the minimum order quantity for Wholesale Clothing Boxes?</strong><br/>
A: Our minimum order quantity (MOQ) starts at just 100 units, making custom packaging accessible for startups and established brands alike.</p>
<p><strong>Q: Can I print inside the box?</strong><br/>
A: Yes! We offer full-color CMYK printing on both the interior and exterior surfaces of your Wholesale Clothing Boxes.</p>
<p><strong>Q: How do I get a free custom quote?</strong><br/>
A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'Bulk wholesale clothing boxes for e-commerce and retail fashion brands. Low 100-unit MOQ with fast turnaround.', 1, '/api/uploads/clothing-boxes-wholesale.webp', '["/api/uploads/clothing-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/custom-clothing-boxes-with-logo-1.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Wholesale Clothing Boxes | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Wholesale Clothing Boxes with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.894Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.139Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (4, 'Custom Burger Boxes', 'custom-burger-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Printed Kraft Burger Boxes for Food Trucks — Packaging That Represents Your Brand at Every Window</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Your food truck is your brand on wheels. Every burger you serve is a statement about the quality of your food and the character of your business. At Prime Packaging Boxes, we produce custom printed kraft burger boxes for food trucks that turn every meal into a branded experience — packaging that customers notice, photograph, and share, long before they take their first bite.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The food truck market in the United States has grown into a multi-billion dollar industry, and competition at festivals, markets, street events, and permanent pitches has never been more intense. In that environment, the brands that stand out are the ones that pay attention to every detail — including their packaging. A custom printed kraft burger box with your logo, your colors, and your brand personality tells customers that you care about every aspect of their experience, not just the food inside the box.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Burger Boxes Wholesale — Consistent Branding at Scale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Running a food truck, a burger restaurant, or a takeaway operation means you go through packaging at high volume every single service. Our custom burger boxes wholesale program is designed specifically for food service businesses that need a reliable, consistent supply of branded packaging at pricing that supports their operational margins without compromise.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes is built around the realities of food service economics. We offer competitive per-unit pricing at a range of volume tiers, making custom branded burger boxes accessible for single food truck operators all the way through to multi-location restaurant groups with significantly higher packaging requirements. Every volume tier delivers the same quality of materials, the same print accuracy, and the same structural performance — only the unit price changes as volumes increase.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Consistency across reorders is a fundamental requirement for our food service wholesale clients. Your brand identity needs to look exactly the same on every box, every service, every week. Prime Packaging Boxes maintains your complete production specification on file and quality-checks every production run against your approved samples to ensure that your packaging is always consistent, always on-brand, and always ready to represent your business at its best.</span> \n<h2><b>Eco Friendly Burger Packaging Wholesale — Meet Customer Expectations on Sustainability</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Consumer attitudes toward single-use food packaging have shifted dramatically and permanently across the United States. Customers increasingly expect the food businesses they support to use packaging that is environmentally responsible, and many actively choose where to spend their food dollars based on the sustainability credentials of the businesses and their packaging choices. Our eco friendly burger packaging wholesale program helps food businesses meet these evolving customer expectations without sacrificing quality, functionality, or brand presentation.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our eco-friendly burger box range is manufactured from sustainably sourced kraft paper and recycled cardboard that is fully compostable and biodegradable under standard composting conditions. The natural brown kraft aesthetic that characterizes our eco-friendly range has become strongly associated in consumer minds with genuine environmental commitment and artisan food quality — two brand values that consistently resonate with today''s food-conscious customers.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Eco-friendly packaging at Prime Packaging Boxes does not mean plain packaging. Our entire eco-friendly burger box range is available with full custom printing using water-based, soy-derived inks that are themselves environmentally responsible. Your logo, brand colors, tagline, and any design elements you choose can all be printed beautifully on kraft paper, creating packaging that communicates both your brand identity and your environmental values simultaneously and compellingly.</span> \n<h3><b>Certifications and Compliance</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our eco-friendly food packaging materials carry relevant food safety and environmental certifications including FDA compliance for direct food contact, FSC certification for sustainably sourced paper fiber, and compostability certifications where applicable. We can provide full material compliance documentation for food service operators who need to demonstrate environmental credentials to local authorities, corporate clients, or sustainability-focused event organizers.</span> \n<h2><b>Clamshell Burger Boxes Custom Printed — Practical and Professional</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The clamshell format is one of the most practical and widely used packaging styles in the burger and fast food industry. Clamshell burger boxes custom printed from Prime Packaging Boxes combine the functional advantages of the hinged single-piece construction with your full custom brand printing, creating packaging that is fast to use in a busy service environment while still representing your brand professionally on every order.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The one-piece hinged construction of clamshell burger boxes means they can be opened, filled, and closed with a single fluid movement — an important operational advantage in high-volume food service environments where service speed directly affects customer satisfaction and throughput. There are no separate lids to manage, no assembly required, and no risk of mismatched components during a busy service period.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom printed clamshell burger boxes are available in a range of sizes to accommodate standard burgers, double patty burgers, smash burgers, chicken burgers, and loaded specialty burgers with tall builds that require extra box depth. Vented designs are available to allow steam to escape during transport, maintaining the texture and quality of the burger inside. All clamshell options are available in kraft, white, and custom color options with your full brand printing on the exterior surfaces.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Burger Boxes for Restaurants Small Order — No Large Commitment Required</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Not every food business is operating at the volume of a national fast food chain. Independent restaurants, new burger concepts, ghost kitchen operations, and pop-up food businesses all need the same professional branded packaging as larger operations — but at order quantities that reflect their actual business scale. Our custom burger boxes for restaurants small order program makes this possible without forcing you into large inventory commitments you are not yet ready for.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our small order program for restaurant burger boxes starts from as few as 100 boxes, giving independent operators the ability to order branded packaging in quantities that match their weekly or monthly usage without creating storage challenges or tying up working capital in excess packaging inventory. Small orders also give new restaurant concepts the flexibility to test different packaging formats, sizes, and designs before settling on the options that work best for their specific menu and service style.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small order lead times from Prime Packaging Boxes are typically 8 to 12 business days from artwork approval, with rush production options available for businesses with urgent requirements. Our customer service team works closely with small order clients to understand their timeline and volume requirements and to find the production solution that best meets their operational needs.</span> \n<h2><b>Eco Friendly Burger Boxes With Custom Logo Wholesale — Build a Brand People Are Proud to Support</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The combination of eco-friendly materials and custom logo printing creates burger boxes that do double duty for your brand. Eco friendly burger boxes with custom logo for wholesale supply from Prime Packaging Boxes give food businesses packaging that actively reinforces two of the most powerful brand narratives in contemporary food culture — quality and environmental responsibility.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Customers who care about sustainability are typically also customers who care about food quality, provenance, and the values of the businesses they support. By investing in eco-friendly custom branded packaging, you send a clear signal to this increasingly influential customer segment that your business shares their values. This alignment between brand values and packaging choices builds the kind of genuine brand loyalty that drives repeat visits and enthusiastic word-of-mouth recommendation.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our eco-friendly custom logo burger boxes are available in a range of structural formats including standard tuck-top boxes, clamshell designs, and open-top tray formats. Every format is fully printable with your logo and brand design using our eco-friendly ink systems. Minimum order quantities for eco-friendly wholesale burger boxes start from 100 units for smaller food operations, with significant pricing advantages available for orders above 500 and 1000 units.</span> \n<h2><b>Why Food Trucks and Restaurants Choose Prime Packaging Boxes</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes has become a preferred packaging partner for food trucks, independent restaurants, burger concepts, and food service operators across the United States. Our clients return to us because we understand the food service industry, we deliver consistently on quality and timeline commitments, and we make the ordering process as simple and stress-free as possible for busy food operators who have more important things to focus on than their packaging supply chain.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Food-safe materials, fast production, competitive wholesale pricing, low minimum orders, and a dedicated customer service team that knows your business — these are the reasons food service businesses trust Prime Packaging Boxes with their packaging. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to request samples of our burger box range, get a custom quote for your specific requirements, and take the first step toward packaging that makes your brand as memorable as your food.</span>', 'Custom printed burger boxes in food-safe, grease-resistant cardboard. Perfect for restaurants, food trucks, and fast food brands. Full-color branding, various sizes available. Eco-friendly and compostable options. Bulk wholesale pricing, fast delivery.', 2, '/api/uploads/burger-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/burger-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/burger-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/custom-burger-boxes-with-logo.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Printed Kraft Burger Boxes for Food Trucks | Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom printed kraft burger boxes for food trucks, restaurants, and takeaways. Eco-friendly options, clamshell styles, low MOQ. Prime Packaging Boxes USA — fast turnaround.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.898Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.799Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (5, 'Custom 100ml Bottle Boxes', 'custom-100ml-bottle-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom 100ml Bottle Boxes With Logo Wholesale — Precision Packaging for Your Most Important Products</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The 100ml bottle is one of the most commercially significant product formats across multiple consumer industries. It is the standard size for premium perfume and fragrance, the most popular format for specialty skincare serums and treatments, the regulated maximum for carry-on liquids in aviation, and a widely used size for e-liquids, essential oils, tinctures, and specialty food products. Whatever your 100ml product, its packaging box is the primary brand communication vehicle that surrounds it — and at Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom 100ml bottle boxes with logo for wholesale supply are produced to present your product with the precision and quality that this important format deserves.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">A 100ml bottle box serves multiple functions simultaneously. It protects the bottle from physical damage during shipping, transit, and retail handling. It provides the surface area for all required product information — ingredients, usage instructions, regulatory warnings, and brand storytelling — that the bottle itself cannot accommodate. And it creates the first brand impression at the retail shelf, in the gift box, or in the ecommerce delivery — an impression that significantly influences the consumer''s assessment of the product quality before they ever experience it directly. Prime Packaging Boxes produces 100ml bottle boxes that excel at all three of these functions.</span> \n<h2><b>100ml Bottle Boxes Wholesale — Consistent Supply for Multi-SKU Product Ranges</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our 100ml bottle boxes wholesale program serves fragrance brands, skincare companies, pharmaceutical businesses, vape and e-liquid manufacturers, essential oil brands, and specialty food and beverage producers that need consistent, professionally branded 100ml bottle packaging at commercially competitive pricing. The wholesale program is built around the needs of businesses that produce multiple product SKUs in the 100ml format — requiring consistent box dimensions across their range while differentiating individual products through distinct print designs.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes for 100ml bottle boxes delivers competitive per-unit costs at the quantities that multi-SKU product businesses need to maintain efficient packaging inventory. Tiered pricing rewards volume with better economics, and our minimum wholesale quantities are set at levels accessible for independent brands building their product range alongside the more established businesses with significant ongoing 100ml packaging requirements.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Dimensional precision is the most critical technical requirement for 100ml bottle boxes, and it is where the quality of our packaging engineering makes the most meaningful practical difference. A bottle box that is even a millimeter too large allows the bottle to move during transit — risking breakage and creating an untidy presentation when the box is opened. A box that is too tight can make the bottle difficult to insert and remove, creating a poor user experience. Our technical team measures your specific bottle dimensions and engineers box dimensions that provide the precise, snug fit that protects perfectly and presents beautifully.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Bottle Boxes Custom Printed — Every Surface Tells Your Story</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The four side panels, the top, and the base of a 100ml bottle box provide a generous canvas for brand communication. Custom printed bottle boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes make full use of this surface area to tell your product story comprehensively — brand identity on the primary face panel, product details and benefits on the secondary panels, ingredient and usage information on the remaining panels, and brand and regulatory elements on the base. This 360-degree information architecture creates packaging that is both commercially compelling and fully regulatory compliant.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Print quality on 100ml bottle boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes is calibrated for the close-range, high-attention viewing conditions of premium retail and gifting contexts. Fragrance consumers, skincare shoppers, and vape product buyers all examine packaging closely before making their purchase decision — reading ingredient lists, comparing benefits claims, and assessing brand quality through the visual precision of the packaging. Our printing process delivers the sharpness, color accuracy, and finish quality that this level of consumer scrutiny demands.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Finishing options for custom 100ml bottle boxes include matte and gloss lamination, soft-touch lamination, spot UV coating, foil stamping in gold and silver, embossing and debossing, and full-color UV printing. The combination of finishing options chosen for a specific brand''s 100ml packaging is one of the most important brand positioning decisions in the product launch process, and our design team works with clients to select and combine finishing treatments that create the precise premium impression their brand positioning requires.</span> \n<h3><b>Interior Configuration Options</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The interior of a 100ml bottle box can be configured in several ways depending on the bottle format, fragility requirements, and presentation preferences. Cardboard inserts with a die-cut aperture that holds the bottle upright are the standard configuration — functional, clean, and available in custom colors. Foam inserts molded to the bottle dimensions provide maximum protection for high-value products such as premium fragrances and specialty skincare serums. Velvet or satin interior lining creates an ultra-premium presentation for luxury fragrance and cosmetic brands. Corrugated or honeycomb paper inserts offer an eco-friendly alternative to foam for brands committed to sustainable packaging across all components of their packaging system.</span> \n<h2><b>Printed 100ml Perfume Bottle Boxes Custom — Luxury Fragrance Packaging</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The fragrance industry is one of the most demanding sectors in all of consumer packaging. Fragrance consumers are highly sophisticated in their packaging aesthetic judgments — they spend significant money on products that are fundamentally about sensory experience, and they expect the packaging to communicate luxury, artistry, and exclusivity with precision. Printed 100ml perfume bottle boxes with custom design from Prime Packaging Boxes are produced to the standard that the fragrance industry demands, with premium materials, precision printing, and luxury finishing that frames your fragrance beautifully.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom perfume bottle box designs from Prime Packaging Boxes frequently incorporate some of the most premium finishing combinations available in packaging production. Deep matte lamination with foil stamping creates a classic fragrance aesthetic that communicates luxury through contrast and restraint. Soft-touch lamination with embossed brand details creates a tactile premium experience that fragrance consumers associate with quality. Full holographic and specialty foil treatments create the dramatic, attention-commanding visual effects that modern fragrance brands use to differentiate on crowded retail shelves and in online product photography.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The box for a 100ml fragrance product often serves as a long-term storage and display piece for consumers who keep their perfume bottles on dressing tables and vanities. This secondary display function means that perfume box packaging quality is judged repeatedly over time, not just at the moment of purchase — creating an ongoing brand impression in the consumer''s personal space that reinforces brand loyalty with every use of the fragrance.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom E-Liquid Bottle Boxes 100ml No Minimum — Professional Vape Packaging</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The e-liquid market uses the 100ml format as one of its most popular retail sizes, and the packaging box for e-liquid bottles carries specific requirements that differ from other 100ml product categories. Child-resistant packaging requirements in most US states mean that e-liquid 100ml boxes must incorporate compliant closure mechanisms. Regulatory information requirements include nicotine content disclosure, health warnings, and age restriction statements. And the highly competitive visual environment of vape retail requires bold, impactful designs that command attention in environments saturated with competing brand presentations.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom e-liquid bottle boxes in the 100ml format with no minimum order from Prime Packaging Boxes give vape brands and e-liquid manufacturers the ability to launch new products with professional compliant packaging without large minimum order commitments. Starting from as few as 50 boxes, vape brands can order custom printed 100ml e-liquid boxes with child-resistant closures, all required regulatory text, and their full brand design at pricing accessible for startup vape businesses and new product launches.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">E-liquid packaging design from Prime Packaging Boxes incorporates all required regulatory elements into brand designs that remain visually compelling and competitive. Our design team has extensive experience balancing the heavy regulatory information requirements of vape product packaging with the bold, graphic brand aesthetics that the vape market consistently rewards with consumer attention and purchase decisions.</span> \n<h2><b>100ml Serum Bottle Packaging Boxes Custom Printed — Premium Skincare Presentation</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Skincare serums are among the highest-value products in the beauty and wellness industry, and their packaging must communicate that value immediately and convincingly. 100ml serum bottle packaging boxes with custom printing from Prime Packaging Boxes are designed and produced to position skincare serums at the premium quality level their formulations and price points deserve — creating a first impression at the retail shelf or in the delivery box that immediately communicates investment, quality, and efficacy.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Premium skincare serum packaging from Prime Packaging Boxes typically combines clean, sophisticated design aesthetics with premium finishing treatments that communicate quality through both visual and tactile experience. White or off-white base colors with restrained color accents, precise typography, and foil or embossed logo details create the clinical-luxury aesthetic that premium skincare brands most commonly cultivate. Dark base colors with metallic printing create a bolder luxury positioning that works effectively for brands with a more fashion-forward brand personality.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Regulatory compliance for skincare serum packaging is managed through our design process, which ensures that all required INCI ingredient listings, usage instructions, warnings, and brand information are incorporated into the packaging design in a format that meets applicable cosmetic packaging regulations. Our design team is familiar with FDA cosmetic packaging requirements and works with skincare brands to ensure their 100ml serum packaging meets all applicable standards. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to discuss your 100ml bottle box requirements and request your custom wholesale quote today.</span>', 'Custom 100ml bottle boxes designed to snugly fit perfume, cosmetic, and pharmaceutical bottles. Premium cardboard with full-color printing, foil, and embossing options. Custom inserts for secure protection. Wholesale pricing, low MOQ for all brands.', 3, '/api/uploads/100ml-bottle-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/100ml-bottle-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/100ml-bottle-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/custom-100ml-bottle-boxes-with-logo.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom 100ml Bottle Boxes With Logo Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Custom 100ml bottle boxes for perfume, cosmetics &amp; pharma. Printed with your logo, all finishes available. Wholesale pricing, fast USA delivery. Get a free quote!', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.899Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.858Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (6, 'Custom Printed Candle Boxes', 'custom-printed-candle-boxes', '<h1>Candle Cloche Boxes That Make a Glass Dome Feel Like It Belongs in a Luxury Collection</h1>\n <p>The cloche candle format has moved from an Instagram niche to a genuine premium candle category — and for brands producing glass dome candles, the packaging challenge is significant. You have a fragile, visually stunning product that needs to arrive at a customer''s door undamaged, looking gift-ready, and commanding a price point that justifies the product''s visual and sensory quality. The box is the last thing standing between the cloche and a shipping disaster — and the first thing the customer sees when their order arrives.</p>\n <p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we produce custom candle cloche boxes for candle makers and home fragrance brands who''ve invested in a premium product format and need packaging that protects that investment and elevates the unboxing experience to match it.</p>\n\n <h2>The Structural Challenge: Building a Box Around a Glass Dome</h2>\n <p>A glass cloche is one of the more demanding objects to package safely. The dome shape creates unusual stress points under impact — it concentrates force rather than distributing it. The base is typically separate, which means you''re packaging two components that need to arrive correctly aligned. And the glass is often clear, which means any interior packing material visible through the box''s window panel (if it has one) needs to be as visually considered as the product itself.</p>\n <p>We build candle cloche boxes from rigid board — typically 1800gsm to 2000gsm depending on glass size and weight — with a fitted interior structure that holds the dome and base separately but adjacently during shipping. The dome sits in a custom die-cut foam or paperboard cradle that prevents it from tilting or shifting under carrier handling. The base is secured in its own positioned insert so it can''t migrate and strike the dome from the inside.</p>\n <p>Every dimension is custom to your specific cloche format — there are no "close enough" generic boxes in this category. A cloche that has half an inch of clearance inside its box is a cloche that will rattle, scratch, and arrive with chips or cracks. We take your exact measurements and build around them.</p>\n\n <h2>Custom Cloche Candle Packaging Printed — Exterior That Matches the Product</h2>\n <p>A premium cloche candle in a mediocre box is a brand mismatch that damages perceived value before the customer even sees the product. The exterior of your cloche box needs to communicate the same level of quality as the candle inside it — and that means construction and finish choices that go beyond standard folding carton printing.</p>\n <p>Popular finish options for cloche candle packaging include:</p>\n <ul>\n <li><strong>Soft-touch matte lamination</strong> — the tactile first impression of a soft-touch surface is immediately premium. It''s the same finish used by high-end cosmetics and luxury lifestyle brands, and it signals quality from the first moment of physical contact.</li>\n <li><strong>Hot foil stamping</strong> — gold or silver foil on your brand name, a botanical motif, or a decorative border element adds a genuine metallic dimension that reflects light and communicates luxury without requiring a fully glossy exterior.</li>\n <li><strong>Spot UV varnish</strong> — applied selectively to design elements on a matte base, spot UV creates a contrast between matte and gloss surfaces that looks sophisticated and dimensional in retail and unboxing photography.</li>\n <li><strong>Window panel</strong> — an acetate or PET window on the box front or lid lets buyers see the cloche before opening. For retail and gift shop environments, this is a strong selling feature because the visual product quality does the work of convincing the buyer before any copy or price tag has a chance to.</li>\n </ul>\n\n <h2>Luxury Candle Cloche Boxes Custom Logo USA — For Gift-First Brands</h2>\n <p>Cloche candles are purchased as gifts more often than almost any other candle format — birthday gifts, holiday gifts, housewarming presents, and luxury self-care purchases that the buyer intends to give or display prominently. The box for a cloche candle gift needs to arrive looking as if it was designed to be given, not just as a protective shipping container that got reused for gift-giving purposes.</p>\n <p>We produce two-piece rigid boxes with a fully custom interior — tissue bed, ribbon pull, printed scent card — that arrive ready to give without additional wrapping. For candle brands doing significant gift business online or through boutique retail, this format is the difference between a product that commands $45 and one that commands $75 on the same product value basis.</p>\n\n <h2>Glass Dome Candle Box Packaging Custom Printed — DTC Shipping Considerations</h2>\n <p>If you''re shipping cloche candles directly to consumers through your Shopify store or Etsy shop, your box needs to survive carrier handling that was not designed for fragile glass. Standard USPS and UPS handling drops packages from several feet. Sorting machines apply lateral compression. Stacking in delivery vehicles adds sustained weight from above.</p>\n <p>We test our candle cloche box designs against these scenarios using carrier-appropriate drop heights before finalizing the production spec. If a design fails in testing, we rebuild the internal support structure before it goes into production. You''ll never receive a complaint from a customer about a broken cloche if your packaging was built by us — because we don''t send a spec to production that we haven''t verified holds up in transit.</p>\n\n <h2>Custom Candle Cloche Boxes Wholesale No Minimum — Serving Indie Candle Brands at Every Stage</h2>\n <p>Starting at 100 units, our wholesale candle cloche box program gives indie makers access to premium packaging without the volume commitments of large packaging suppliers. As your order volumes grow, unit pricing improves — and your dieline on file means reordering is a quick conversation rather than a full reproof cycle.</p>\n <p>Standard production: 9 to 10 business days from artwork approval. Rush: 5 to 7 days. Free shipping to all 48 contiguous states.</p>\n <p>Visit our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product/luxury-candle-packaging/">candle boxes</a> for the full range of candle packaging formats, or browse <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/rigid-boxes/">rigid boxes</a> for premium construction options across our product line. Contact us at <a href="mailto:help@primepackagingboxes.com">help@primepackagingboxes.com</a> or <a href="tel:8187584076">818-758-4076</a>.</p>', 'Custom candle cloche boxes with elegant window display and full-color printing. Perfect for glass dome candle sets and luxury candle brands. Low MOQ, fast turnaround.', 4, '/api/uploads/candle-packaging-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/candle-packaging-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/candle-packaging-box.webp","/api/uploads/candle-packaging-boxes-uk.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Candle Cloche Boxes | Window Display Packaging | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom candle cloche boxes with window display and full-color printing. Low MOQ, fast USA delivery. Perfect for glass dome candle sets and luxury brands.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.901Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.909Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (8, 'Custom Wax Melt Boxes', 'custom-wax-melt-boxes', '<h2>Custom Wax Melt Boxes — High-Quality Custom Packaging & Wholesale Boxes</h2>
<p>When it comes to elevating your product''s market presence, <strong>Custom Wax Melt Boxes</strong> from Prime Packaging Boxes offers the ultimate combination of structural durability, eye-catching visual aesthetics, and brand protection. Designed specifically for retail, e-commerce, and promotional applications, our custom packaging solutions ensure your product stands out on store shelves and creates an unforgettable unboxing experience for your customers.</p>

<h3>Why Choose Custom Wax Melt Boxes for Your Brand?</h3>
<p>In today''s competitive retail landscape, consumers make split-second buying decisions based on packaging presentation. High-quality custom packaging communicates professionalism, product value, and care. Our Custom Wax Melt Boxes is engineered using premium food-safe, eco-friendly, and heavy-duty materials tailored to your exact product dimensions and branding requirements. Whether launching a new product line or upgrading your existing packaging, Prime Packaging Boxes delivers unmatched quality and precision.</p>

<h3>Product Highlights & Features</h3>
<div><h2>Custom Wax Melt Packaging Boxes</h2>
<p>Wax melts sell on sight — and our custom wax melt boxes are designed to make shoppers stop, pick up, and buy. With vivid full-color printing and windowed lids that showcase your wax melt shapes and colors, our packaging lets the product sell itself.</p>
<ul>
<li>Custom clamshell and snap-lid box styles for wax melt bars and shapes</li>
<li>Clear PET window options to display wax melt colors and designs</li>
<li>Food-safe board and inks — safe for all wax melt formulas</li>
<li>Bold full-color outside printing for your brand</li>
<li>Custom sizing for 2.5oz, 4oz, 6oz wax melt bars and scalloped shapes</li>
<li>Flat-pack design for easy storage and assembly</li>
<li>100-unit minimum — perfect for Etsy sellers and boutique brands</li>
</ul>
<p>Turn your wax melt display into a brand showcase. Prime Packaging builds wax melt boxes that stand out at craft fairs, on Etsy, and in retail stores. Get a free quote and proof today.</p></div>


<h3>Key Specifications & Customization Capabilities</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Fully Custom Dimensions:</strong> Tailor-made length, width, and depth to fit your products snugly without movement during shipping.</li>
  <li><strong>Vibrant Full-Color Printing:</strong> High-definition CMYK and PMS Pantone color matching printed inside and outside the box.</li>
  <li><strong>Premium Material Stocks:</strong> Choose from 100% recyclable Kraft, Solid Bleached Sulfate (SBS) cardstock, rigid chipboard, or durable fluted corrugated board.</li>
  <li><strong>Luxury Finishing Options:</strong> Enhance your design with Gold/Silver Foil Stamping, Spot UV Coating, Embossing, Debossing, Matte Lamination, or Soft-Touch Velvet finish.</li>
  <li><strong>Custom Protective Inserts:</strong> Optional die-cut foam, cardboard partitions, or molded pulp trays to hold delicate items securely.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Sustainability & Eco-Friendly Materials</h3>
<p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we are committed to environmental responsibility. Our Custom Wax Melt Boxes options include 100% recyclable, biodegradable, and post-consumer recycled paperboard materials. We use non-toxic, eco-friendly vegetable and soy-based inks that deliver vivid color reproduction while minimizing environmental impact.</p>

<h3>Wholesale Benefits & Ordering with Prime Packaging Boxes</h3>
<p>Partnering with Prime Packaging Boxes means getting direct factory-direct wholesale pricing with no hidden fees. We provide:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Low Minimum Order Quantity:</strong> Order as few as 100 units to start your custom packaging run.</li>
  <li><strong>Fast Turnaround Times:</strong> Standard production in 7-10 business days with rush options available.</li>
  <li><strong>Free Design Support:</strong> Work directly with our expert structural and graphic packaging designers at zero extra cost.</li>
  <li><strong>Free 3D Digital Proofing:</strong> Review your artwork on a realistic 3D model before manufacturing begins.</li>
  <li><strong>Free Shipping Across USA:</strong> Fast, reliable doorstep delivery included with every order.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h3>
<p><strong>Q: What is the minimum order quantity for Custom Wax Melt Boxes?</strong><br/>
A: Our minimum order quantity (MOQ) starts at just 100 units, making custom packaging accessible for startups and established brands alike.</p>
<p><strong>Q: Can I print inside the box?</strong><br/>
A: Yes! We offer full-color CMYK printing on both the interior and exterior surfaces of your Custom Wax Melt Boxes.</p>
<p><strong>Q: How do I get a free custom quote?</strong><br/>
A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'Custom wax melt and clamshell packaging with bold color printing and windowed lids to showcase your scents.', 4, '/api/uploads/wax-melt-scented-gift-packaging-box.webp', '["/api/uploads/wax-melt-scented-gift-packaging-box.webp","/api/uploads/printed-wax-melt-retail-packaging-box.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Custom Wax Melt Boxes | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Custom Wax Melt Boxes with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.905Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.142Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (7, 'Scented Candle Retail Packaging', 'scented-candle-retail-packaging', '<h1><b>Luxury Candle Box Packaging With Foam Insert Custom — Protect Your Candles and Elevate Your Brand</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Candle packaging does a job that very few other product packaging formats have to perform simultaneously — it must protect a fragile, heavy glass vessel throughout shipping and handling while also creating a luxury unboxing experience that reflects the premium nature of artisan candle products and justifies the pricing that quality candle brands command. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our luxury candle box packaging with foam insert custom printing achieves both objectives with precision, producing packaging that protects perfectly and presents beautifully<a href="https://www.primepackagingboxes.com/"> get quote now</a> .</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The candle market in the United States has grown significantly in recent years, driven by the expanding popularity of home fragrance, wellness, and self-care product categories. As the market has grown, so has the competition between candle brands — and packaging has emerged as one of the primary battlegrounds on which candle brands compete for customer attention, perceived quality, and premium pricing. Brands that invest in genuinely luxurious packaging consistently outperform competitors who treat packaging as an afterthought, building stronger customer loyalty and higher average transaction values.</span> \n<h2><b>Luxury Candle Boxes Wholesale — Premium Packaging at Commercial Scale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our luxury candle boxes wholesale program is designed for candle brands that have moved beyond the initial startup phase and are now producing and selling at volumes that require a reliable, consistent, commercially priced supply of premium packaging. Whether you are supplying specialty retailers, running a successful direct-to-consumer online business, or building a subscription candle service, our wholesale program delivers the quality and consistency your brand requires.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes makes luxury candle box packaging commercially viable for candle brands operating across a wide range of production scales. Our minimum wholesale quantities are set deliberately low to include candle brands that are still in early growth phases alongside established brands with significantly higher packaging requirements. Tiered pricing delivers better unit economics as volumes increase, rewarding brand growth with direct cost benefits.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Luxury wholesale candle boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes are available in standard sizes sized to accommodate the most popular candle vessel formats — including 8oz, 10oz, and 12oz jar candles, pillar candles, votive collections, and specialty candle formats — as well as fully custom dimensions engineered around your specific vessel measurements. Every size is available with your full custom printing, choice of exterior finish, and interior foam or card insert configuration.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Candle Packaging Boxes — Every Detail Tells Your Brand Story</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The most successful candle brands understand that their packaging is as much a part of their product as the wax, the fragrance, and the vessel itself. Custom candle packaging boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes give candle brands the canvas to tell their complete brand story — from the mood and aesthetic of the exterior design to the surprise and delight of a beautifully finished interior that rewards the customer''s decision to invest in your brand.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom candle packaging boxes are available in a comprehensive range of structural styles to suit different brand aesthetics and retail contexts. Rigid two-piece lift-off lid boxes create the most premium unboxing experience and are the preferred choice for luxury candle brands positioned at the higher end of the market. Rigid magnetic closure boxes combine the premium feel of rigid construction with the convenience and tactile satisfaction of a magnetic snap closure. Folding carton boxes offer a more economical premium option with a lighter environmental footprint. Sleeve boxes create an elegant sliding reveal effect that works beautifully for gift-oriented candle products.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Full custom printing on all interior and exterior surfaces allows you to create a complete branded environment within the box itself. Many of our candle brand clients print their brand story, ingredient and fragrance notes, candle care instructions, and social media handles on the interior box surfaces — creating additional touchpoints for brand communication that most customers genuinely appreciate and engage with.</span> \n<h3><b>Foam Insert Options for Candle Protection</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The foam insert is the unsung hero of candle packaging — the engineering solution that protects your fragile glass vessel through every stage of transit from your production facility to your customer''s hands. Prime Packaging Boxes offers several foam insert configurations for candle boxes. Die-cut polyethylene foam inserts are precision engineered to the exact dimensions of your candle vessel, holding it securely in position with no movement possible during shipping. EVA foam inserts offer a premium alternative with a finer cell structure and a more luxurious tactile quality that enhances the unboxing experience. Custom-color foam inserts in black, white, and a range of brand-matching colors are available for brands that want even the interior structural elements to reflect their brand aesthetic. Cardboard tray inserts offer a cost-effective alternative to foam for brands seeking to reduce packaging material weight and environmental impact.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Candle Gift Boxes Wholesale Small Quantity — For Seasonal Collections and Product Launches</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The candle market is highly seasonal, with significant sales peaks around key gifting occasions including Mother''s Day, Christmas, Valentine''s Day, and other major holidays. Candle brands that offer seasonal gift packaging consistently outperform those that rely on standard packaging year-round, because gift packaging dramatically increases the perceived gift-appropriateness of candles during peak gifting periods. Our custom candle gift boxes in wholesale small quantities make seasonal packaging commercially accessible even for brands with conservative seasonal inventory planning.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small quantity wholesale ordering of candle gift boxes allows brands to create seasonal packaging designs that feel genuinely fresh and occasion-specific without committing to quantities that create post-season inventory management challenges. Order a targeted quantity of Christmas gift boxes for your holiday sales period, a smaller run of Valentine''s Day gift boxes for the February peak, and a fresh design for your Mother''s Day collection — each in quantities precisely calibrated to your expected seasonal sales volume.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom candle gift boxes in small wholesale quantities from Prime Packaging Boxes are available with all the same customization and quality options as our standard wholesale program. Seasonal designs, custom interior printing, ribbon and tissue paper coordination, and specialty finishing options are all available regardless of order quantity. Our design team has particular expertise in creating candle gift packaging that converts at the gift-giving moment, and they are available to help you develop seasonal designs that maximize your holiday sales performance.</span> \n<h2><b>Rigid Candle Boxes Custom Logo Printed Wholesale — The Gold Standard in Candle Presentation</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Rigid box construction represents the absolute premium in candle packaging. Rigid candle boxes custom logo printed for wholesale supply from Prime Packaging Boxes deliver the heavyweight, structurally perfect packaging that luxury candle brands need to position their products credibly at premium price points and in premium retail environments. The substantial weight and rigidity of the box communicates quality before the lid is even opened — and that pre-opening quality perception directly influences the customer''s assessment of what they find inside.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom logo printed rigid candle boxes are manufactured from 2mm and 3mm greyboard chipboard wrapped in premium art paper, textured specialty papers, or luxury fabric materials. The thick board construction delivers the structural performance needed to protect glass candle vessels during shipping while creating the luxurious tactile experience that premium candle customers expect and for which they are willing to pay a genuine price premium.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom logo printing on rigid candle boxes is available in all the premium finishing options that luxury candle brands require. Foil-stamped logos on matte laminated boxes create a classic luxury aesthetic. Embossed logos on soft-touch laminated boxes deliver a sophisticated tactile brand experience. Full-color printed designs on gloss-laminated boxes create vibrant, high-impact visual packaging. The combination of rigid construction and premium printing and finishing creates packaging that many candle customers keep and reuse as storage or display boxes long after the candle is burned — extending your brand presence in their home indefinitely.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Candle Boxes for Small Candle Business — Professional Packaging From Day One</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Every successful candle brand started small. The decision to invest in professional custom packaging from the beginning of your candle business journey is one of the most commercially impactful choices you can make as a candle entrepreneur. Custom candle boxes for small candle businesses from Prime Packaging Boxes allow you to present your candles with the same professional quality as established brands — regardless of where you are in your business journey.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Professional packaging changes everything about how your candles are perceived and how they are priced. Candle customers are deeply attuned to the relationship between packaging quality and product quality — they use the packaging as a proxy for the candle inside. Beautiful, well-made packaging signals beautiful, well-made candles. It justifies the pricing that quality candle making deserves and attracts the customers who will pay it, keep buying, and enthusiastically recommend your brand to their networks.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our small business candle packaging program includes free design consultation, low minimum orders starting from 50 boxes, fast production turnaround, and dedicated customer service support throughout your ordering process. Whether you are selling at local markets, through an online store, via boutique retail partners, or directly through social media, Prime Packaging Boxes produces the candle packaging that makes your business look as professional and premium as your candles genuinely are. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to get started today.</span>', 'Showcase your candles in custom luxury packaging with foil stamping, embossing, and spot UV options. Rigid or kraft board construction for premium protection. Ideal for candle brands, gift sets, and retail shelves. Wholesale pricing, low MOQ available.', 4, '/api/uploads/scented-candle-retail-packaging-box.webp', '["/api/uploads/scented-candle-retail-packaging-box.webp","/api/uploads/wax-melt-scented-gift-packaging-box.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Luxury Candle Box Packaging With Foam Insert Custom | Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order luxury candle box packaging with foam insert custom printed. Rigid boxes, gift sets, small quantity wholesale. Perfect for candle brands of all sizes — Prime Packaging Boxes USA.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.903Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.808Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (11, 'Custom Coffee Bags', 'custom-coffee-bags', '<h1><b>Kraft Coffee Bags With Degassing Valve Custom Logo — Freshness Engineering for Serious Coffee Brands</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Freshness is the foundation of great coffee. From the moment coffee beans are roasted, they begin a gradual process of oxidation and degassing that progressively diminishes the complex aromatics and flavor compounds that make exceptional coffee extraordinary. The packaging that carries your roasted coffee from your roastery to your customer''s cup plays a critical role in preserving those precious qualities — and at Prime Packaging Boxes, our kraft coffee bags with degassing valve and custom logo are engineered specifically to do that job as well as it can possibly be done.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The degassing valve is the most important functional element of specialty coffee packaging. Freshly roasted coffee releases significant volumes of carbon dioxide for days after roasting — a process that would cause a sealed bag to inflate and potentially burst if the gas could not escape. The one-way degassing valve allows CO2 to exit the bag while preventing oxygen from entering, maintaining the protective modified atmosphere inside the bag that slows oxidation and preserves the coffee''s flavor and aroma profile for weeks or even months after roasting. For specialty coffee brands competing on freshness, the degassing valve is not optional — it is essential.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Coffee Bags Wholesale — Scalable Packaging for Growing Roasters</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom coffee bags wholesale program serves specialty coffee roasters, coffee brands, and beverage companies that need consistent, high-quality branded coffee packaging at commercially viable pricing. The wholesale program is built around the specific production requirements and operational patterns of the coffee industry — including the need for fast reorder turnaround to keep pace with regular roasting schedules and the importance of packaging consistency for maintaining brand identity across all retail and direct-to-consumer channels.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes for coffee bags is structured to deliver competitive per-unit costs at the volumes that growing coffee roasters generate. Our tiered pricing model rewards volume with better economics, and our minimum wholesale quantities are set at levels that include the small-batch and micro-roaster segment that represents the most dynamic and quality-focused part of the specialty coffee industry. We understand that great coffee comes in all sizes — from three-kilogram micro-roasters to multi-hundred-kilogram regional roasters — and our wholesale program serves the full spectrum.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Coffee bag specifications in our wholesale program cover the complete range of bag formats, sizes, valve types, and closure options that the specialty coffee market requires. 250g, 500g, and 1kg bag sizes are the most common retail formats, and we stock these sizes for fast-turnaround production. Custom sizes are available for coffee brands with specific retail weight requirements or for wholesale and foodservice bag formats that differ from standard retail sizes.</span> \n<h2><b>Stand Up Coffee Bags With Valve — The Retail Standard for Specialty Coffee</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The stand-up pouch format has become the dominant packaging format for specialty coffee retail, and for compelling reasons. Stand-up coffee bags present beautifully on retail shelves and café counters, maximizing the visible brand presence of the package and creating an attractive, professional retail display without special merchandising equipment. The flat base gusset that enables the stand-up function also creates additional packaging surface area for brand information, origin details, and tasting notes that specialty coffee consumers actively seek and value.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our stand-up coffee bags with degassing valve from Prime Packaging Boxes combine the commercial advantages of the stand-up format with the freshness-preserving performance of our multi-barrier film construction and precision one-way degassing valve. The result is a coffee bag that looks excellent on the shelf, protects the coffee perfectly from the day of roasting to the day of the last brew, and carries your brand identity with the professional quality that specialty coffee consumers associate with serious roasters.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom printing on stand-up coffee bags from Prime Packaging Boxes is available in full rotogravure or digital printing that reproduces your brand design with vivid accuracy across the full surface area of the bag. Specialty coffee bag designs often incorporate a significant amount of brand storytelling — origin information, altitude and processing method details, flavor profile descriptions, and roaster narrative — and our printing capabilities support the detailed, text-rich designs that communicate all of this information clearly and attractively.</span> \n<h3><b>Valve Types and Placement Options</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes offers several degassing valve options for coffee bags to match different roasting profiles, bag construction requirements, and brand aesthetic preferences. Standard one-way pressure relief valves in silver or black are the most widely used option — reliable, proven, and available in round and flat profile formats. Recessed valve options for brands that prefer a cleaner exterior bag appearance without the visible valve protrusion. Micro-perforated valve alternatives for bags where valve placement creates structural challenges. Valve placement is fully customizable — front panel, back panel, or gusset positioning depending on your bag design and roasting timeline preferences. Our technical team will advise on the optimal valve specification for your roasting schedule and bag construction.</span> \n<h2><b>Kraft Coffee Bags With Degassing Valve Custom Logo — The Natural Choice for Artisan Roasters</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Kraft paper coffee bags have become the aesthetic signature of the artisan coffee movement — communicating authenticity, craftsmanship, and environmental responsibility in a way that synthetic or bleached white packaging never achieves. The warm, natural brown of kraft paper creates an immediate and powerful visual association with the honest, quality-focused values that define the best specialty coffee brands, and it provides a beautiful printing surface for the origin stories, flavor notes, and brand narratives that create genuine connections with coffee-literate consumers.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our kraft coffee bags with custom logo and degassing valve combine the authentic aesthetic of natural kraft with the multi-layer barrier film construction that genuine freshness preservation requires. The outer surface of natural or brown kraft paper carries your brand design beautifully, while the inner barrier layers — aluminum foil, polyethylene, and other barrier films — provide the oxygen, moisture, and UV protection that keeps your carefully roasted coffee at its best from your roastery to your customer''s grinder.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom logo application on kraft coffee bags from Prime Packaging Boxes is available in a range of print styles to suit different brand aesthetics. Minimalist single-color logo treatments in black or dark brown create a clean, restrained artisan aesthetic. Two and three-color treatments add brand color accents and additional design elements. Full-color printing accommodates complex multi-color designs, photographic elements, and illustrated artwork that many specialty coffee brands incorporate into their packaging to tell the story of their coffee and their roastery.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Coffee Bags for Small Roasters No Minimum — Professional Packaging From Your First Batch</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The specialty coffee industry is built on the passion and craft of small, independent roasters who approach their work with the same seriousness and skill as any other artisan food producer. These small roasters often produce exceptional coffee but struggle to access the custom branded packaging that would allow them to present their work with the professional credibility it deserves. Our custom coffee bags for small roasters with no minimum order from Prime Packaging Boxes change that — making professional branded coffee packaging accessible from the very first production batch.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Starting from as few as 50 bags, small and micro-roasters can order fully custom printed kraft coffee bags with degassing valve, ziplock closure, and their complete brand design at pricing that works for a small roasting operation. No minimum order means you can order exactly the quantity of bags your current roasting volume requires, avoiding the inventory management challenges and capital commitment of ordering far more packaging than you can use within a reasonable timeframe.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Many of our most successful specialty coffee packaging clients began as small roasters ordering 50 or 100-bag batches, built their customer base through farmers markets, specialty retailers, and direct online sales, and then scaled to regular wholesale reorders as their roasting volumes and brand recognition grew. Prime Packaging Boxes supports that entire journey with consistent quality, attentive service, and packaging that represents your roastery professionally at every stage of your growth. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to get started with your custom coffee bag order today.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Side Gusset Coffee Bags Printed Wholesale USA — For High-Volume Roasters</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Side gusset coffee bags — also called quad-seal bags or block-bottom bags — are the preferred packaging format for specialty coffee brands selling larger quantities, whole-bean coffee for home brewing enthusiasts, and premium whole-bag gifting products. The four-sided gusset construction creates a rigid, self-supporting bag that stands upright on any surface, maximizes printable surface area across all four sides and the base panel, and provides a substantial, premium feel that communicates the quality of a serious coffee brand.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom printed side gusset coffee bags for wholesale in the USA from Prime Packaging Boxes are produced with the full multi-barrier film construction, one-way degassing valve, and ziplock reclosure options that specialty coffee packaging requires. Wholesale pricing for side gusset bags delivers the per-unit economics that high-volume roasters need to maintain healthy packaging cost ratios as their production scales. Our US-based wholesale supply means faster lead times, no import complications, and the quality consistency that professional coffee brands depend on for their retail distribution and direct-to-consumer channels.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Side gusset coffee bags from Prime Packaging Boxes are available in 250g, 500g, 1kg, and 2kg retail sizes, with custom sizes available for foodservice, hospitality, and bulk wholesale formats. Full custom printing on all four side panels and the base creates the most comprehensive brand presentation available in flexible coffee packaging — ideal for brands that use their coffee bag as a primary marketing and storytelling vehicle at the retail shelf and through online product photography.</span>', 'Custom coffee bags with one-way degassing valves and multi-layer barrier film for maximum freshness. Fully printed with your brand design in matte or gloss finish. Available in various sizes for whole bean or ground coffee. Wholesale pricing, low MOQ.', 7, '/api/uploads/coffee-bags.webp', '["/api/uploads/coffee-bags.webp","/api/uploads/custom-coffee-bags-with-logo.webp","/api/uploads/custom-coffee-bags-with-logo-1.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Kraft Coffee Bags With Degassing Valve Custom Logo | Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order kraft coffee bags with degassing valve and custom logo. Stand-up, side gusset, no minimum for small roasters. Wholesale USA — Prime Packaging Boxes, fast turnaround.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.909Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.849Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (67, 'kawish bhatti', 'kawish-bhatti', '', '', 2, NULL, '[]', false, true, 100, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-11T18:09:32.133Z', '2026-08-11T18:09:32.133Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (10, 'Custom Breakfast Cereal Boxes', 'custom-breakfast-cereal-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Printed Cereal Boxes for Small Food Brands — Stand Out on Every Breakfast Table</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The breakfast cereal aisle is one of the most visually competitive retail environments in any supermarket. Dozens of products compete simultaneously for consumer attention in a category where brand recognition, visual impact, and packaging communication are primary purchase drivers. For small food brands entering this competitive space, the challenge is presenting their genuinely excellent product in packaging that commands the same shelf presence as established cereal giants — and doing it with the production economics that a small food business can sustain. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom printed cereal boxes for small food brands are produced to solve exactly that challenge.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The specialty and natural breakfast food market has created significant opportunities for small food brands that offer genuinely better ingredients, more authentic production methods, and more honest nutritional profiles than mass-market cereal alternatives. Consumers who are willing to pay a premium for clean-label, organic, and specialty breakfast products make their purchase decisions heavily based on packaging quality — a premium product in mediocre packaging struggles to command the premium price it deserves, while the same product in professional, well-designed packaging finds its natural price point much more easily.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Cereal Boxes Wholesale — Reliable Supply for Growing Food Brands</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom cereal boxes wholesale program serves specialty food companies, natural food brands, organic breakfast food producers, granola and muesli makers, and food entrepreneurs who need consistent, professionally branded breakfast packaging at commercially competitive pricing. The wholesale program covers the full range of cereal box sizes, board weights, and customization options in a pricing structure that makes professional branded cereal packaging commercially viable for small and growing food businesses.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes for cereal boxes reflects the food packaging production requirements — food-safe materials, regulatory compliance, and the structural performance needed for retail shelf display — while delivering competitive per-unit costs that work within the margin structures of specialty food businesses. Tiered pricing rewards volume with better unit economics, and our minimum wholesale quantities are set at levels that include the small-batch food brands that are still building their retail distribution alongside the more established brands with significant ongoing packaging requirements.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Food safety is the non-negotiable foundation of all our cereal box production. All materials used in our cereal boxes meet FDA food contact standards for indirect food contact packaging. Board weights are specified to provide adequate structural rigidity for retail shelf display and stacking without unnecessary material use. Sealing specifications ensure that boxes maintain their food safety integrity through the full retail and consumer use lifecycle. Our quality management process documents compliance with all applicable food packaging standards for every production run.</span> \n<h2><b>Branded Cereal Packaging Boxes — Communicate Your Brand''s Difference</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small food brands win in the specialty breakfast market by being genuinely different from the mass-market alternatives — cleaner ingredients, more authentic production, better nutritional profiles, more compelling taste experiences. Branded cereal packaging boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes give these brands the visual platform to communicate their difference compellingly at the retail shelf, where the packaging is often the only communication tool available to influence the purchase decision.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom cereal box design from Prime Packaging Boxes works with your brand identity to create packaging that tells your brand''s specific story effectively. Natural food brands with clean-label positions benefit from designs that communicate transparency, naturalness, and ingredient quality through honest, uncluttered layouts and natural color palettes. Premium granola and muesli brands with strong provenance stories benefit from designs that incorporate origin details, production method descriptions, and the brand personality elements that create emotional connection with quality-conscious breakfast consumers. Kids breakfast brands benefit from bold, colorful, playful designs that appeal to children while communicating the nutritional credentials that parent purchasers require.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The back and side panels of a cereal box are communication opportunities that small food brands consistently underutilize. Nutritional information, ingredient lists, recipe suggestions, brand story content, and consumer engagement calls-to-action on the back and side panels turn the cereal box into a brand communication tool that continues working throughout the consumer''s time with the product — building brand affinity and loyalty through every breakfast interaction.</span> \n<h3><b>Cereal Box Sizes and Formats</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes produces custom cereal boxes in all standard retail sizes and in fully custom dimensions for brands with specific weight or retail shelf requirements. Small cereal boxes in the 150g to 300g range are popular for premium granolas, specialty grain cereals, and trial or single-serve formats. Standard medium boxes in the 400g to 600g range are the most common retail format across the breakfast cereal category. Large family-size boxes in the 750g to 1kg range serve value-positioned and high-consumption household formats. Minipack and single-serve boxes for hospitality, airline, and premium convenience formats are available in custom sizes. All size options are available with food-safe inner bag liners for products that require barrier protection against moisture and oxygen.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Breakfast Cereal Boxes With Logo Wholesale — Build Retail Recognition</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Retail recognition — the immediate visual identification of your brand by a consumer moving through the breakfast aisle — is one of the most commercially valuable assets a food brand can build. Custom breakfast cereal boxes with logo in wholesale quantities from Prime Packaging Boxes help small food brands build that recognition through consistent, professionally produced branded packaging that creates the repeated visual impressions across multiple retail locations and purchase occasions that build strong brand recognition over time.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Logo consistency across every wholesale reorder is managed through our archived specification system. Every production run of your branded cereal boxes is quality-checked against your approved reference to ensure that your logo, brand colors, and all other identity elements are reproduced with complete accuracy and consistency. Retail buyers who stock your product across multiple store locations need packaging that looks identical across every unit on every shelf — our quality management process ensures that standard is always met.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale ordering of custom logo cereal boxes also supports the retail buyer relationship building that is essential for growing food brands seeking expanded retail distribution. When a retail buyer reviews your brand for potential listing, professional, consistently produced wholesale packaging signals the operational maturity and supply chain reliability that retail buyers require from their food brand partners. Premium packaging demonstrates that your brand takes its retail presentation seriously — a signal that buyers respond to positively.</span> \n<h2><b>Eco Friendly Cereal Boxes Custom Logo No Minimum — Natural Food Deserves Natural Packaging</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The natural and organic food market is founded on values of environmental responsibility, honest ingredient sourcing, and sustainable production practices. Consumers who choose organic and natural breakfast foods expect the packaging to reflect those same values — packaging that is itself natural, sustainable, and environmentally responsible. Our eco friendly cereal boxes with custom logo and no minimum order from Prime Packaging Boxes give natural food brands packaging that is genuinely aligned with their core brand values.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our eco-friendly cereal boxes are manufactured from FSC-certified recycled and sustainably sourced board materials, printed with water-based inks, and available without plastic lamination for brands that want fully recyclable packaging across every component. The natural kraft and recycled board aesthetics that characterize our eco-friendly cereal range communicate authenticity and environmental responsibility in a way that resonates powerfully with the natural food consumer base.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">No minimum order eco cereal boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes make sustainable food packaging accessible for small-batch natural food brands from their very first production run. Starting from as few as 50 boxes, natural food entrepreneurs can launch their products in fully eco-credentialed custom branded packaging without large upfront inventory commitments. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to explore our cereal packaging range and get your custom quote today.</span>', 'Custom breakfast cereal boxes in food-safe SBS board with vibrant full-color printing. FDA-compliant, inner liner options available for freshness. Perfect for cereal brands, health food startups, and private label. Wholesale pricing, low MOQ.', 6, '/api/uploads/breakfast-cereal-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/breakfast-cereal-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/breakfast-cereal-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/breakfast-cereal-boxes-1.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Printed Cereal Boxes for Small Food Brands | Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom printed cereal boxes for small food brands. Wholesale pricing, eco-friendly, granola bar boxes, low MOQ. Branded food packaging done right — Prime Packaging Boxes USA.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.907Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.862Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (12, 'Custom Matcha & Tea Powder Bags', 'custom-matcha-powder-bags', '<h2>Custom Matcha & Tea Powder Bags — High-Quality Custom Packaging & Wholesale Boxes</h2>
<p>When it comes to elevating your product''s market presence, <strong>Custom Matcha & Tea Powder Bags</strong> from Prime Packaging Boxes offers the ultimate combination of structural durability, eye-catching visual aesthetics, and brand protection. Designed specifically for retail, e-commerce, and promotional applications, our custom packaging solutions ensure your product stands out on store shelves and creates an unforgettable unboxing experience for your customers.</p>

<h3>Why Choose Custom Matcha & Tea Powder Bags for Your Brand?</h3>
<p>In today''s competitive retail landscape, consumers make split-second buying decisions based on packaging presentation. High-quality custom packaging communicates professionalism, product value, and care. Our Custom Matcha & Tea Powder Bags is engineered using premium food-safe, eco-friendly, and heavy-duty materials tailored to your exact product dimensions and branding requirements. Whether launching a new product line or upgrading your existing packaging, Prime Packaging Boxes delivers unmatched quality and precision.</p>

<h3>Product Highlights & Features</h3>
<div><h2>Custom Matcha & Tea Powder Packaging Bags</h2>
<p>Present your matcha, ceremonial green tea, and adaptogen powders in packaging that communicates premium quality. Our custom stand-up pouches are designed for the wellness and specialty tea market — with the freshness barriers, resealable closures, and refined printing that tea lovers expect.</p>
<ul>
<li>Stand-up pouch design for stable shelf display</li>
<li>Matte kraft and foil laminate finishes for premium on-shelf look</li>
<li>Clear window option to show off the vibrant green of matcha</li>
<li>Resealable zipper to preserve powder freshness</li>
<li>Custom sizing for 30g, 100g, 200g, and 500g fills</li>
<li>Food-safe interior barrier film — protects against moisture and UV light</li>
<li>Full-color printing on front, back, and gusset</li>
<li>100-unit minimum for small-batch tea and wellness brands</li>
</ul>
<p>From ceremonial-grade matcha to adaptogen blends, Prime Packaging builds stand-up pouches that tell your brand''s wellness story. Get a free design proof for your tea powder packaging today.</p></div>


<h3>Key Specifications & Customization Capabilities</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Fully Custom Dimensions:</strong> Tailor-made length, width, and depth to fit your products snugly without movement during shipping.</li>
  <li><strong>Vibrant Full-Color Printing:</strong> High-definition CMYK and PMS Pantone color matching printed inside and outside the box.</li>
  <li><strong>Premium Material Stocks:</strong> Choose from 100% recyclable Kraft, Solid Bleached Sulfate (SBS) cardstock, rigid chipboard, or durable fluted corrugated board.</li>
  <li><strong>Luxury Finishing Options:</strong> Enhance your design with Gold/Silver Foil Stamping, Spot UV Coating, Embossing, Debossing, Matte Lamination, or Soft-Touch Velvet finish.</li>
  <li><strong>Custom Protective Inserts:</strong> Optional die-cut foam, cardboard partitions, or molded pulp trays to hold delicate items securely.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Sustainability & Eco-Friendly Materials</h3>
<p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we are committed to environmental responsibility. Our Custom Matcha & Tea Powder Bags options include 100% recyclable, biodegradable, and post-consumer recycled paperboard materials. We use non-toxic, eco-friendly vegetable and soy-based inks that deliver vivid color reproduction while minimizing environmental impact.</p>

