A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'Stand-up kraft pouches for matcha, ceremonial teas, and adaptogen powders. Windowed and sealed options.', 7, '/api/uploads/custom-matcha-powder-packaging-bag.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-matcha-powder-packaging-bag.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Custom Matcha & Tea Powder Bags | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Custom Matcha & Tea Powder Bags with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.910Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.144Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (15, 'Custom Burger & Food Boxes', 'custom-burger-food-boxes', '<h2>Custom Burger & Food Boxes — High-Quality Custom Packaging & Wholesale Boxes</h2>
<p>When it comes to elevating your product''s market presence, <strong>Custom Burger & Food Boxes</strong> from Prime Packaging Boxes offers the ultimate combination of structural durability, eye-catching visual aesthetics, and brand protection. Designed specifically for retail, e-commerce, and promotional applications, our custom packaging solutions ensure your product stands out on store shelves and creates an unforgettable unboxing experience for your customers.</p>

<h3>Why Choose Custom Burger & Food Boxes for Your Brand?</h3>
<p>In today''s competitive retail landscape, consumers make split-second buying decisions based on packaging presentation. High-quality custom packaging communicates professionalism, product value, and care. Our Custom Burger & Food Boxes is engineered using premium food-safe, eco-friendly, and heavy-duty materials tailored to your exact product dimensions and branding requirements. Whether launching a new product line or upgrading your existing packaging, Prime Packaging Boxes delivers unmatched quality and precision.</p>

<h3>Product Highlights & Features</h3>
<div><h2>Custom Food Boxes — Restaurants, Ghost Kitchens & Food Brands</h2>
<p>Your food brand is defined by every touchpoint — including the box it comes in. Our custom food boxes are manufactured on FDA-compliant, food-safe board with grease-resistant coatings, making them ideal for restaurants, ghost kitchens, food trucks, and specialty food brands.</p>
<ul>
<li>FDA-compliant food-safe board with direct food contact coatings</li>
<li>Grease-resistant coating to keep boxes looking fresh for delivery</li>
<li>Custom sizes for burgers, sandwiches, hot dogs, fries, and specialty foods</li>
<li>Full-color outside branding — turn every delivery into a brand impression</li>
<li>Ventilation hole options for fried and steamed items</li>
<li>Clamshell, tuck-top, and sleeve styles available</li>
<li>Suitable for dine-in, takeout, delivery, and ghost kitchen operations</li>
<li>100-unit minimum — affordable entry point for new food brands</li>
</ul>
<p>Make your food packaging as memorable as your menu. Prime Packaging builds custom food boxes for some of the fastest-growing restaurant and food delivery brands in the USA. Get a free quote today.</p></div>


<h3>Key Specifications & Customization Capabilities</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Fully Custom Dimensions:</strong> Tailor-made length, width, and depth to fit your products snugly without movement during shipping.</li>
  <li><strong>Vibrant Full-Color Printing:</strong> High-definition CMYK and PMS Pantone color matching printed inside and outside the box.</li>
  <li><strong>Premium Material Stocks:</strong> Choose from 100% recyclable Kraft, Solid Bleached Sulfate (SBS) cardstock, rigid chipboard, or durable fluted corrugated board.</li>
  <li><strong>Luxury Finishing Options:</strong> Enhance your design with Gold/Silver Foil Stamping, Spot UV Coating, Embossing, Debossing, Matte Lamination, or Soft-Touch Velvet finish.</li>
  <li><strong>Custom Protective Inserts:</strong> Optional die-cut foam, cardboard partitions, or molded pulp trays to hold delicate items securely.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Sustainability & Eco-Friendly Materials</h3>
<p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we are committed to environmental responsibility. Our Custom Burger & Food Boxes options include 100% recyclable, biodegradable, and post-consumer recycled paperboard materials. We use non-toxic, eco-friendly vegetable and soy-based inks that deliver vivid color reproduction while minimizing environmental impact.</p>

<h3>Wholesale Benefits & Ordering with Prime Packaging Boxes</h3>
<p>Partnering with Prime Packaging Boxes means getting direct factory-direct wholesale pricing with no hidden fees. We provide:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Low Minimum Order Quantity:</strong> Order as few as 100 units to start your custom packaging run.</li>
  <li><strong>Fast Turnaround Times:</strong> Standard production in 7-10 business days with rush options available.</li>
  <li><strong>Free Design Support:</strong> Work directly with our expert structural and graphic packaging designers at zero extra cost.</li>
  <li><strong>Free 3D Digital Proofing:</strong> Review your artwork on a realistic 3D model before manufacturing begins.</li>
  <li><strong>Free Shipping Across USA:</strong> Fast, reliable doorstep delivery included with every order.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h3>
<p><strong>Q: What is the minimum order quantity for Custom Burger & Food Boxes?</strong><br/>
A: Our minimum order quantity (MOQ) starts at just 100 units, making custom packaging accessible for startups and established brands alike.</p>
<p><strong>Q: Can I print inside the box?</strong><br/>
A: Yes! We offer full-color CMYK printing on both the interior and exterior surfaces of your Custom Burger & Food Boxes.</p>
<p><strong>Q: How do I get a free custom quote?</strong><br/>
A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'FDA-compliant burger and food boxes for restaurants, ghost kitchens, and food trucks. Grease-resistant, any size.', 9, '/api/uploads/burger-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/burger-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/burger-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/custom-burger-boxes-with-logo.webp"]', true, true, 100, 'Custom Custom Burger & Food Boxes | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Custom Burger & Food Boxes with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.917Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.146Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (9, 'Custom CBD Oil Boxes', 'custom-cbd-oil-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom CBD Oil Dropper Bottle Boxes Wholesale — Professional Packaging for a Competitive Market</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The CBD market in the United States is one of the fastest-growing and most competitive consumer product categories of the past decade. As the market has matured and consumer sophistication has grown, packaging has become an increasingly important differentiator between CBD brands competing for the same health-conscious, quality-focused consumer base. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom CBD oil dropper bottle boxes wholesale give CBD brands the professional, compliant, and visually compelling packaging they need to stand out on dispensary shelves, in online search results, and in the unboxing experience that increasingly drives brand loyalty in this category.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">CBD oil dropper bottles present a specific packaging challenge — they are relatively small in physical dimensions but high in perceived and actual value, they contain a health and wellness product that benefits from premium, trust-building presentation, and they are subject to specific regulatory requirements in many states that must be addressed in the packaging design. Prime Packaging Boxes has extensive experience producing packaging for the CBD and hemp wellness category, and our team understands both the aesthetic and the regulatory requirements that effective CBD packaging must satisfy.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom CBD Boxes Wholesale — Scalable Supply for Growing CBD Brands</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom CBD boxes wholesale program is designed for CBD brands that are building consistent sales volumes and need a reliable, professionally managed packaging supply relationship. Whether you are a single-product CBD tincture brand, a multi-product wellness company with a range of CBD formulations, or a white-label CBD operation producing for multiple retail clients, our wholesale program delivers the quality, consistency, and pricing that serious CBD businesses require.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes is structured to support CBD brands at the growth stages where packaging investment makes the most commercial sense. Our tiered pricing delivers better unit economics as volumes increase, with meaningful pricing improvements available as order quantities move through standard wholesale thresholds. Even at minimum wholesale quantities, our pricing is competitive enough to work within the margin structures of CBD brands operating in a competitive market where product costs, testing costs, and marketing costs all compete for margin share.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Consistency across reorders is a critical requirement for CBD brands building brand recognition with retail buyers and consumers. Your packaging specification is archived in our production management system from your first approved order, ensuring that every subsequent reorder precisely matches your approved reference in all material, print, and structural dimensions. Retail buyers who have accepted your product to shelf based on its packaging presentation need to see that same presentation consistently on every replenishment delivery.</span> \n<h2><b>Child Resistant CBD Packaging Wholesale — Regulatory Compliance Without Compromising Brand Presentation</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Child-resistant packaging is a legal requirement for CBD products in a growing number of US states, and it is an increasingly important consumer trust signal even in markets where it is not yet legally mandated. Brands that proactively adopt child-resistant packaging demonstrate a commitment to responsible product stewardship that builds consumer confidence and facilitates access to retail channels that require or prefer compliant packaging.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our child resistant CBD packaging wholesale program provides CBD brands with packaging that meets child-resistance standards through certified closure mechanisms and packaging structures, while still delivering the premium brand presentation that positions CBD products effectively in the wellness and health product marketplace. Compliant packaging does not have to be plain or uninspiring — our design and engineering team creates child-resistant packaging structures that incorporate your full custom brand design and all required regulatory labeling without sacrificing visual appeal.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Child-resistant closure mechanisms available for our CBD packaging include certified CRC (Child Resistant Closure) cap combinations for dropper bottle presentation boxes, locking tuck structures for folding carton applications, and certified push-and-turn closure systems for tube and container packaging formats. Our technical team will advise on the most appropriate compliance mechanism for your specific product format and target retail channel.</span> \n<h3><b>Required Labeling Elements for CBD Packaging</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">CBD product packaging in the United States must typically include a range of regulatory and consumer safety information that varies by state and product format. Common required elements include CBD content per serving and per container, full ingredient list and extraction method disclosure, batch number and COA (Certificate of Analysis) QR code or reference, allergen information and warnings, child-safety warnings where applicable, THC content disclosure and compliance statement, and recommended usage instructions. Our design team works with CBD brands to incorporate all required information into packaging designs that remain visually compelling and brand-consistent while satisfying all applicable regulatory requirements.</span> \n<h2><b>Child Resistant CBD Packaging Boxes Custom Printed — Compliance Meets Brand Excellence</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The challenge of creating child resistant CBD packaging boxes with custom printing that genuinely reflects a brand''s premium positioning is one that many CBD companies struggle to solve. Standard compliant packaging solutions often look generic, clinical, and uninspiring — exactly the wrong qualities for a brand competing in the premium wellness space where brand aesthetic and product presentation are primary purchase motivators.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes has invested in the design engineering and production capabilities to produce custom printed child-resistant CBD packaging that is both fully compliant with applicable regulations and genuinely beautiful as a brand expression. Our approach begins with the compliance requirement and engineers the aesthetics around it — rather than trying to retrofit compliance mechanisms onto packaging that was designed without them in mind.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom printed child-resistant CBD boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes are available with full-color exterior printing, premium lamination and finishing options, interior printing for brand storytelling and product information, and all required regulatory text integrated cleanly into the overall design. The result is packaging that passes compliance requirements and impresses retail buyers and consumers with its professionalism and visual quality simultaneously.</span> \n<h2><b>Eco Friendly CBD Product Packaging With No Minimum Order — Sustainability in the Wellness Space</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The consumer base for CBD and hemp wellness products is disproportionately composed of health-conscious, environmentally aware individuals who care deeply about the sustainability credentials of the brands they choose to support. Eco friendly CBD product packaging with no minimum order from Prime Packaging Boxes gives CBD brands the ability to align their packaging choices with the environmental values of their customer base — from the very first order, without large upfront commitments.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our eco-friendly CBD packaging range uses FSC-certified cardboard and kraft paper materials, water-based printing inks, and biodegradable or recyclable lamination options to create packaging that is both genuinely sustainable and genuinely premium. The natural kraft aesthetic of our eco-friendly range communicates authenticity and naturalness — qualities that resonate powerfully with CBD consumers who are drawn to plant-based wellness products precisely because they value natural, responsible approaches to health and wellbeing.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">No minimum order on eco-friendly CBD packaging makes it practically accessible for startup CBD brands, brands transitioning from conventional to sustainable packaging, and brands creating small-run seasonal or limited edition product packaging. Order as few as 50 boxes, test your eco packaging with your customer base, gather their response, and scale with confidence when your market feedback confirms the commercial value of your sustainability investment.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom CBD Tincture Boxes With Logo Bulk Order — Build Brand Recognition at Scale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">CBD tinctures — oils delivered in dropper bottles — represent one of the most popular and commercially significant product formats in the CBD category. The packaging for tincture products needs to accomplish several objectives simultaneously: protect the dropper bottle from breakage during shipping and retail handling, present the product attractively at the retail shelf and in online product photography, carry all required regulatory and consumer information, and communicate the brand''s quality positioning and personality compellingly to a sophisticated consumer audience.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom CBD tincture boxes with logo in bulk orders from Prime Packaging Boxes are designed and produced to satisfy all of these requirements with equal effectiveness. Our tincture box range covers the standard dropper bottle sizes most commonly used in the CBD industry — 10ml, 15ml, 30ml, and 60ml formats — as well as custom dimensions for brands with distinctive bottle shapes or sizes that require bespoke packaging engineering.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Bulk ordering of custom logo tincture boxes delivers the pricing efficiency that makes professional branded packaging commercially viable for CBD brands at scale, while our quality assurance process ensures that every box in every bulk order meets the consistency standards that retail channels and direct-to-consumer brands need to maintain their presentation quality across all customer touchpoints. Visit primepackagingboxes.com today to request a sample of our CBD packaging range and get a custom quote for your tincture box requirements.</span>', 'Professional custom CBD oil boxes meeting industry compliance standards while showcasing your brand. Premium cardboard with full-color printing, foil, and embossing. Child-resistant options available. Wholesale pricing with low MOQ for CBD businesses.', 5, '/api/uploads/cbd-oil-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/cbd-oil-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/cbd-oil-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/custom-cbd-oil-boxes-with-logo.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom CBD Oil Dropper Bottle Boxes Wholesale | Printed &amp; Compliant | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom CBD oil dropper bottle boxes wholesale. Child-resistant options, eco-friendly, no minimum order. Fully printed CBD packaging for tinctures and oil brands — Prime Packaging Boxes USA', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.906Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.821Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (13, 'Custom Counter Display Boxes', 'custom-counter-display-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Counter Display Boxes for Retail Stores — Turn Every Counter Into a Sales Machine</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">In retail, the counter is prime real estate. Whether it is a checkout counter, a reception desk, a pharmacy dispensing point, or a café service bar, the space directly in front of the customer during a transaction is one of the highest-converting locations in any retail environment. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom counter display boxes for retail stores are engineered to maximize the commercial performance of that prime retail space — presenting your products at eye level, in a format that invites impulse purchases and add-on sales at the moment customers are most ready to buy.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Counter display packaging — sometimes called point-of-purchase displays, PDQ boxes, or shelf-ready packaging — is a category of retail packaging that serves a dual function. It protects and organizes multiple product units during transit and storage, and then transforms into an attractive retail display unit that can be placed directly on a counter or shelf without any additional setup or merchandising work. This dual function makes counter display boxes one of the most commercially efficient packaging investments available to brands selling through retail channels.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Counter Display Boxes Wholesale — Retail-Ready Packaging at Scale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom counter display boxes wholesale program serves brands, product manufacturers, and retail packaging buyers who need consistent, professionally produced point-of-purchase display packaging at commercially viable pricing. The wholesale program is structured to serve brands at every stage of retail distribution — from independent brands placing their first retail accounts to established consumer goods companies managing display packaging for national retail rollouts.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes for counter display boxes is structured around the production economics of display packaging manufacturing, which requires more complex engineering than standard shipping and retail boxes. Our pricing delivers competitive unit costs at wholesale volumes while reflecting the additional structural and print engineering that effective counter display packaging requires. Volume discounts are available across our standard pricing tiers, with custom pricing available for very large or ongoing program commitments.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Retail buyers and merchandising managers at the stores stocking your products need packaging that works reliably in their retail environment without requiring special handling, assembly skills, or merchandising support. Our counter display boxes are engineered to set up quickly, stand up reliably on counter surfaces, hold the specified number of product units securely, and maintain their display integrity throughout their intended retail life. These practical retail performance requirements are built into every display box we design and produce.</span> \n<h2><b>Retail Counter Display Boxes Custom Printed — Maximum Shelf Impact</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">A counter display box that does not attract attention is a missed commercial opportunity. Retail counter display boxes with custom printing from Prime Packaging Boxes are designed to command attention in the competitive visual environment of retail counters and shelving — where your display competes for customer attention against dozens of other products, promotional materials, and environmental distractions.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom printing on retail counter display boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes uses high-impact graphic design principles and premium printing technology to create displays that stop customers in their tracks. Bold brand colors, large-format logo presentation, compelling product imagery, and clear benefit messaging all work together to create a display that communicates your product''s value proposition immediately and persuasively at the point of purchase decision.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Print quality on counter display boxes is held to the same exacting standards as our premium retail packaging range. Color accuracy, print sharpness, and finish quality are all critical for retail display packaging that needs to create a strong positive brand impression under the bright lighting conditions of modern retail environments. Our production process incorporates color management and quality control steps specifically calibrated for the viewing conditions of retail counter and shelf display.</span> \n<h3><b>Display Box Formats and Configurations</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes produces counter display packaging in several structural formats to serve different retail display applications. Open-front display trays present multiple product units in a single accessible tray that allows customers to pick up individual items without disrupting the overall display. Shelf-ready packaging with perforated tear-away panels converts a shipping outer into a retail display by removing the front panel along a pre-scored perforation line. Tiered display boxes create a stepped presentation of multiple product units at different heights, maximizing product visibility in a compact counter footprint. Header card displays combine a product tray with a tall printed header card that extends above the product to create additional visual presence and brand messaging space above the product level.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Counter Display Boxes Small Order — Test Your Retail Display Strategy</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Launching a new product into retail, testing a new display format, or introducing a seasonal display program all present situations where ordering counter display boxes in small quantities makes both practical and commercial sense. Our custom corrugated counter display boxes in small order quantities from Prime Packaging Boxes make it possible to test your retail display strategy with real-world units before committing to the larger quantities that a full retail rollout requires.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small order counter display boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes start from as few as 50 units — enough to supply an initial set of retail accounts, evaluate the display performance in real retail environments, gather buyer and consumer feedback, and refine the design or configuration before scaling to larger production runs. This test-and-learn approach to retail display packaging is standard practice among sophisticated retail brands, and our small order program makes it practically accessible for brands at every scale.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Production lead times for small order counter display boxes are typically 10 to 14 business days from artwork and specification approval. Rush production is available for brands with urgent retail launch timelines. Our customer service team works with small order clients to ensure that their display packaging arrives in time for their planned retail placements and seasonal merchandising windows.</span> \n<h2><b>Printed Cardboard Counter Display Boxes Wholesale — Lightweight and Effective</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Cardboard counter display boxes offer a lightweight, cost-effective alternative to corrugated construction for products that do not require the heavy-duty structural performance of corrugated packaging. Printed cardboard counter display boxes in wholesale quantities from Prime Packaging Boxes deliver excellent print quality, reliable structural performance for lightweight product display applications, and competitive pricing that makes them an attractive option for brands managing display packaging costs across multiple retail accounts.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Cardboard counter display boxes are particularly well-suited for small, lightweight products including confectionery, cosmetics samples, personal care accessories, stationery items, small electronics accessories, and other compact retail products that need organized counter presentation without the structural requirements that heavier or more fragile products demand. The lighter weight of cardboard construction also reduces shipping costs when displays need to be distributed to multiple retail locations.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom printing on cardboard counter display boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes achieves the same high-quality print results as our corrugated display range, with the additional advantage that the smoother surface of solid cardboard can support finer print detail and more accurate color reproduction than the textured surface of corrugated board. For brands with complex logo designs, detailed product photography, or multiple brand colors, cardboard counter display boxes often deliver superior print quality at competitive pricing.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Display Boxes With Logo for Retail Shelves — Build Brand Presence in Store</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Beyond the counter, branded display boxes on retail shelves serve a critical function in building the kind of retail brand presence that drives both immediate sales and long-term brand recognition. Custom display boxes with logo for retail shelving from Prime Packaging Boxes ensure that your brand is consistently and professionally represented at every retail location where your products are stocked.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Shelf display packaging from Prime Packaging Boxes is engineered for the specific demands of retail shelving environments — boxes that stack cleanly, face out correctly on standard shelf depths, carry the structural weight of the product units they contain without deformation, and maintain their visual integrity through the full product cycle from initial shelf placement to final product unit sale. These practical shelf performance requirements are incorporated into the structural engineering of every shelf display box we design.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Logo and brand printing on retail shelf display boxes creates consistent brand presence across every retail location in your distribution network. When a consumer encounters your brand at multiple retail locations and sees the same professional, consistent packaging presentation each time, the cumulative effect is powerful brand recognition that makes your product the familiar, trusted choice when a purchase decision is being made. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to explore our full counter and shelf display packaging range and request your custom quote today.</span>', 'Custom counter display boxes designed to maximize product visibility at point of sale. Made from sturdy corrugated or cardboard with full-color branding. Perfect for retail counters, trade shows, and impulse buy sections. Wholesale, low MOQ.', 8, '/api/uploads/counter-display-boxes-wholesale.webp', '["/api/uploads/counter-display-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/custom-counter-display-boxes-with-logo.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Counter Display Boxes for Retail Stores | Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom counter display boxes for retail stores with your logo. Wholesale pricing, low MOQ, corrugated and cardboard options. Point of sale display packaging — Prime Packaging Boxes USA.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.912Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.832Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (16, 'Custom Hot Sauce Boxes', 'custom-hot-sauce-boxes', '<h1>Hot Sauce Boxes That Turn a Great Sauce Into an Unforgettable Brand</h1>\n <p>The American hot sauce market is loud, crowded, and deeply personal. Walk any specialty food aisle in a Whole Foods in Nashville or a Latin grocery in San Antonio and you''ll see fifty brands competing for the same shelf real estate — each with a personality, a heat level, a story. In a space like that, the sauce alone doesn''t win. The whole package does.</p>\n <p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we produce custom hot sauce boxes for small-batch makers, regional brands, and growing artisan sauce companies who''ve figured out their recipe and are ready to make their packaging work as hard as their product. Whether you''re boxing a single signature 5oz bottle or a three-bottle gift set, we build the box around your brand — not the other way around.</p>\n\n <h2>Single Bottle Hot Sauce Packaging Boxes — Small Format, Big Brand Moment</h2>\n <p>A custom box around a single hot sauce bottle does something a label can''t: it turns a condiment into a retail product. A bare bottle on a shelf is a product. A bare bottle inside a bold, well-printed box is a brand. That distinction matters enormously when you''re pitching to a specialty grocery buyer in Denver, trying to get placement at a gourmet food market in Charleston, or listing on Amazon where the product thumbnail is your first and only impression.</p>\n <p>The most effective single-bottle hot sauce boxes we produce share a few design traits. A bold, high-contrast color scheme that reads clearly as a small image. A window panel — die-cut on the front — so the buyer can see the bottle label and sauce color inside without opening the box. And enough panel real estate to tell the heat story: the Scoville number, the pepper source, the flavor profile, the origin story. Hot sauce buyers are enthusiasts, and enthusiasts read the box.</p>\n <p>We produce these in 14pt to 18pt SBS cardboard with full-color printing on all exterior panels. Matte lamination is the most popular finish choice for the craft hot sauce category — it reads as artisan-quality immediately. Spot UV on your logo adds contrast without going glossy all over.</p>\n\n <h2>Hot Sauce Gift Boxes Custom Printed — The Three-Bottle Set That Sells Every Holiday Season</h2>\n <p>Hot sauce gift sets are one of the most consistent-selling specialty food gifts in the United States — Father''s Day, Christmas, birthdays, corporate gifting. The brands cashing in on this aren''t necessarily the biggest producers — they''re the ones with packaging that photographs well and looks like a real gift rather than a grocery item in a bigger box.</p>\n <p>A well-designed three-bottle hot sauce gift box has a clear visual hierarchy: your brand identity on the exterior, a tray or custom divider inside that holds each bottle upright and visible, and enough structural rigidity to ship as a standalone unit without a mailer box. We design the interior insert — kraft divider, foam cradle, or molded pulp tray depending on your budget and aesthetic — to hold your specific bottle formats securely.</p>\n <p>For brands running seasonal gift sets, our low minimum order means you can produce 100 gift boxes for a limited holiday edition without committing to a quantity that outlasts the season.</p>\n\n <h2>Artisan Hot Sauce Packaging Boxes Custom Logo — Compliance Considerations for Food Packaging</h2>\n <p>Hot sauce is a regulated food product, and your outer box packaging needs to carry specific information correctly. Net weight, ingredient declaration if visible through the window, allergen notices, manufacturer name and address — these need to be present and legible at the right minimum font size for FDA compliance.</p>\n <p>Our team lays your required text into the dieline in a way that integrates naturally with your brand design — so it reads as intentional rather than squeezed in as an afterthought. We''ve worked with artisan sauce brands from Texas, Louisiana, and Florida going through regional grocery distribution setups who needed packaging that passed retail compliance review.</p>\n\n <h2>Custom Hot Sauce Boxes With Label — Making Your Label and Box Work Together</h2>\n <p>A lot of artisan hot sauce brands invest heavily in a beautiful bottle label — hand-illustrated artwork, foil accents, premium paper stock — and then put that bottle in a box that doesn''t match the investment. The result is a packaging system that feels mismatched, like wearing a suit jacket with sweatpants.</p>\n <p>Your bottle label and your box should feel like they belong to the same brand. That means carrying the same color palette, typography family, and visual personality from one to the other — even if the box design isn''t a literal copy of the label. We help our hot sauce clients develop this design continuity as part of the dieline process, so when a customer pulls the bottle out of the box, the whole brand experience feels cohesive and intentional.</p>\n\n <h2>Small Batch Hot Sauce Boxes Wholesale No Minimum — Serving Makers at Every Stage</h2>\n <p>Our minimum order of 100 units means you can get professionally printed, correctly sized hot sauce boxes whether you''re producing 200 bottles a month or 20,000. Pricing scales as your volume grows — and because your dieline stays on file, reordering for your next batch takes a quick conversation rather than starting from scratch.</p>\n <p>For sauce makers in cities like Portland, Atlanta, and Austin who are building from a cult local following toward wider distribution, consistent packaging across every batch is how you build the brand recognition that gets you into regional accounts.</p>\n <p>Standard production: 9 to 10 business days from artwork approval. Rush: 5 to 7 days. Free shipping to all 48 contiguous states.</p>\n <p>Explore our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/food-boxes/">food boxes</a> for additional food packaging formats, or browse our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/bottle-boxes/">bottle boxes</a> page for more bottle-specific packaging options. Reach us at <a href="mailto:help@primepackagingboxes.com">help@primepackagingboxes.com</a> or <a href="tel:8187584076">818-758-4076</a>.</p>', 'Custom hot sauce boxes with bold full-color printing for your sauce brand. Food-safe cardboard, low MOQ, fast delivery. Perfect for hot sauce brands selling online and at retail.', 9, '/api/uploads/custom-hot-sauce-bottle-packaging-box.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-hot-sauce-bottle-packaging-box.webp","/api/uploads/custom-hot-sauce-brand-packaging-box.webp","/api/uploads/artisan-hot-sauce-gift-packaging-box.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Hot Sauce Boxes | Bold Printed Packaging | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom hot sauce boxes with logo printing. Bold full-color, food-safe cardboard, low MOQ. Fast USA delivery for hot sauce brands and artisan sauce makers.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.918Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.895Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (14, 'Gemstone & Crystal Display Boxes', 'gemstone-crystal-display-boxes', '<h1>Crystal and Gemstone Boxes That Make Every Stone Feel Like It Was Chosen for Someone</h1>\n <p>Walk into any crystal shop in Sedona, browse a metaphysical market in New Orleans, or scroll through the top sellers on Etsy in the crystals and gemstones category — the brands consistently outperforming the competition aren''t always the ones with the rarest inventory. They''re the ones who''ve figured out that presentation is part of the purchase. A raw amethyst cluster wrapped in tissue in a generic white box feels like shipping material. The same stone presented in a custom-printed box with velvet interior and a brand card feels like a gift, a ritual object, a meaningful acquisition.</p>\n <p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we produce custom crystal and gemstone packaging for crystal shops, metaphysical retailers, Etsy sellers, and mineral collectors who understand that the box is part of the experience — not just a container.</p>\n\n <h2>What Makes Crystal Packaging Different From Standard Retail Boxes</h2>\n <p>Crystals and gemstones have unusual physical characteristics that most generic packaging doesn''t account for. They''re heavy for their size. They have sharp points and irregular edges that can tear through lightweight cardboard. They''re often fragile — particularly specimens with thin formations or included minerals that can shear under pressure. And many are visually extraordinary in ways that packaging should frame rather than hide.</p>\n <p>Every custom crystal box we produce is spec''d around these realities. We build from 1500gsm to 2000gsm rigid board for most formats — the same construction used in high-end jewelry and watch packaging — with interior dimensions matched to your specific stone size. The interior is where the presentation happens: a velvet or fabric-wrapped insert cradles the stone securely while making it look curated and intentional when the box is opened.</p>\n\n <h2>Crystal Gift Boxes Custom Printed — The Visual System That Sells Healing Crystals</h2>\n <p>The crystal market has developed a distinct visual aesthetic that speaks directly to its audience — deep midnight blue, forest green, amethyst purple, and black with gold accents, alongside natural kraft with botanical or celestial illustration. Clean, serif-forward typography. Moon phases, sacred geometry, constellation references. It''s a visual language that the crystal buyer recognizes and responds to immediately.</p>\n <p>Getting this aesthetic right in print is about more than picking the right colors. It''s about the quality of the finish. A flat-printed crystal box in purple and gold reads as generic. The same design with a matte laminate base and hot foil gold stamping on the logo and celestial accents reads as premium. We offer hot foil stamping in gold, silver, and rose gold, spot UV for constellation or geometric pattern details, and soft-touch lamination for an exterior feel that complements the tactile experience of handling the crystal inside.</p>\n <p>Window panels are a recurring request in this category — a die-cut window on the box lid or front panel lets the buyer see the specific stone before opening, which is enormously important for crystal buyers who often feel a connection to a particular specimen and want to see what they''re getting before the box is opened.</p>\n\n <h2>Gemstone Packaging Boxes Wholesale — Serving Crystal Shops and Metaphysical Retailers</h2>\n <p>Independent crystal shops — and there are more of them across the United States than most people realize — typically carry a wide variety of stone sizes, from small tumbled crystals in the $5 to $15 range to large statement pieces priced at $80 to $300 or more. Each price tier benefits from a different packaging tier, and brands that package consistently across their product range build a visual identity that''s recognizable across the full collection.</p>\n <p>Our wholesale crystal box program covers multiple size tiers from a single supplier — small boxes for tumbled stones and pocket crystals, medium formats for clusters and points, larger rigid boxes for statement pieces. We maintain a family of dielines that share your brand identity across sizes so your display table or Etsy shop feels cohesive.</p>\n\n <h2>Luxury Crystal Gift Boxes Custom Logo USA — The Gift-Buying Occasion That Drives Crystal Sales</h2>\n <p>A meaningful portion of crystal purchases are gifts — birthday gifts, healing gifts for friends going through difficult periods, graduation gifts, holiday presents. Buyers choosing a crystal as a gift need packaging that does the work of wrapping for them. A custom-printed rigid box that arrives looking ready to give is worth a premium to a gift buyer who would otherwise need to add their own wrapping.</p>\n <p>For sellers building a gift-oriented product line around their crystal inventory, we produce ready-to-gift crystal box sets — a beautifully printed rigid outer box with velvet interior, a printed crystal description card, and optional ribbon closure. The unboxing experience is part of the gift.</p>\n <p>Custom crystal gemstone boxes no minimum USA — our 100-unit minimum makes this accessible for small crystal shops and Etsy sellers at any stage.</p>\n <p>Standard production: 9 to 10 business days. Rush: 5 to 7 days. Free shipping to all 48 contiguous states.</p>\n <p>Visit our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product/ring-boxes/">jewelry boxes</a> page for related small-item display packaging, or browse <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/rigid-boxes/">rigid boxes</a> for premium construction formats. Contact us at <a href="mailto:help@primepackagingboxes.com">help@primepackagingboxes.com</a> or <a href="tel:8187584076">818-758-4076</a>.</p>', 'Custom crystal and gemstone boxes with velvet inserts and full-color printing. Elegant retail and gift box styles available. Low MOQ for crystal shops, Etsy sellers, and gem retailers.', 8, '/api/uploads/custom-crystal-gemstone-display-gift-box.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-crystal-gemstone-display-gift-box.webp","/api/uploads/printed-gemstone-retail-packaging-box.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Crystal &amp; Gemstone Boxes | Velvet Insert Printed | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom crystal and gemstone boxes with velvet inserts and logo printing. Gift and retail box styles, low MOQ, fast USA delivery for crystal shops and gem sellers.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.915Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.902Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (18, 'Custom Fermented Food Packaging', 'custom-fermented-food-packaging', '<h1>Fermented Food Packaging That Keeps Your Product Safe and Your Brand Credible</h1>\n <p>Fermented food is having a cultural moment that doesn''t look like it''s slowing down anytime soon. From sauerkraut and kimchi to tempeh, miso, kefir, and water kefir soda, American consumers are embracing fermented foods for their flavor complexity and gut health benefits — and the small-batch producers, artisan fermenters, and health food brands supplying this demand have found real market traction in farmers markets, natural grocery stores, and DTC subscription channels across the country.</p>\n <p>If you''re producing fermented food commercially, you already know that the technical side of the product is unforgiving — pH, temperature, live culture management, oxygen exposure. The packaging side carries its own set of challenges that matter just as much to your business outcomes.</p>\n <p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we work with artisan fermented food brands, commercial producers, and specialty food companies to build packaging that handles the unique demands of live-culture products while building the brand credibility that drives purchase decisions in a competitive health food market.</p>\n\n <h2>Packaging Challenges Specific to Fermented Foods</h2>\n <p>Fermented foods aren''t like typical shelf-stable packaged goods. Several specific packaging demands separate them from standard food products.</p>\n <ul>\n <li><strong>Live culture and CO₂ management.</strong> Active ferments continue to produce CO₂ after packaging. For products sold refrigerated, this creates internal pressure that standard sealed packaging wasn''t designed for. Depending on your product format, the right packaging solution includes vented packaging options, pressure-rated bags, or specialized seals that allow CO₂ release without oxygen ingress. We discuss your specific product and temperature handling requirements before finalizing packaging specs.</li>\n <li><strong>Moisture and liquid resistance.</strong> Many fermented products — kimchi, sauerkraut, brine-packed vegetables — have significant liquid content. Cardboard box packaging used for these products (for shipping or outer retail packaging) needs moisture-resistant treatment or interior barrier liners to prevent structural failure in transit or refrigerated display.</li>\n <li><strong>Label adhesion and refrigeration.</strong> Labels on fermented food jars, pouches, or containers need to maintain adhesion and print integrity in high-humidity refrigerated environments. We spec label stocks and adhesives appropriate for cold and wet storage conditions.</li>\n </ul>\n\n <h2>Artisan Kimchi Packaging Custom Logo USA — Serving the Korean Food Culture Moment</h2>\n <p>Kimchi has achieved mainstream American market status — stocked at Whole Foods, Trader Joe''s, and natural grocery co-ops nationwide, consumed not just by Korean American communities but by a broad range of health-conscious shoppers in cities from Los Angeles to Boston. The artisan kimchi market within this has produced some genuinely remarkable brands, and the best of them have packaging that communicates the care and craft behind the product.</p>\n <p>For kimchi producers selling in jars, we produce custom outer boxes for jar formats — both single-jar retail boxes and multi-jar gift sets. We also produce custom jar labels with cold-adhesive stock appropriate for refrigerated display. The visual aesthetic we most often help kimchi brands develop sits somewhere between heritage Korean design references and clean American health food branding — a balance that speaks to both the Korean American community and the broader health food consumer simultaneously.</p>\n\n <h2>Sauerkraut Packaging Custom Printed — Standing Out in a Crowded Probiotic Shelf</h2>\n <p>The sauerkraut shelf at a well-stocked natural grocery store in Denver or Portland has evolved significantly. Where it was once dominated by two or three brands in indistinguishable packages, it now hosts eight to fifteen producers, each with distinct visual identities and flavor positioning. Getting your sauerkraut packaging right in this environment means developing a visual identity that''s immediately distinct, legible from six feet away, and compelling enough to pull a browser out of their routine brand selection.</p>\n <p>We''ve helped sauerkraut producers in the Pacific Northwest, the Midwest, and the Southeast develop packaging identities that break through on a crowded probiotic shelf — from bold hand-lettered kraft labels to clean Scandinavian-inspired white-and-navy branding to vibrant color-blocked fermentation-culture visual systems.</p>\n\n <h2>Fermented Food Packaging Wholesale No Minimum — For Producers at Every Stage</h2>\n <p>Whether you''re a single-product fermenter doing 300 units a week or a commercial producer managing a full line of fermented condiments, vegetables, and beverages — our wholesale packaging program scales with you. Starting at 100 units with full custom printing, scaling to higher volumes with improving unit economics as you grow.</p>\n <p>For producers managing multiple fermented SKUs — different varieties, different sizes, different formats — our dieline management system keeps each product''s approved artwork on file for fast and consistent reordering. You never have to rebuild a file or re-proof a design that''s already been approved.</p>\n <p>Standard production: 9 to 10 business days from artwork approval. Rush: 5 to 7 days. Free shipping to all 48 contiguous states.</p>\n <p>Browse our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/food-boxes/">food boxes</a> for food packaging options across categories, or visit <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/labels-stickers/">labels and stickers</a> for jar and bottle label options that complement your outer box packaging. Contact us at <a href="mailto:help@primepackagingboxes.com">help@primepackagingboxes.com</a> or <a href="tel:8187584076">818-758-4076</a>.</p>', 'Custom fermented food packaging boxes and jars for kimchi, sauerkraut, kombucha, and other fermented products. Food-safe, full-color printing, low MOQ for small batch and commercial producers.', 9, '/api/uploads/custom-fermented-food-retail-packaging-box.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-fermented-food-retail-packaging-box.webp","/api/uploads/printed-fermented-food-kraft-box.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Fermented Food Packaging | Printed Food Boxes | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom fermented food packaging with full-color printing. Food-safe boxes for kimchi, sauerkraut &amp; fermented products. Low MOQ, fast USA delivery.', 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.921Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.907Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (19, 'Freeze Dried Candy Packaging', 'freeze-dried-candy-packaging', '<h1>Freeze Dried Candy Packaging That Sells the Snack Before They Taste It</h1>\n <p>The freeze dried candy market blew up fast — and the sellers who built real businesses from it weren''t just selling Skittles and taffy. They were selling an experience. The crunch. The texture change. The color-popping Instagram moment. If your packaging doesn''t scream "try me right now," you''re relying entirely on the product to sell itself — and in a crowded market, that''s a tough position to be in.</p>\n <p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we make custom freeze dried candy packaging that does real selling work. Bright, bold, full-color pouches and bags that pop on Etsy, Amazon, TikTok storefronts, and retail shelf alike — with food-safe construction that keeps your product fresh and your brand protected.</p>\n\n <h2>What Format Is Right for Your Freeze Dried Candy Business?</h2>\n <p>Not every freeze dried candy seller needs the same bag. The right format depends on your product weight, your channel, and honestly — what your customer picks up first.</p>\n <ul>\n <li><strong>Stand-Up Pouches</strong> are the workhorse of the DTC candy space. They stand on their own on retail shelves, display well photographed flat-lay style for online listings, and the resealable zipper keeps product fresh between snacking sessions. Available in sizes from 2oz to 16oz with a custom window option so customers can see the candy inside.</li>\n <li><strong>Flat Bottom Bags</strong> give your packaging a more premium, shelf-stable look — ideal if you''re moving into boutique grocery or specialty retail in cities like Nashville, Austin, or Charlotte where independent food retailers are a real sales channel.</li>\n <li><strong>Pillow Pouches</strong> work well for lower-priced impulse buy formats at checkout counters, markets, and convention setups. High visibility, low material cost, easy to print.</li>\n <li><strong>Mylar Bags</strong> are the choice for sellers who need extended shelf life protection — barrier-sealed with oxygen and moisture control. If you''re wholesaling in bulk or selling subscription kits, mylar is the right call.</li>\n </ul>\n\n <h2>Custom Printed Freeze Dried Candy Bags With Logo — What the Print Actually Needs to Do</h2>\n <p>Freeze dried candy packaging has a very specific visual challenge: your product is colorful, textured, and visually exciting — and your bag needs to match that energy without overwhelming it. The best freeze dried candy bags we''ve produced for sellers across the USA share a few common design characteristics.</p>\n <p>They use high-contrast color combinations that read clearly on mobile screen thumbnails — because most of your customers are discovering you on a phone before they ever hold your product. They use a window so buyers can literally see the candy. And they keep the core message tight: what the candy is, what makes it different, and why to grab it now.</p>\n <p>Our design team helps you get there. You don''t need to come in with print-ready files — you can come in with a logo, a color preference, and a rough idea, and we build from there.</p>\n\n <h2>Freeze Dried Candy Packaging Bags Wholesale — Pricing That Scales With Your Volume</h2>\n <p>We know how this business tends to grow — you start on a kitchen table in Phoenix or a spare bedroom in Ohio, you build a following, and suddenly you''re packing 500 orders a week and running out of bags every Thursday. Our wholesale pricing structure is built for that growth curve.</p>\n <p>Starting from 100 units with full custom printing, you get the same quality as sellers ordering 10,000 units — just with unit pricing that reflects your current volume. As you scale, your cost per bag drops. We''ve helped DTC candy sellers grow from 200 units per month to 20,000 without ever changing suppliers or losing consistency.</p>\n\n <h2>Custom Freeze Dried Candy Pouches Printed — Food Safety You Can Stand Behind</h2>\n <p>Everything we produce is food-safe. Our inner liners for candy pouches are FDA-compliant for direct food contact. The inks we use for exterior printing are soy-based and cured separately from food contact surfaces. If you''re selling at farmers markets in California or shipping to grocery distributors in New York, your packaging will hold up to the requirements those channels carry.</p>\n <p>We can add a resealable zipper, a tear notch, a hang hole for peg display, or an oxygen barrier liner — depending on where and how you''re selling.</p>\n\n <h2>Fast Turnaround for Freeze Dried Candy Sellers Who Can''t Afford to Run Out</h2>\n <p>Running out of bags mid-launch or during a viral TikTok moment is a nightmare scenario. Our standard production is 9 to 10 business days. Rush is 5 to 7 days. We ship free anywhere in the contiguous 48 states.</p>\n <p>For sellers who''ve been caught short before, we can set up a repeat order system so your bags are always in production before you run out. Just contact our team and we''ll figure out a reorder schedule that works.</p>\n <p>Explore our full <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product/resealable-mylar-bags/">custom mylar bags</a> range to see additional formats, or check out our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/food-boxes/">food boxes</a> if you also need retail shelf packaging alongside your bags. Contact us at <a href="mailto:help@primepackagingboxes.com">help@primepackagingboxes.com</a> or call <a href="tel:8187584076">818-758-4076</a>.</p>', 'Custom freeze dried candy packaging bags and boxes with full-color printing. Resealable, food-safe, and available in low MOQ. Stand out on shelves and online with branded packaging.', 9, '/api/uploads/colorful-freeze-dried-candy-retail-box.webp', '["/api/uploads/colorful-freeze-dried-candy-retail-box.webp","/api/uploads/bulk-freeze-dried-candy-resealable-bag.webp","/api/uploads/custom-freeze-dried-sweets-packaging-bag.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Freeze Dried Candy Packaging | Custom Printed Bags &amp; Boxes | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Custom freeze dried candy packaging with full-color printing. Resealable bags &amp; boxes, food-safe materials, low MOQ. Fast USA shipping. Get a free quote today!', 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.922Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.881Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (17, 'Custom Kombucha Packaging', 'custom-kombucha-packaging', '<h2>Custom Kombucha Packaging — High-Quality Custom Packaging & Wholesale Boxes</h2>
<p>When it comes to elevating your product''s market presence, <strong>Custom Kombucha Packaging</strong> from Prime Packaging Boxes offers the ultimate combination of structural durability, eye-catching visual aesthetics, and brand protection. Designed specifically for retail, e-commerce, and promotional applications, our custom packaging solutions ensure your product stands out on store shelves and creates an unforgettable unboxing experience for your customers.</p>

<h3>Why Choose Custom Kombucha Packaging for Your Brand?</h3>
<p>In today''s competitive retail landscape, consumers make split-second buying decisions based on packaging presentation. High-quality custom packaging communicates professionalism, product value, and care. Our Custom Kombucha Packaging is engineered using premium food-safe, eco-friendly, and heavy-duty materials tailored to your exact product dimensions and branding requirements. Whether launching a new product line or upgrading your existing packaging, Prime Packaging Boxes delivers unmatched quality and precision.</p>

<h3>Product Highlights & Features</h3>
<div><h2>Custom Kombucha Packaging — Fermented Beverage & Brewing Kits</h2>
<p>Kombucha is booming — and your packaging needs to keep pace. Whether you''re bottling a signature brew for retail or selling home-brewing kits, our custom kombucha packaging communicates the natural, health-forward ethos of your brand with bold, earthy printing on premium board.</p>
<ul>
<li>Custom-fit single-bottle and multi-bottle kombucha carrier boxes</li>
<li>Kraft and natural brown board for an authentic fermented brand aesthetic</li>
<li>Full-color printing for brew names, SCOBY facts, and flavor profiles</li>
<li>Custom brewing kit box configurations with foam insert options</li>
<li>Food-safe materials and inks compliant with FDA beverage packaging standards</li>
<li>Available in retail shelf, e-commerce mailer, and gift set styles</li>
<li>100-unit minimum — accessible for small-batch kombucha brands</li>
</ul>
<p>From craft tap rooms to nationwide health food stores, Prime Packaging builds kombucha packaging that connects with wellness-focused consumers. Request a free quote today.</p></div>


<h3>Key Specifications & Customization Capabilities</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Fully Custom Dimensions:</strong> Tailor-made length, width, and depth to fit your products snugly without movement during shipping.</li>
  <li><strong>Vibrant Full-Color Printing:</strong> High-definition CMYK and PMS Pantone color matching printed inside and outside the box.</li>
  <li><strong>Premium Material Stocks:</strong> Choose from 100% recyclable Kraft, Solid Bleached Sulfate (SBS) cardstock, rigid chipboard, or durable fluted corrugated board.</li>
  <li><strong>Luxury Finishing Options:</strong> Enhance your design with Gold/Silver Foil Stamping, Spot UV Coating, Embossing, Debossing, Matte Lamination, or Soft-Touch Velvet finish.</li>
  <li><strong>Custom Protective Inserts:</strong> Optional die-cut foam, cardboard partitions, or molded pulp trays to hold delicate items securely.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Sustainability & Eco-Friendly Materials</h3>
<p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we are committed to environmental responsibility. Our Custom Kombucha Packaging options include 100% recyclable, biodegradable, and post-consumer recycled paperboard materials. We use non-toxic, eco-friendly vegetable and soy-based inks that deliver vivid color reproduction while minimizing environmental impact.</p>

