A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'Pharmaceutical-grade custom medicine boxes and pharmaceutical packaging compliant with FDA standards. Child-resistant, tamper-evident, with precision printing.', 11, '/api/uploads/custom-medicine-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-medicine-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/custom-medicine-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/custom-medicine-boxes-with-logo.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Custom Medicine Boxes | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Custom Medicine Boxes with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.928Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.160Z');
