<p><strong>Q: How do I get a free custom quote?</strong><br/>
A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'Precision-fit medical syringe packaging boxes for pharmaceutical and wellness brands.', 11, '/api/uploads/custom-medical-syringe-packaging-box.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-medical-syringe-packaging-box.webp","/api/uploads/printed-syringe-retail-box-packaging.webp","/api/uploads/syringe-set-corrugated-shipping-box.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Custom Medical Syringe Boxes | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Custom Medical Syringe Boxes with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.930Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.162Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (27, 'Custom Corrugated Shipping Boxes', 'custom-corrugated-shipping-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Shipping Boxes With Logo for Small Business — Every Package Is Your Brand Ambassador</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">For a small business that ships products to customers, every package that leaves your facility is a brand ambassador traveling directly to your customer''s home. It sits on their doorstep, it is carried inside, it is opened in their personal space — and every step of that journey is an opportunity for your brand to make an impression. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom shipping boxes with logo for small businesses transform functional transit packaging into branded touchpoints that build customer recognition, reinforce brand quality, and create the kind of unboxing experiences that generate social sharing and repeat purchases.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small businesses often underestimate the commercial impact of their shipping packaging because they focus their branding investment on their product, their website, and their marketing content. But the physical package is the only element of the brand experience that arrives physically at the customer''s home — and that physical presence creates a disproportionately strong and lasting brand impression relative to the cost of the packaging investment that creates it. Custom branded shipping boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes are among the most cost-effective brand investments a small ecommerce or product business can make.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Corrugated Boxes Wholesale — Reliable Supply for Growing Businesses</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom corrugated boxes wholesale program is designed for businesses that have built consistent shipping volumes and are ready to move from ad-hoc packaging purchasing to a structured wholesale supply relationship that delivers better pricing, more reliable supply, and more consistent packaging quality. The wholesale program covers the full range of corrugated box styles, sizes, and board specifications in a pricing structure that delivers genuine commercial value at every volume level.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes reflects the volume commitments of wholesale ordering while remaining accessible for businesses at the earlier stages of their scaling journey. Tiered pricing delivers progressively better unit economics as order quantities increase, with meaningful pricing improvements available as businesses move through standard wholesale volume thresholds. Even at minimum wholesale quantities, our pricing is competitive enough to make branded corrugated packaging a practical commercial investment for businesses operating on small business margins.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Supply reliability is as important as pricing for businesses that depend on their shipping packaging to fulfill customer orders on time. Prime Packaging Boxes manages production scheduling to ensure that wholesale client orders are completed and delivered within agreed lead times consistently. Our production capacity planning and supply chain management processes are designed to insulate our clients from the production disruptions and lead time variability that can affect less structured packaging suppliers.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Shipping Boxes With Logo — Brand Identity That Travels</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The logo on your custom shipping box works for your brand in ways that no digital marketing touchpoint can replicate. It is seen by postal workers, delivery drivers, neighbors, and household members who may not be the original customer but who are potentially future customers. It signals to your customer that their order has arrived from a real, professional brand that cares about its presentation. It creates the anticipation of the unboxing experience that begins before the box is even opened.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom logo printing on corrugated shipping boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes is available in several approaches to suit different brand aesthetics and budget parameters. One-color printing — typically your brand''s primary color or black — delivers clean, bold brand presence at the most economical printing cost. Two-color printing allows more sophisticated logo treatments and the addition of brand color accents or pattern elements. Full-color printing enables complex, photographic, and multi-color designs that can turn your shipping box into a fully realized brand creative execution.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Interior printing on shipping boxes is a powerful brand differentiation strategy that a minority of brands currently employ — which means the brands that do it stand out dramatically from the uniform brown interiors that most customers encounter. A beautifully printed interior creates a genuine surprise and delight moment when the box is opened, communicates investment in the customer experience, and generates the kind of organic social sharing that turns customers into brand advocates.</span> \n<h3><b>Box Sizes and Structural Options</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes produces custom corrugated shipping boxes in all standard sizes and in fully custom dimensions. Standard sizes are available for fast-turnaround orders where product dimensions conform to common shipping box formats. Custom dimensions are engineered for products that require a precise fit — eliminating void space, reducing the need for void fill materials, minimizing shipping weight, and creating a more premium unboxing experience through the precision presentation of a box that fits exactly. Structural options include regular slotted containers for standard applications, full overlap slotted containers for heavier products, and custom structural formats for specialist shipping requirements.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Branded Shipping Boxes Wholesale No Minimum — Launch Branded From Day One</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The most commercially impactful decision a new ecommerce brand can make about their packaging is to start with branded boxes from their very first shipment. Customers who receive their first order from a new brand in a professionally branded box immediately form a strong positive quality impression that influences their decision to purchase again, to leave a positive review, and to recommend the brand to their networks. Custom branded shipping boxes with no minimum order from Prime Packaging Boxes make this from-day-one branded launch possible for every new ecommerce business.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">No minimum order branded shipping boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes start from 50 units — a quantity that is practically manageable for a new business while being commercially meaningful enough to establish the branded unboxing experience that builds customer loyalty from the very beginning of the brand relationship. Every box in your first 50-unit order receives the same quality of printing and structural production as our largest wholesale orders.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">As your ecommerce business grows and your monthly shipping volumes increase, the economics of branded corrugated packaging improve automatically through our tiered wholesale pricing. Many of our ecommerce clients begin with small 50 or 100-unit orders to establish their brand packaging, build their order volume over the following months and quarters, and then transition to regular wholesale replenishment orders that deliver significantly better per-unit packaging costs. This natural progression path from startup to established wholesale client is something Prime Packaging Boxes is specifically designed to support.</span> \n<h2><b>Double Wall Corrugated Boxes Custom Size Printed — Heavy Duty Protection for Valuable Products</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">For products that require additional protection during transit — heavy items, fragile products, high-value goods, or products that are shipped over long distances or through challenging logistics networks — double wall corrugated boxes in custom sizes with printed branding from Prime Packaging Boxes provide the enhanced structural performance that standard single-wall corrugated boxes cannot deliver.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Double wall corrugated construction uses two layers of fluted corrugated medium between three layers of flat linerboard, creating a box wall structure that is significantly stronger, more rigid, and more resistant to crushing, puncture, and compression damage than standard single-wall construction. This enhanced structural performance is particularly valuable for electronics, glassware, ceramic products, heavy machinery components, and any product where transit damage would be costly or damaging to customer experience.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom sizing in double wall corrugated from Prime Packaging Boxes ensures that your heavy-duty shipping box fits your product precisely, maximizing the protective efficiency of the enhanced wall construction and minimizing the internal void space that creates product movement risk during transit. Custom printing on double wall boxes uses the same production capabilities as our standard corrugated range, delivering full brand presence on packaging that is built to protect as well as to represent your brand.</span> \n<h2><b>Eco Friendly Corrugated Shipping Boxes With Custom Logo — Sustainable Shipping at Scale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The environmental impact of ecommerce shipping packaging has become a significant concern for consumers, regulators, and responsible businesses across the United States. Eco friendly corrugated shipping boxes with custom logo from Prime Packaging Boxes give ecommerce businesses and product brands the ability to ship their products in packaging that is both environmentally responsible and professionally branded — demonstrating to their customers that their commitment to sustainability extends to every aspect of their business operation.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our eco-friendly corrugated shipping boxes are manufactured from recycled and FSC-certified fiber content, reducing the demand for virgin wood fiber in the packaging supply chain. Water-based printing inks eliminate the chemical emissions associated with solvent-based printing systems. The corrugated structure itself is highly recyclable through standard household and commercial paper recycling streams, making our shipping boxes among the most recyclable packaging formats available.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Communicating the eco-credentials of your packaging to customers is itself a marketing opportunity. Many of our eco-friendly shipping box clients include a brief message on their packaging — inside the box lid or on an exterior panel — that draws customers'' attention to the environmental responsibility of the packaging and invites them to recycle or reuse the box. This kind of environmental communication builds brand affinity with sustainability-conscious consumers and reinforces the values alignment that drives long-term brand loyalty. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to explore our full range of custom corrugated shipping box options.</span>', 'Durable custom corrugated shipping boxes with superior stacking strength for safe product transit. Available in single, double, and triple wall. Full exterior printing with your brand. Bulk wholesale pricing for online stores, warehouses, and retailers.', 13, '/api/uploads/shipping-box-packaging.webp', '["/api/uploads/shipping-box-packaging.webp","/api/uploads/custom-drone-shipping-corrugated-box.webp","/api/uploads/bone-broth-corrugated-shipping-box.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Corrugated Shipping Boxes | Durable Printed Shippers', 'Custom printed corrugated shipping boxes for ecommerce &amp; retail. Durable, branded, wholesale pricing. Fast USA delivery. Get a free quote on bulk shipping boxes!', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.934Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.869Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (25, 'Custom Drone Retail Packaging', 'custom-drone-retail-packaging', '<h1>Drone Packaging Boxes Built for Brands That Take Protection Seriously</h1>\n <p>A drone that arrives broken is a customer service disaster — a refund, a return, a one-star review, and a customer who''s probably telling their network about it. Whether you''re a drone manufacturer, a white-label reseller, a rental fleet manager, or a retail operation shipping direct to consumers in Dallas, Seattle, or Atlanta, the box your drone ships in is not a commodity purchase. It''s a calculated decision.</p>\n <p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we engineer custom drone packaging boxes around the specific protection and brand presentation requirements of unmanned aerial products — from hobby-level micro drones to professional-grade systems that ship to videographers, agriculture companies, and defense contractors.</p>\n\n <h2>Structure First: Why Drone Boxes Are Different From Standard Product Boxes</h2>\n <p>Drones are awkward to pack. The combination of rigid plastic bodies, fragile propeller blades, delicate camera gimbals, and small electronic components means your box structure has to do several jobs at once — hold everything immobile during shipping, protect against impacts from multiple directions, and allow for clean, organized unpacking that doesn''t frustrate the customer before they''ve even turned the power on.</p>\n <p>The packaging formats we most commonly produce for drone brands include:</p>\n <ul>\n <li><strong>Corrugated retail/shipping boxes</strong> — double-wall or triple-wall corrugated for full protection during standard carrier shipping. Designed to pass ISTA and ASTM drop test standards at carrier drop heights. These are the workhorses for DTC shipping operations.</li>\n <li><strong>Rigid presentation boxes</strong> — used when the drone is a premium product and the unboxing experience matters as much as the product itself. Think of the brands that put drone packaging right up there with consumer electronics — magnetic lid closure, foam-inlay interior, full-bleed exterior printing.</li>\n <li><strong>Component partition systems</strong> — modular inserts that hold the drone body, battery, controller, spare props, and accessories in separate compartments. Custom die-cut foam or molded pulp, cut to your exact product dimensions.</li>\n </ul>\n\n <h2>Drone Shipping Boxes With Foam Insert — Getting the Interior Right</h2>\n <p>The foam insert is where drone packaging protection actually lives. A beautiful outer box with a poorly fitted interior insert will still result in damaged units. We offer three foam formats:</p>\n <ul>\n <li><strong>Polyethylene (PE) foam</strong> — firm, closed-cell foam that handles impact well. Great for heavier drone bodies and controller units.</li>\n <li><strong>Polyurethane (PU) foam</strong> — slightly softer with better conforming properties. Used in presentation-style boxes where the aesthetic of the insert matters.</li>\n <li><strong>Custom die-cut foam inlay</strong> — we take your drone''s exact measurements and cut the foam cavity to match. No rattle, no movement, no arriving-broken problems.</li>\n </ul>\n <p>For brands that want an eco-conscious option, we also offer molded pulp inserts — the same technology used by electronics brands like Apple and Google for their secondary packaging. It''s sustainable, surprisingly strong, and looks impressive inside a premium box.</p>\n\n <h2>Custom Drone Boxes Wholesale USA — What Branding Adds to Your Product</h2>\n <p>Plenty of drone brands put all their design budget into the drone itself and treat the box as an afterthought. The brands winning on Amazon and at specialty retail in cities like San Jose and Portland are doing the opposite — they''re using the packaging as a brand extension.</p>\n <p>A well-printed drone box with your logo, color scheme, product specs, and hero imagery printed on the outer shell does several things: it builds perceived value before the box is even opened, it works as marketing material when customers share unboxing content online, and it signals to retail buyers that your product is ready for serious shelf placement.</p>\n <p>We print full-color on all exterior faces with options for matte lamination, spot UV on logos, and embossed details on rigid box formats. Our minimum order starts at 100 units — far below the 500 or 1,000-unit minimums most competitors require.</p>\n\n <h2>What to Include on the Outside of Your Drone Box</h2>\n <p>This is a question we get asked a lot — and the answer depends on where your product is sold. For Amazon and DTC shipping, the outside of your box is primarily a brand-building touch for the unboxing moment — your logo, tagline, and a clean product image are usually enough. For retail shelf placement in electronics or hobby stores, you need more: key specs, included accessories, compatible systems, and a strong product hero image that sells through the front panel without the customer needing to open it.</p>\n <p>Our design team has experience with both formats and can layout your box artwork to serve either channel — or both simultaneously with a flexible design system that works at retail and ships cleanly.</p>\n\n <h2>Drone Packaging Boxes Custom Logo Fast Delivery USA</h2>\n <p>Standard production runs 9 to 10 business days from artwork approval. Rush orders available for 5 to 7 days. Free shipping to all 48 contiguous states — including bulkier corrugated orders that would carry freight surcharges from other suppliers.</p>\n <p>We can also produce sample units before your full production run so you can physically test fit your products and check print fidelity before committing to a large quantity.</p>\n <p>Explore our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/cardboard-boxes/">cardboard boxes</a> and <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product/corrugated-shipping-boxes/">corrugated boxes</a> for more format options, or check our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/retail-boxes/">retail boxes</a> page for premium-tier presentation styles. Reach our team at <a href="mailto:help@primepackagingboxes.com">help@primepackagingboxes.com</a> or <a href="tel:8187584076">818-758-4076</a>.</p>', 'Custom drone packaging boxes built from sturdy corrugated or rigid board. Fully printed with your logo, foam inserts available. Ideal for drone brands, retailers, and wholesalers.', 12, '/api/uploads/custom-drone-retail-packaging-box.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-drone-retail-packaging-box.webp","/api/uploads/custom-mobile-phone-packaging-with-logo.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Drone Packaging Boxes | Custom Logo Printed | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Custom drone packaging boxes with logo printing and foam inserts. Corrugated or rigid board, low MOQ, fast USA delivery. Protect and brand your drones.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.932Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.883Z');
