A: Our minimum order quantity (MOQ) starts at just 100 units, making custom packaging accessible for startups and established brands alike.</p>
<p><strong>Q: Can I print inside the box?</strong><br/>
A: Yes! We offer full-color CMYK printing on both the interior and exterior surfaces of your Custom Carton Packaging Boxes.</p>
<p><strong>Q: How do I get a free custom quote?</strong><br/>
A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'Versatile custom carton packaging for retail consumer goods. Any size, full-color print, low MOQ.', 12, '/api/uploads/carton-packaging-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/carton-packaging-boxes.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Custom Carton Packaging Boxes | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Custom Carton Packaging Boxes with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.933Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.164Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (30, 'Custom Kraft Gable Boxes', 'custom-kraft-gable-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Kraft Gable Boxes With Handle Wholesale — Charming Packaging That Carries Your Brand</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Few packaging formats combine practical functionality with genuine visual charm as effectively as the gable box. With its distinctive peaked roof handle and clean geometric form, the kraft gable box has become a signature packaging choice for bakeries, event planners, gift brands, food businesses, and artisan product makers who want packaging that is immediately recognizable, easy to carry, and genuinely delightful to receive. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom kraft gable boxes with handle for wholesale supply give businesses of every size access to this beloved packaging format with their brand identity printed beautifully on every surface.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The gable box design is one of the most cleverly engineered packaging formats in the industry. The integrated handle formed by the folded top panels eliminates the need for separate handles, ribbons, or carrier bags — the box is its own gift bag, its own carrier, and its own presentation in a single self-contained structure. This functional elegance makes gable boxes exceptionally practical for food service, retail gifting, and event favor applications where ease of handling and attractive presentation need to be achieved simultaneously.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Kraft Gable Boxes Wholesale — Natural Packaging at Commercial Scale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom kraft gable boxes wholesale program serves bakeries, food businesses, gift brands, event planners, party supply companies, and retail packaging buyers who need consistent, professionally branded gable box packaging at commercially competitive pricing. The wholesale program covers the full range of kraft gable box sizes and print specifications in a pricing structure that delivers real commercial value at every volume level.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes for kraft gable boxes reflects the efficient production economics of this popular packaging format while delivering competitive per-unit costs that make custom branded gable box packaging a practical investment for businesses at modest production scales. Tiered pricing rewards volume with better unit economics, and our minimum wholesale quantities are set deliberately low to include the bakeries, small food businesses, and independent event companies that represent the core market for gable box packaging.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Kraft gable boxes wholesale from Prime Packaging Boxes are available in standard sizes covering the most common food service and gifting applications. Small gable boxes sized for individual pastries, cupcakes, and small gift items. Medium gable boxes for loaf cakes, muffin sets, and moderate gift collections. Large gable boxes for full cakes, substantial food gift sets, and generous party favor presentations. Custom dimensions are available for businesses with specific product size requirements that standard formats cannot accommodate.</span> \n<h2><b>Gable Gift Boxes Custom Printed — Personality in Every Panel</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The gable box offers one of the most generous printable surface areas relative to its footprint of any packaging format in the market. All four side panels, the top handle panels, and the base panel are all available for custom printing — creating a 360-degree brand canvas that communicates your brand identity comprehensively from every angle. Gable gift boxes with custom printing from Prime Packaging Boxes make the most of this generous printable area, creating packaging that is visually engaging and brand-consistent on every surface.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Design approaches for custom printed gable boxes cover the full range of brand aesthetics and commercial applications. Solid brand color backgrounds with clean logo treatments create a bold, graphic brand presence that reads strongly in retail and gifting environments. Illustrated designs incorporating food photography, botanical drawings, pattern elements, and brand story details create packaging that consumers engage with visually and want to keep. Seasonal and occasion-specific designs for Christmas, Valentine''s Day, birthdays, and other gifting occasions create packaging that is perfectly calibrated for specific commercial moments throughout the year.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Print quality on kraft gable boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes is calibrated for the warm, natural kraft paper surface — a printing substrate that has its own aesthetic personality and requires specific color management to achieve accurate, vibrant results. Our production team has extensive experience printing on kraft surfaces and applies the color management expertise necessary to ensure that your brand colors reproduce accurately and your design elements look sharp and compelling against the natural brown background.</span> \n<h3><b>Handle Styles and Finishing Options</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The handle of a gable box is both a functional element and a design opportunity. Standard gable box handles are formed by folding the two top panels together and locking them in a flat, palm-friendly shape — sturdy enough to carry the loaded box comfortably and cleanly finished as part of the overall box structure. Reinforced handle options are available for heavier food and gift applications where additional handle strength is required. Die-cut handle openings in the handle panel create a finger-grip option that some brands prefer for premium or retail applications. Custom handle designs incorporating ribbon pull or satin tie elements are available for gifting applications where an extra touch of luxury in the handle presentation is desired.</span> \n<h2><b>Printed Gable Boxes for Party Favors Custom — Make Every Guest Feel Special</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Party favors are one of the most popular and enduring applications for gable box packaging. Whether for children''s birthday parties, wedding receptions, baby showers, bridal celebrations, corporate events, or graduation parties, gable boxes filled with treats, small gifts, or branded merchandise create a memorable and generous favor presentation that guests genuinely appreciate and that event organizers are proud to present.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom printed gable boxes for party favors from Prime Packaging Boxes can be personalized with event-specific details — the celebrant''s name and event date for birthday parties, the couple''s names and wedding date for wedding favors, company branding and event details for corporate occasions. This personalization transforms a generic favor box into a keepsake that guests associate specifically with the occasion and the people being celebrated.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Party favor gable boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes are available in small quantities that match the actual guest counts of individual events, making custom branded party favor packaging accessible for events of all sizes without requiring large over-purchases that create unnecessary waste and cost. Whether you need 50 boxes for a small gathering or 500 boxes for a large corporate event, Prime Packaging Boxes delivers the quality and the customization that makes your event favors genuinely special.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Gable Boxes With Logo No Minimum Order — Brand Your Business From the Start</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">For new bakeries, startup food businesses, independent gift brands, and first-time event packaging buyers, the ability to order custom gable boxes with logo and no minimum order restriction is one of the most valuable features Prime Packaging Boxes offers. Custom branded packaging creates a professional first impression from your very first sale, and our no minimum order program makes that professionalism accessible from day one of your business.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Starting from as few as 50 boxes, businesses and individuals can order fully custom printed kraft gable boxes with their logo, brand colors, and chosen design at pricing that is accessible for early-stage businesses and individual event planners. No minimum order packaging from Prime Packaging Boxes is produced to exactly the same quality standard as our wholesale orders — same kraft material quality, same print accuracy, same structural performance.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The low barrier to entry for custom gable box packaging at Prime Packaging Boxes means that every business, at every stage of its development, can present its products and gifts in packaging that reflects its brand values and creates the positive impressions that build customer loyalty and word-of-mouth recommendation. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to start your custom gable box order today.</span> \n<h2><b>Eco Friendly Kraft Gable Boxes Custom Printed Bulk — Sustainable Packaging for Green Businesses</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The natural kraft material of our gable boxes is inherently eco-friendly — made from sustainably sourced wood fiber, fully recyclable through standard paper recycling streams, and biodegradable at the end of its useful life. For businesses that want to make a genuine environmental commitment through their packaging choices, our eco friendly kraft gable boxes with custom printing in bulk quantities provide the packaging solution that aligns perfectly with their sustainability values.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our eco-friendly kraft gable boxes are printed using water-based and soy-based inks that eliminate the chemical emissions and disposal challenges of conventional solvent-based printing. The complete eco-friendly gable box — kraft paper construction, natural inks, no plastic coating — is genuinely sustainable at every stage of its lifecycle, from raw material sourcing through production, use, and end-of-life disposal. This complete lifecycle sustainability gives businesses the confidence to communicate genuine eco credentials to their customers without the risk of greenwashing accusations.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Bulk ordering of eco-friendly kraft gable boxes delivers the pricing efficiency that makes sustainable packaging a commercially practical choice rather than a costly premium. At Prime Packaging Boxes, we believe that doing the right thing environmentally should not require paying a significant price premium, and our eco-friendly gable box pricing reflects that commitment. Contact us at primepackagingboxes.com to discuss your bulk eco gable box requirements and get a competitive custom quote.</span>', 'Charming custom kraft gable boxes with built-in handles — perfect for gifts, party favors, food, and retail products. Made from natural kraft board with full-color printing. Eco-friendly and reusable. Wholesale pricing with low minimum order quantity.', 15, '/api/uploads/custom-kraft-gable-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-kraft-gable-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/custom-kraft-gable-boxes-1.webp","/api/uploads/custom-kraft-gable-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/custom-kraft-gable-boxes-wholesale-1.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Kraft Gable Boxes With Handle Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom kraft gable boxes with handle for wholesale. Printed for party favors, bakeries, food packaging. Low MOQ, eco-friendly options — Prime Packaging Boxes USA.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.939Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.845Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (32, 'Custom Paper Tubes', 'custom-paper-tubes', '<h1><b>Custom Paper Tubes for Cosmetics and Candles — Sustainable Cylinder Packaging With Serious Style</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The cylinder has a natural elegance that no rectangular box can replicate. There is something inherently premium about a perfectly proportioned paper tube — the smooth curve of its walls, the satisfying friction of a well-fitted lid, the clean simplicity of its form. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom paper tubes for cosmetics and candles bring that natural elegance to your product packaging, combining the timeless appeal of the cylindrical format with the sustainability credentials of paper construction and the brand identity power of full custom printing.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Paper tube packaging has experienced a significant surge in popularity across the cosmetics, skincare, candle, food, and gift industries as brands search for sustainable alternatives to plastic tubes and containers. Paper tubes are manufactured from wound layers of recycled kraft paper or specialty printing paper, creating a robust, structurally reliable container that is completely recyclable, fully printable, and available in virtually any diameter and height combination. For brands that are committed to sustainable packaging without compromising on presentation quality, paper tubes are one of the most compelling packaging solutions available.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Paper Tubes Wholesale — Cylindrical Packaging at Commercial Scale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom paper tubes wholesale program serves cosmetic brands, skincare companies, candle makers, specialty food businesses, gift brands, and promotional merchandise companies that need consistent, professionally produced paper tube packaging at commercially viable pricing. The wholesale program covers the full range of paper tube diameters, heights, wall constructions, and customization options in a pricing structure that delivers real commercial value at every production scale.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes for custom paper tubes reflects the precision manufacturing requirements of quality tube construction while delivering competitive per-unit costs that make paper tube packaging a commercially practical choice for brands at every scale. Tiered pricing rewards volume with better economics, and our minimum wholesale quantities are set at accessible levels that include the small cosmetic brands and independent candle makers who represent the most innovative segment of the paper tube packaging market.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Paper tube construction quality is fundamental to the performance and perceived premium quality of the finished packaging. Our tubes are manufactured from multiple wound paper layers that create wall thicknesses calibrated for specific strength requirements — lighter constructions for small cosmetic and lip balm tubes, heavier constructions for full-size candle and gift tubes that need to support significant product weight and withstand shipping transit conditions. Wall thickness, tube diameter, and height are all fully customizable to create tubes that are precisely engineered for your specific product and application.</span> \n<h2><b>Printed Paper Tube Packaging — 360 Degrees of Brand Presence</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The cylindrical surface of a paper tube provides one of the most visually distinctive printing canvases in the packaging world. A full 360-degree wrap print on a cylindrical tube creates a continuous brand presentation that is visible from every angle simultaneously — there is no back panel that faces away from the customer, no hidden side that carries wasted print real estate. Every degree of the tube surface works for your brand, all the time.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom printing on paper tubes from Prime Packaging Boxes is applied using precision label wrapping or direct digital printing processes that deliver accurate color reproduction and sharp print detail across the full cylindrical surface. Design options range from clean, minimal label wraps with logo and essential product information to fully illustrated continuous designs that create a rich, visually complex brand experience when the tube is rotated in the hand. Specialty finishing options including matte and gloss lamination, foil stamping, embossing, and soft-touch coating are all available to add premium tactile and visual quality to the printed tube surface.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Interior printing on paper tubes is available for brands that want to create an additional brand detail visible when the lid is removed and the tube is opened. Interior print can carry brand messaging, product information, usage instructions, or decorative elements that create a complete branded experience extending from the exterior to the interior of the packaging. This interior detail is particularly effective for gifting applications where the unboxing experience is important to the overall product presentation.</span> \n<h3><b>Lid and Closure Options</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The lid is an integral part of the paper tube packaging experience, and Prime Packaging Boxes offers several lid styles to suit different applications and aesthetic requirements. Friction-fit paper lids provide a clean, smooth closure that is secure enough for retail and gifting use while being easy for consumers to open and reclose. Telescope lids that partially overlap the tube body create a more substantial closure with additional structural coverage at the top of the tube. Hinged lids for tubes that need to remain attached to the body during use. Custom lid shapes and profiles for brands that want a distinctive closure detail as part of their tube design. Lid materials and finishes can be coordinated with or contrasted against the tube body to create specific aesthetic effects.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Paper Tubes for Lip Balm and Skincare — Natural Beauty Packaging</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The natural beauty and clean skincare market has embraced paper tube packaging with particular enthusiasm, and it is easy to understand why. Paper tubes communicate the natural, sustainable values that define natural beauty brands — they are made from plant-based materials, they are recyclable at end of life, and their natural texture and appearance create an authentic, earthy aesthetic that resonates powerfully with consumers who choose natural skincare products precisely because they value natural ingredients and natural manufacturing practices.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom paper tubes for lip balm products from Prime Packaging Boxes are engineered with the specific requirements of lip balm packaging in mind. The tube diameter and height are calibrated for standard lip balm bullet and pot formats. The interior surface is treated to be compatible with common lip balm formulations including wax-based, oil-based, and emollient-rich products. The closure mechanism is designed to provide reliable resealing through normal daily use. Custom printing carries your brand identity, ingredient list, and product information in the clean, natural aesthetic that lip balm consumers expect.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Skincare paper tubes for serums, creams, balms, and treatment products follow similar engineering principles at larger dimensions, with inner lining options for products that require barrier protection against oil migration or moisture penetration through the paper walls. Our skincare tube technical team works with formulators to select the appropriate inner lining specification for the specific chemistry of each skincare formulation, ensuring material compatibility and product integrity throughout the packaging''s retail shelf life.</span> \n<h2><b>Eco Friendly Paper Tubes Custom Printed No Minimum — Sustainable Packaging for Every Brand</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The environmental case for paper tube packaging is compelling and genuine. Paper tubes are manufactured from recycled and sustainably sourced paper fiber, they are printed with water-based inks, they contain no plastic components in their standard construction, and they are recyclable through standard household and commercial paper recycling streams. For brands that want to make a real and demonstrable environmental commitment through their packaging, custom paper tubes represent one of the cleanest packaging choices available in the market.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our eco friendly paper tubes with custom printing and no minimum order make sustainable packaging accessible for brands at every stage of their development. Starting from as few as 50 tubes, brands can order custom printed eco paper tubes with their logo, brand design, and product information without the large inventory commitments that traditionally come with sustainable specialty packaging formats. Small order eco paper tubes from Prime Packaging Boxes are produced to the same quality standard as our wholesale range — sustainable, beautifully printed, and perfectly finished.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Communicating the sustainability credentials of paper tube packaging to your customers is itself a brand-building opportunity. Many of our paper tube clients include a brief eco message on their packaging — highlighting the recyclable construction, the natural materials, and the sustainable production practices that make paper tubes a responsible packaging choice. This kind of transparent environmental communication builds genuine brand affinity with sustainability-conscious consumers and differentiates your brand meaningfully from competitors who still use plastic packaging. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to explore our full paper tube range and request your custom quote.</span>', 'Unique custom paper tubes for cosmetics, candles, food, and luxury goods. Fully printed with your branding on recycled or kraft paper. Available in various diameters and heights with metal or plastic end caps. Wholesale pricing, low MOQ.', 16, '/api/uploads/custom-paper-tubes-wholesale.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-paper-tubes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/printed-paper-tubes-bulk.webp","/api/uploads/printed-paper-tubes-bulk-1.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Paper Tubes for Cosmetics and Candles | Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom paper tubes for cosmetics and candles with your logo. Wholesale pricing, eco-friendly, no minimum. Lip balm tubes, skincare containers — Prime Packaging Boxes USA.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.943Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.852Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (29, 'Custom Incense & Smudge Stick Boxes', 'custom-incense-smudge-stick-boxes', '<h1>Smudge Stick Packaging That Honors the Product and Builds the Brand</h1>\n <p>The smudging and home cleansing market in the United States has grown far beyond the metaphysical shop demographic it once belonged to. White sage bundles, palo santo sticks, lavender and rosemary herb bundles, and multi-herb ceremonial smudges now appear in wellness boutiques in Brooklyn, lifestyle stores in Austin, independent gift shops in Asheville, and on the bestseller lists of major online retailers. The customer base is broad, the gifting appeal is strong, and the brands building real businesses in this space are the ones who''ve figured out that the packaging is part of what customers are buying.</p>\n <p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we produce custom smudge stick packaging for herb bundle makers, metaphysical product brands, wellness businesses, and artisan sellers who''ve built something worth packaging properly.</p>\n\n <h2>Format Options for Smudge Stick and Herb Bundle Packaging</h2>\n <p>Smudge sticks are an irregular product format — natural, imprecise, and varying in size even within a single variety. Your packaging needs to accommodate that natural variation while still looking clean, consistent, and retail-ready. We build smudge stick packaging in several formats, each suited to different brand positioning and sales channels.</p>\n <ul>\n <li><strong>Kraft sleeve packaging</strong> is the most popular format in this category — a simple, elegant wraparound sleeve that holds the bundle contained while leaving the natural material partially visible at each end. It prints beautifully in earthy tones on natural kraft stock, communicates the hand-crafted nature of the product, and looks right at home on a farmers market display table or a boutique shelf. Kraft is also the right choice for brands whose sustainability story is a core part of their identity — it''s recyclable, biodegradable, and signals earthiness immediately.</li>\n <li><strong>Folding carton boxes with window</strong> are used by brands moving upmarket or into mainstream retail channels. A window panel on the box front lets buyers see the sage color, texture, and quality without touching. This is important for retail buyers placing orders for boutiques or gift shops — they need to trust the product quality from a sample before committing to inventory. A well-constructed window box also protects the bundle more completely than a sleeve during shipping, which matters for DTC brands sending smudge sticks across the country.</li>\n <li><strong>Cellophane or clear wrap with a custom band</strong> is the most economical format for brands selling at farmers markets or through wholesale accounts where the low per-unit cost matters more than retail-shelf presentation. A branded paper belly band around a cellophane-wrapped bundle is a step up from bare product while keeping packaging cost minimal.</li>\n </ul>\n\n <h2>White Sage Smudge Packaging Boxes Custom Printed — Navigating the Ethics and Standing Behind Your Product</h2>\n <p>The white sage market in the United States carries an important cultural conversation about sourcing and sustainability. Overharvesting of wild white sage in California has driven conservationists and Indigenous communities to raise legitimate concerns about commercially sold sage bundles. Brands that use cultivated sage, ethically wildcrafted materials, or alternative herbs — lavender, rosemary, cedar, mugwort — have an opportunity to lead with that sourcing story as a genuine brand differentiator.</p>\n <p>Your packaging is where that story lives. The back panel of a smudge stick box or sleeve is valuable real estate for communicating where your herbs come from, how they''re harvested, and why your sourcing practices are consistent with the values of your customer. Brands in the smudging space that tell this story clearly on their packaging build a level of customer trust that generic competitors without that story can''t replicate.</p>\n <p>We include back panel copy consulting as part of our dieline setup process — helping you frame your sourcing story in a way that''s clear, honest, and credible to an informed buyer.</p>\n\n <h2>Sage Smudge Stick Boxes Custom Logo USA — Gift Market Strategy</h2>\n <p>Smudge stick gift sets are a strong-performing category in the specialty wellness gift market — house cleansing kits, meditation starter sets, seasonal ritual bundles for the winter solstice or Samhain, and general wellness gifts that appeal to a broad range of buyers across the spiritual and non-spiritual spectrum.</p>\n <p>A smudge stick gift set — two or three herb varieties in a printed rigid or folding box with a fire-safe ceramic bowl, an abalone shell, or a selenite wand — is a $25 to $60 product that most buyers would have no idea how to put together without your curation. The packaging is what makes it a gift set rather than a collection of individual items.</p>\n <p>Custom smudge stick packaging no minimum USA — our 100-unit minimum means you can create a limited edition gift set without committing to holiday inventory that doesn''t sell through.</p>\n\n <h2>Wholesale Smudge Stick Boxes No Minimum Printed Logo — Supplying Retailers and Online Channels</h2>\n <p>Wholesale accounts for smudge sticks — gift shops, yoga studios, wellness boutiques, bookstores — typically buy in small quantities per SKU. They want a supplier who can deliver consistent quality across multiple varieties with the same packaging standard and a wholesale price that lets them make their margin.</p>\n <p>Our wholesale program handles exactly that. Multiple varieties, same packaging system, consistent print across every run, with per-unit pricing that gives your retail accounts a workable margin at the price points the wellness gift market supports.</p>\n <p>Standard production: 9 to 10 business days from artwork approval. Rush: 5 to 7 days. Free shipping to all 48 contiguous states.</p>\n <p>Browse our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product/custom-kraft-boxes/">custom kraft boxes</a> for natural packaging formats that suit the smudge stick category, and our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/gift-boxes/">gift boxes</a> page for premium gift set packaging formats. Contact us at <a href="mailto:help@primepackagingboxes.com">help@primepackagingboxes.com</a> or <a href="tel:8187584076">818-758-4076</a>.</p>', 'Custom smudge stick packaging boxes and bags with full-color printing for sage, palo santo, and herb bundles. Eco-friendly kraft options available. Low MOQ, fast turnaround.', 14, '/api/uploads/custom-incense-smudge-stick-packaging-box.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-incense-smudge-stick-packaging-box.webp","/api/uploads/printed-sage-smudge-stick-retail-box.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Smudge Stick Packaging | Eco Kraft Printed | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom smudge stick packaging boxes and bags. Eco-friendly kraft options, full-color printing, low MOQ. Fast USA delivery for sage, palo santo &amp; herb bundle brands.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.937Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.905Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (31, 'Custom Packaging Sleeves', 'custom-packaging-sleeves', '<h2>Custom Packaging Sleeves — High-Quality Custom Packaging & Wholesale Boxes</h2>
<p>When it comes to elevating your product''s market presence, <strong>Custom Packaging Sleeves</strong> from Prime Packaging Boxes offers the ultimate combination of structural durability, eye-catching visual aesthetics, and brand protection. Designed specifically for retail, e-commerce, and promotional applications, our custom packaging solutions ensure your product stands out on store shelves and creates an unforgettable unboxing experience for your customers.</p>

<h3>Why Choose Custom Packaging Sleeves for Your Brand?</h3>
<p>In today''s competitive retail landscape, consumers make split-second buying decisions based on packaging presentation. High-quality custom packaging communicates professionalism, product value, and care. Our Custom Packaging Sleeves is engineered using premium food-safe, eco-friendly, and heavy-duty materials tailored to your exact product dimensions and branding requirements. Whether launching a new product line or upgrading your existing packaging, Prime Packaging Boxes delivers unmatched quality and precision.</p>

<h3>Product Highlights & Features</h3>
<div><h2>Custom Packaging Sleeves — Versatile & Cost-Effective Product Wrapping</h2>
<p>Custom Packaging Sleeves — also known as belly bands or box sleeves — offer a flexible, budget-friendly, and stylish way to brand your products without the cost of a full custom box. Prime Packaging Boxes manufactures high-quality custom printed packaging sleeves tailored to fit plain boxes, food containers, tray-and-sleeve setups, apparel rolls, soap bars, and retail merchandise. They slide effortlessly over your base container, delivering instant brand recognition and professional polish.</p>

<h3>Why Choose Packaging Sleeves for Your Brand?</h3>
<p>Packaging sleeves are an ideal solution for businesses looking to streamline inventory costs or refresh product branding across seasonal promotions. By pairing generic stock boxes or eco-friendly food trays with custom printed sleeves, you can introduce multiple product variants, flavors, or limited-edition runs without re-ordering entirely new box sizes.</p>

<h3>Key Features & Customization Options</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Custom Sizing & Formats:</strong> Built to exact length, width, and depth dimensions for snug, slip-free fit around boxes, tins, trays, or bottles.</li>
  <li><strong>Pre-Glued or Flat Snap Options:</strong> Delivered pre-glued for instant sliding assembly or flat with interlocking die-cut tabs for quick wrapping.</li>
  <li><strong>Window Cutout Options:</strong> Precision die-cut windows to showcase product texture, color, or logo elements underneath.</li>
  <li><strong>High-Impact Printing & Finishes:</strong> Full CMYK color printing, metallic foil accents, spot UV highlights, and soft-touch matte lamination.</li>
  <li><strong>Sustainable Paper Stocks:</strong> Available in eco-friendly Kraft, recycled paperboard, and premium SBS cardstock from 12pt to 24pt thickness.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Order Custom Packaging Sleeves Wholesale</h3>
<p>Upgrade your product presentation with custom packaging sleeves from Prime Packaging Boxes. Enjoy 100-unit minimums, fast 7-10 day turnaround, free design assistance, and free shipping across the USA. Request a free instant quote now!</p></div>


<h3>Key Specifications & Customization Capabilities</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Fully Custom Dimensions:</strong> Tailor-made length, width, and depth to fit your products snugly without movement during shipping.</li>
  <li><strong>Vibrant Full-Color Printing:</strong> High-definition CMYK and PMS Pantone color matching printed inside and outside the box.</li>
  <li><strong>Premium Material Stocks:</strong> Choose from 100% recyclable Kraft, Solid Bleached Sulfate (SBS) cardstock, rigid chipboard, or durable fluted corrugated board.</li>
  <li><strong>Luxury Finishing Options:</strong> Enhance your design with Gold/Silver Foil Stamping, Spot UV Coating, Embossing, Debossing, Matte Lamination, or Soft-Touch Velvet finish.</li>
  <li><strong>Custom Protective Inserts:</strong> Optional die-cut foam, cardboard partitions, or molded pulp trays to hold delicate items securely.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Sustainability & Eco-Friendly Materials</h3>
<p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we are committed to environmental responsibility. Our Custom Packaging Sleeves options include 100% recyclable, biodegradable, and post-consumer recycled paperboard materials. We use non-toxic, eco-friendly vegetable and soy-based inks that deliver vivid color reproduction while minimizing environmental impact.</p>

<h3>Wholesale Benefits & Ordering with Prime Packaging Boxes</h3>
<p>Partnering with Prime Packaging Boxes means getting direct factory-direct wholesale pricing with no hidden fees. We provide:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Low Minimum Order Quantity:</strong> Order as few as 100 units to start your custom packaging run.</li>
  <li><strong>Fast Turnaround Times:</strong> Standard production in 7-10 business days with rush options available.</li>
  <li><strong>Free Design Support:</strong> Work directly with our expert structural and graphic packaging designers at zero extra cost.</li>
  <li><strong>Free 3D Digital Proofing:</strong> Review your artwork on a realistic 3D model before manufacturing begins.</li>
  <li><strong>Free Shipping Across USA:</strong> Fast, reliable doorstep delivery included with every order.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h3>
<p><strong>Q: What is the minimum order quantity for Custom Packaging Sleeves?</strong><br/>
A: Our minimum order quantity (MOQ) starts at just 100 units, making custom packaging accessible for startups and established brands alike.</p>
<p><strong>Q: Can I print inside the box?</strong><br/>
A: Yes! We offer full-color CMYK printing on both the interior and exterior surfaces of your Custom Packaging Sleeves.</p>
<p><strong>Q: How do I get a free custom quote?</strong><br/>
A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'Versatile custom packaging sleeves and box belly bands. Cost-effective branding wrap for food containers, apparel, boxes, and retail products.', 16, '/api/uploads/custom-packaging-sleeves-with-logo.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-packaging-sleeves-with-logo.webp","/api/uploads/printed-packaging-sleeves-bulk.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Custom Packaging Sleeves | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Custom Packaging Sleeves with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.941Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.169Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (33, 'Custom Christmas Gift Boxes', 'custom-christmas-gift-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Christmas Gift Boxes With Logo Wholesale — Make Every Gift Unforgettable This Holiday Season</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Christmas is the single most important gifting occasion of the year, and the packaging in which gifts are presented plays a central role in the magic of the season. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom Christmas gift boxes with logo for wholesale supply give brands, retailers, and businesses the seasonal packaging they need to make every gift feel truly special — packaging that captures the warmth, excitement, and generosity of the Christmas spirit while presenting your brand at its very best.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The Christmas gifting market represents one of the largest seasonal packaging opportunities of the year across virtually every consumer product category. From luxury retail brands creating premium gift collections to small businesses packaging handmade products for holiday markets, from corporate gifting programs building seasonal client relationship packages to individual entrepreneurs wrapping their first holiday season of sales — every gifting occasion benefits from Christmas packaging that is as carefully considered as the gifts inside. Prime Packaging Boxes produces the custom Christmas packaging that makes that possible for businesses of every size.</span> \n<h2><b>Christmas Gift Boxes Wholesale — Season-Ready Supply at Scale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our Christmas gift boxes wholesale program is designed for businesses and brands that need seasonal gift packaging at commercially viable pricing and in quantities that match their holiday sales projections. The Christmas season creates predictable and significant spikes in gift packaging demand, and planning your packaging supply well in advance of the peak gifting period is essential for ensuring you have everything you need when your customers are ready to buy.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale Christmas packaging orders from Prime Packaging Boxes should ideally be placed at least 6 to 8 weeks before your planned start of Christmas sales to allow adequate production time and delivery margin. Our production team manages seasonal capacity specifically to accommodate the holiday packaging rush, but early ordering guarantees your place in the production schedule and protects you from the lead time extensions that can affect late-season orders when production capacity is fully committed.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing for Christmas gift boxes reflects the seasonal production dynamics of holiday packaging while remaining competitive enough to make custom branded Christmas packaging a commercially viable investment for businesses at every scale. Volume discounts are available across our standard wholesale tiers, and we work with seasonal clients to find the order quantity and pricing combination that best matches their holiday sales plan and budget.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Christmas Gift Boxes Bulk — Scale Your Holiday Gifting Program</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">For brands, retailers, and organizations running significant Christmas gifting programs, bulk ordering of custom Christmas gift boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes delivers the pricing efficiency, production reliability, and supply volume that large-scale holiday packaging programs require. Bulk Christmas packaging orders can incorporate multiple box sizes, different design variants for different product lines or gifting occasions, and coordinated packaging accessories including tissue paper, ribbon, and gift cards.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom Christmas gift boxes in bulk from Prime Packaging Boxes are available in all the formats that seasonal gift packaging requires. Rigid magnetic closure boxes create the ultimate luxury Christmas gift experience — substantial, beautifully presented, and immediately associated with premium gifting. Standard cardboard gift boxes with Christmas-themed printing deliver festive presentation at more accessible price points suitable for mid-market retail gifting. Kraft boxes with seasonal design printing create a warm, authentic artisan Christmas aesthetic that works perfectly for handmade products and artisan gift brands.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Bulk Christmas packaging from Prime Packaging Boxes can be ordered in single design runs for brands with a single seasonal packaging identity, or in multiple design variants that allow different Christmas packaging treatments for different product lines, price points, or customer segments within a single holiday gifting program. Our production management team coordinates multiple design variants within a single production schedule efficiently, ensuring consistent quality across all variants and delivery within agreed timelines.</span> \n<h3><b>Christmas Packaging Design Themes</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes works with clients to develop Christmas packaging designs that balance brand identity with seasonal festivity. Popular Christmas design approaches include traditional festive designs incorporating classic Christmas colors, imagery, and typography that communicate warmth and tradition. Contemporary minimalist Christmas designs using restrained seasonal color palettes and clean typography appeal to premium and modern brand aesthetics. Brand-forward Christmas designs that maintain the client''s standard brand identity while incorporating subtle seasonal elements keep the brand recognizable while communicating the seasonal spirit. Custom illustrated Christmas designs with bespoke artwork created specifically for the client''s seasonal packaging create completely distinctive and memorable seasonal packaging that stands apart from generic seasonal alternatives.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Magnetic Christmas Gift Boxes Bulk Order — Premium Holiday Gifting</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">For brands and organizations whose Christmas gifting programs call for genuinely luxurious presentation, custom magnetic Christmas gift boxes in bulk orders from Prime Packaging Boxes deliver the premium quality that high-value holiday gifting demands. The satisfying magnetic closure, the substantial rigid construction, and the beautiful custom Christmas printing of our magnetic gift boxes create a gift presentation experience that recipients will remember and associate with the generosity and care of the giver.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Magnetic Christmas gift boxes are particularly popular for corporate gifting programs where the quality of the gift packaging communicates the value the organization places on its client and partner relationships. A premium product in a beautifully produced magnetic Christmas box is a complete gifting experience — one that recipients appreciate, keep, and reuse, extending your brand presence in their home or office beyond the Christmas season itself.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Bulk ordering of magnetic Christmas gift boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes benefits from our seasonal production planning, which reserves production capacity for magnetic box orders placed well in advance of the Christmas season. Magnetic box production requires more production steps than standard folding carton packaging, and early ordering ensures your bulk order is completed with adequate time for quality inspection, packaging, and delivery before your gifting program launch date.</span> \n<h2><b>Personalized Christmas Boxes With Ribbon and Logo — A Personal Touch for Every Gift</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The most memorable gifts are those that feel personally considered — and personalized Christmas packaging is a powerful way to communicate that personal care even when gifts are being produced and fulfilled at scale. Personalized Christmas boxes with ribbon and logo from Prime Packaging Boxes allow brands, businesses, and corporate gifting programs to create packaging that feels individually crafted for each recipient while being practically produced at the volumes that seasonal gifting programs require.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Personalization options for Christmas gift boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes range from brand and season-specific customization — your logo, your chosen Christmas design, your brand colors — to recipient-specific elements that can be incorporated into the packaging design. Custom printed gift tags, name card holders, personal message cards, and recipient-specific packaging options are all available for gifting programs that want to maximize the personal impact of their Christmas packaging.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Ribbon finishing on Christmas gift boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes adds the classic finishing touch that completes the gift presentation. Satin ribbon in Christmas red, forest green, deep navy, ivory, and gold is available in coordinated bow formats that are pre-tied and applied during box production, arriving ready to present without any additional gift wrapping effort required from the brand or the customer.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Christmas Boxes for Small Business No Minimum — Celebrate the Season Professionally</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small businesses have as much right to beautiful seasonal packaging as their larger competitors — and at Christmas, the quality of packaging can be a significant competitive differentiator in the minds of gift-buying customers who are choosing between a small independent brand and a larger established retailer. Custom Christmas boxes for small businesses with no minimum order from Prime Packaging Boxes allow independent brands, artisans, and small retailers to compete on packaging quality during the most important gifting season of the year.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Starting from as few as 50 boxes, small businesses can order fully custom Christmas packaging with their logo, a festive design of their choosing, and their preferred structural format — without committing to quantities that their actual seasonal sales volumes cannot justify. This flexibility is particularly valuable for businesses in their first or second Christmas trading season, when sales projections are less certain and packaging over-ordering creates unnecessary financial risk.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Christmas packaging ordered from Prime Packaging Boxes for small businesses receives the same quality of design consultation, materials, printing, and finishing as our largest seasonal wholesale orders. Every small business client''s Christmas packaging represents their brand to their customers during the most emotionally significant shopping season of the year, and we take that responsibility as seriously for a 50-box order as we do for a 50,000-box order. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to start planning your Christmas packaging today.</span>', 'Festive custom Christmas gift boxes in premium cardboard with seasonal designs, foil, and ribbon options. Perfect for retail holiday displays, corporate gifting, and hampers. Branded with your logo. Wholesale bulk pricing, early order discounts available.', 17, '/api/uploads/christmas-gift-boxes-wholesale.webp', '["/api/uploads/christmas-gift-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/custom-christmas-gift-boxes-with-logo.webp","/api/uploads/custom-christmas-gift-boxes-with-logo-1.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Christmas Gift Boxes With Logo Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Custom Christmas gift boxes with logo for holiday packaging. Bulk wholesale pricing, premium finishes &amp; fast USA delivery. Order your holiday packaging today!', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.944Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.840Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (36, 'Custom Paper Shopping Bags', 'custom-paper-shopping-bags', '<h1><b>Custom Printed Paper Shopping Bags With Handles Wholesale — Packaging That Walks Your Brand Around Town</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">A custom printed shopping bag is a brand ambassador that walks through shopping centers, down high streets, through office buildings, and into homes — creating brand impressions with every person who sees it being carried. Unlike packaging that is seen only by the recipient, a shopping bag is a public brand display that reaches an audience extending far beyond the customer who received it. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom printed paper shopping bags with handles for wholesale supply give retailers, boutiques, brands, and businesses the branded carrying packaging that turns every customer into a walking advertisement for their store or brand.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The humble shopping bag has undergone a remarkable transformation in commercial and cultural significance over the past two decades. From purely functional packaging, the premium paper shopping bag has evolved into a genuine brand status symbol — a Bloomingdale''s brown bag, a Tiffany blue bag, or a Harrods dark green bag carries brand meaning and social significance that extends far beyond its functional purpose. Every retail brand, at every scale, has the opportunity to create that kind of brand recognition through the quality and consistency of their custom shopping bag — and Prime Packaging Boxes makes that opportunity accessible to brands of every size.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Paper Shopping Bags Wholesale — Consistent Brand Presence Across Every Sale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom paper shopping bags wholesale program serves retailers, boutiques, department stores, fashion brands, specialty food shops, gift stores, and any business that presents purchases to customers in branded carrying bags. The wholesale program covers the full range of paper bag sizes, handle types, paper weights, and printing options in a pricing structure that makes professional branded shopping bag packaging commercially accessible for businesses at every retail scale.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes for paper shopping bags is structured to reflect the reality that shopping bags are high-volume consumables for retail businesses — they are used for every transaction and need to be supplied in quantities that match actual sales volumes without creating storage management challenges. Tiered pricing delivers the best possible unit economics at the quantities that retail operations generate, making branded paper shopping bags more cost-effective than many retailers expect when ordering at the right scale.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Consistency across reorders is a fundamental requirement for retail shopping bag clients. A retailer''s paper bags need to look identical across every reorder, every season, and every store location — because the bag is a primary brand identifier that customers recognize and associate with the retail experience. Our archived specification management system and pre-shipment quality inspection process guarantee that your bags look exactly the same on every reorder, maintaining the brand consistency that retail recognition requires.</span> \n<h2><b>Branded Paper Bags With Logo — Your Brand Travels With Every Purchase</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The commercial value of a branded paper shopping bag extends well beyond the transaction that creates it. When a customer carries your branded bag after their purchase, they carry your brand to every location they visit — creating brand impressions with every person who sees the bag. In busy retail environments, transport hubs, offices, and neighborhoods, a distinctive, well-designed branded paper bag creates dozens or hundreds of brand impressions per outing. Multiplied across every customer transaction every day, the cumulative marketing reach of your branded shopping bags is substantial and genuinely valuable.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Logo and brand printing on paper shopping bags from Prime Packaging Boxes is available across the full range of printing approaches that retail brand aesthetics require. One-color printing in your brand''s primary color creates clean, bold brand presence at the most economical price point — an effective approach for brands with strong, distinctive logos that communicate clearly in a single color. Two and three-color treatments add depth and brand color complexity. Full-color printing enables photographic imagery, complex illustrated designs, and the rich multi-color brand presentations that premium retail brands use to create maximum visual impact.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Premium finishing options for branded shopping bags from Prime Packaging Boxes include gloss and matte lamination that enhances both the visual quality and durability of the bag, hot foil stamping for metallic logo and design details that create luxury brand signaling, soft-touch lamination for a premium tactile surface quality that communicates brand investment through touch, and embossing for three-dimensional logo and design details that create a distinctive premium quality experience when the bag is held.</span> \n<h3><b>Handle Types and Bag Formats</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The handle is both a functional and aesthetic element of paper shopping bag design, and Prime Packaging Boxes offers the full range of handle options to suit different brand aesthetics and functional requirements. Twisted paper rope handles in natural kraft, white, black, and custom colors create a premium artisanal aesthetic particularly popular with boutiques, gift stores, and specialty food retailers. Flat ribbon handles in satin or grosgrain create an elegant, gift-appropriate finish for fashion and luxury retail applications. Die-cut handles integrated into the bag construction provide the most economical and structurally simple handle option for high-volume retail applications. Cotton rope handles offer a premium, tactile alternative for luxury brand applications where the handle quality itself communicates brand investment.</span> \n<h2><b>Kraft Paper Shopping Bags Custom Logo Small Quantity — For Boutiques and Independent Retailers</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Independent boutiques, specialty stores, artisan food retailers, and small businesses that sell products in-store or at markets need professional branded shopping bags that communicate their brand identity to every customer who makes a purchase. Our kraft paper shopping bags with custom logo in small quantities from Prime Packaging Boxes make this professional retail presentation accessible for businesses at the smaller end of the retail scale, without minimum order requirements that force over-purchasing beyond actual sales volumes.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Kraft paper shopping bags have become the packaging signature of independent retail — the natural brown paper, the twisted rope handle, and the custom-printed logo create an aesthetic that communicates boutique quality, artisan values, and the personal care of independent retail in a way that generic plastic or plain brown bags completely fail to achieve. For independent retailers, the kraft shopping bag is not just functional packaging — it is a brand communication tool that reinforces the boutique experience with every customer who takes a purchase home.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small quantity kraft shopping bag orders from Prime Packaging Boxes start from as few as 50 bags, making professional branded retail packaging accessible for the smallest boutiques and market vendors. Every small quantity order receives the same quality of paper, printing, and handle construction as our largest wholesale orders — because every bag that carries your brand represents you to your customers and their extended networks.</span> \n<h2><b>Luxury Paper Gift Bags Custom Ribbon Handle Bulk — Premium Gifting Packaging at Scale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Premium retail and gift brands require shopping bags that communicate luxury from the moment they are handed across the counter. Our luxury paper gift bags with custom ribbon handles in bulk quantities from Prime Packaging Boxes deliver the premium packaging experience that high-end retail brands need to complement the quality of their products and the premium pricing they command. Ribbon handles, premium paper weights, luxury lamination finishes, and foil stamping combine to create bags that customers keep, reuse, and associate with the quality of the brand that gave them.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Bulk ordering of luxury ribbon handle paper bags from Prime Packaging Boxes delivers the pricing efficiency that makes luxury retail packaging commercially viable for premium brands operating at meaningful retail volumes. Our bulk luxury bag program is structured to support premium retailers during their highest-volume sales periods — particularly the Christmas gifting season, Valentine''s Day, and other major retail occasions when gift packaging demand peaks significantly.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom ribbon handle bags from Prime Packaging Boxes are available with ribbon in a comprehensive range of colors — from classic luxury colors like deep navy, forest green, and burgundy to bright seasonal colors and custom brand-matched colors. Ribbon quality options include standard satin for everyday retail gifting applications and premium grosgrain and specialty ribbon for ultra-luxury brand presentations. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to explore our full shopping bag range and get your custom wholesale quote today.</span>', 'Custom printed paper shopping bags with twisted or flat rope handles. Made from kraft or coated paper with full-color branding. Ideal for retail stores, boutiques, and events. Eco-friendly and recyclable. Wholesale pricing with low minimum order.', 18, '/api/uploads/brown-paper-bags.webp', '["/api/uploads/brown-paper-bags.webp","/api/uploads/custom-paper-shopping-bags-with-logo.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Printed Paper Shopping Bags With Handles Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom printed paper shopping bags with handles for wholesale. Kraft options, luxury ribbon bags, boutique bags, low MOQ. Prime Packaging Boxes USA — fast turnaround.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.950Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.866Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (35, 'Custom Eid Gift Boxes', 'custom-eid-gift-boxes', '<h1>Custom Eid Gift Boxes That Make the Celebration Feel as Special as It Is</h1>\n <p>Eid is one of the most generous gifting moments of the year — and for families, businesses, and brands serving Muslim communities across the United States, the presentation of a gift matters as deeply as the gift itself. Whether it''s a box of dates presented to guests after Eid prayer, a premium sweet and chocolate assortment sent to business partners in Dearborn or Jersey City, or a curated fragrance gift for family coming from out of town — the box communicates love, respect, and intention before it''s even opened.</p>\n <p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we produce custom Eid gift boxes for businesses, sweet shops, caterers, bakeries, and brands who want packaging that honors the occasion the way it deserves to be honored.</p>\n\n <h2>What an Eid Gift Box Should Feel Like Before It''s Opened</h2>\n <p>There''s a specific weight and presence that a premium Eid gift box needs to carry. It should feel substantial in the hand — not hollow, not flimsy. The lid should close with confidence. The exterior should communicate celebration without being garish. And when it''s placed on a table alongside other gifts or set in a display at a Ramadan market, it should stand out as clearly premium without trying too hard.</p>\n <p>We achieve this through material and construction choices that most generic gift box suppliers skip. Our Eid gift boxes are built from rigid board — typically 1200gsm to 2000gsm greyboard depending on box size — wrapped in printed art paper or specialty textured stock. This is the same construction used by luxury chocolatiers and high-end jewelry brands, and it''s what gives the box that satisfying rigidity and heft that immediately signals quality.</p>\n\n <h2>Eid Mubarak Gift Boxes Custom Printed — Finishing Options That Carry Celebration</h2>\n <p>Gold is the language of Eid gifting — and our finishing options are built around making gold work beautifully in print. Hot foil stamping in gold, rose gold, and champagne gives your logo, Eid Mubarak text, or geometric patterns a genuine metallic shine that no standard gold-colored ink can replicate. Spot UV coating adds a glossy dimension to selected print elements — star and moon motifs, floral borders, or your brand name — against a matte-laminated base that makes the contrast even richer.</p>\n <p>For sweet shop owners in Houston, gift retailers in Detroit, and fragrance brands in New Jersey who need to move large quantities before Eid al-Fitr or Eid al-Adha, our bulk production process keeps quality consistent across every unit in your run — whether that''s 200 boxes or 5,000.</p>\n <p>Popular structural options for Eid gift boxes include:</p>\n <ul>\n <li><strong>Magnetic closure boxes</strong> — the click of a magnet closing a premium rigid box is a detail that Eid gift recipients notice and remember. Available with custom ribbon pull tabs and interior printing.</li>\n <li><strong>Lift-lid rigid boxes</strong> — a two-piece setup with a fitted lid. Classic, elegant, and easy to layer tissue and products inside.</li>\n <li><strong>Drawer-style slide boxes</strong> — increasingly popular for date and sweet assortments, these give the unboxing moment a theatrical quality as the inner tray slides out slowly.</li>\n <li><strong>Window-lid boxes</strong> — a clear acetate window panel in the lid lets guests see the contents before opening, which works exceptionally well for visually arranged date boxes and macaron trays.</li>\n </ul>\n\n <h2>Custom Eid Gift Boxes Wholesale — Serving Communities From Coast to Coast</h2>\n <p>The Muslim American community is spread across every major metro — from communities in Dearborn and Detroit, to large populations in New York, Chicago, Houston, and Los Angeles. Brands, caterers, and retailers serving these communities need packaging that''s available in real wholesale quantities, ships fast enough to arrive before the holiday, and maintains consistent quality across every reorder.</p>\n <p>Our wholesale Eid gift box program starts at 100 units with full custom printing and premium finishing. We keep your artwork on file so seasonal reorders are fast and painless — critical when Eid dates shift year to year and lead times get tight.</p>\n\n <h2>Luxury Eid Gift Boxes Custom Logo Printed USA — For Corporate Gifting Programs</h2>\n <p>Corporate Eid gifting has grown significantly among US companies with diverse teams and Muslim employee populations. A well-designed Eid gift box — filled with dates, sweets, or a curated wellness package — sent by an employer to mark the end of Ramadan is a meaningful and appreciated gesture. For HR teams, community managers, and corporate gift coordinators, we produce branded Eid boxes with company logos and personalized messaging that make the gift feel intentional and respectful rather than generic.</p>\n <p>If you''re a corporate buyer looking for 300 to 5,000 custom Eid boxes with company branding, contact our team directly at <a href="mailto:help@primepackagingboxes.com">help@primepackagingboxes.com</a> and we''ll build a custom production plan around your timeline.</p>\n\n <h2>Production and Delivery Timeline</h2>\n <p>Standard production: 9 to 10 business days from artwork approval. Rush: 5 to 7 days. Free shipping across all 48 contiguous states. We strongly recommend ordering 3 to 4 weeks before Eid to ensure your packaging arrives with time for assembly and distribution.</p>\n <p>Browse our full <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/gift-boxes/">gift boxes</a> collection for more format options, or explore our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/rigid-boxes/">rigid boxes</a> range for ultra-premium construction. Contact us at <a href="mailto:help@primepackagingboxes.com">help@primepackagingboxes.com</a> or <a href="tel:8187584076">818-758-4076</a>.</p>', 'Custom Eid gift boxes with elegant printing, ribbon closures, and gold foil accents. Perfect for gifting dates, sweets, and luxury items during Eid celebrations. Low MOQ, fast delivery.', 17, '/api/uploads/custom-eid-celebration-gift-packaging.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-eid-celebration-gift-packaging.webp","/api/uploads/custom-eid-luxury-gift-packaging-box.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Eid Gift Boxes | Luxury Printed Packaging | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom Eid gift boxes with gold foil, ribbon closures &amp; full-color printing. Low MOQ, fast USA delivery. Perfect for dates, sweets &amp; luxury Eid gifts.', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.948Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.890Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (34, 'Custom Diwali Gift Boxes', 'custom-diwali-gift-boxes', '<h1>Custom Diwali Gift Boxes That Carry the Light of the Festival With Them</h1>\n <p>Diwali is the Festival of Lights — and across America, Indian communities in New Jersey, the Bay Area, Chicago, and Atlanta celebrate it with a gifting culture that''s rich, generous, and deeply personal. Mithai boxes passed between neighbors. Dry fruit assortments delivered to business partners. Candles, diyas, and puja items wrapped for extended family. The presentation of these gifts is not an afterthought in Diwali culture — it''s part of the gesture itself.</p>\n <p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we work with Indian sweet shops, gifting retailers, Diwali event organizers, and brands serving South Asian communities across the United States to produce custom Diwali gift boxes that match the vibrancy and warmth of the festival they represent.</p>\n\n <h2>The Visual Language of Diwali Packaging — Getting the Aesthetic Right</h2>\n <p>Diwali gifting has a distinct visual vocabulary: deep jewel tones like maroon, navy, and forest green accented with gold; geometric rangoli-inspired patterns; diya motifs; marigold florals; and celebratory typography that balances elegance with warmth. This is a palette and pattern language that resonates immediately with recipients who grew up with Diwali celebrations — and it communicates inclusiveness and cultural awareness to customers who are newer to the tradition.</p>\n <p>Getting this right in print requires more than just slapping a diya icon on a red box. The gold needs to be real — hot foil stamped, not printed gold ink, which never achieves the metallic luminosity the celebration calls for. The patterns need resolution and care in their placement. And the overall composition needs to feel festive without feeling chaotic.</p>\n <p>Our design team has experience working within South Asian festival aesthetics. If you come in with a specific visual direction, we execute it. If you''re starting fresh, we can build a design framework around your brand identity that works beautifully for Diwali packaging.</p>\n\n <h2>Diwali Packaging Boxes Custom Printed — Structural Options for Every Gifting Format</h2>\n <p>Diwali gifts cover a wide range of product categories, and each calls for a slightly different box structure.</p>\n <ul>\n <li><strong>Mithai and sweet boxes</strong> need to be food-safe on the interior, easy to open without disturbing an artfully arranged sweet tray, and strong enough to stack in a display without crushing. We produce rigid and folding carton options with food-safe interior liners and window panels for sweet-shop owners who want customers to see the mithai before buying.</li>\n <li><strong>Dry fruit and nut gift boxes</strong> are among the highest-volume Diwali packaging categories. These typically use a rigid base with a full-color printed sleeve or a magnetic lid box, often with individual compartments for different nut varieties. Presentation matters enormously here — a well-compartmentalized dry fruit assortment in a beautifully printed rigid box is a meaningful gift. In a plain paper bag, it''s just nuts.</li>\n <li><strong>Candle and home fragrance Diwali sets</strong> need packaging that holds glass safely, looks beautiful from the outside, and protects against breakage during shipping for DTC brands sending Diwali gifts across the country. Custom foam inserts or cardboard dividers cut to your candle dimensions are the right call here.</li>\n </ul>\n\n <h2>Custom Diwali Gift Boxes Wholesale — Serving Retailers and Event Businesses</h2>\n <p>Sweet shops in Edison, NJ and Sunnyvale, CA are ordering Diwali boxes by the thousands every October. Event caterers in Houston and Atlanta are assembling hundreds of hampers for corporate Diwali events. Gifting brands selling through Amazon and their own Shopify stores are shipping personalized Diwali sets to customers across the country.</p>\n <p>All of them need the same thing: consistent quality at wholesale volume, fast enough production to arrive before Deepavali, and pricing that makes margin possible. Our wholesale program delivers on all three.</p>\n\n <h2>Personalized Diwali Gift Boxes Custom Logo USA — For Brands That Want to Serve This Moment Well</h2>\n <p>If your brand has a presence in the South Asian American market — or wants to build one — Diwali is one of the highest-impact gifting occasions in your calendar. A beautifully branded Diwali gift box that customers photograph, share, and associate with your logo is worth far more than the box itself. Brands that show up visually for Diwali earn loyalty that carries through the rest of the year.</p>\n <p>For premium gifting and corporate programs, we can produce fully custom Diwali boxes with your brand identity integrated into a festive design — so it''s both deeply Diwali and unmistakably yours.</p>\n\n <h2>Diwali Gift Boxes Bulk Wholesale No Minimum — Planning Ahead for a Stress-Free Season</h2>\n <p>One of the biggest mistakes Diwali-season sellers make every year is leaving packaging too late. Production slots fill up in September as demand spikes, and rush orders — while available — carry a premium and add stress to an already busy pre-festival period. Brands that plan their Diwali packaging in July or August get better pricing, more relaxed design revisions, and first pick of production slots.</p>\n <p>We offer early-order planning consultations for seasonal buyers who want to get ahead of the rush. Reach out to our team in summer and we''ll lock in your pricing, finalize your design, and schedule production so your boxes arrive weeks before you need them.</p>\n\n <h2>Order Timeline and Delivery</h2>\n <p>Standard production: 9 to 10 business days from artwork approval. Rush: 5 to 7 days. Free shipping to all 48 contiguous states. Diwali falls in October or November each year — we recommend placing orders by early-to-mid September to ensure comfortable lead time, especially for larger runs.</p>\n <p>Browse our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/gift-boxes/">gift boxes</a> page for more gifting formats, or explore <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/rigid-boxes/">rigid boxes</a> for the highest-tier construction. Reach us at <a href="mailto:help@primepackagingboxes.com">help@primepackagingboxes.com</a> or <a href="tel:8187584076">818-758-4076</a>.</p>', 'Custom Diwali gift boxes with vibrant full-color printing, gold foil stamping, and premium finishes. Ideal for sweets, candles, and jewelry gifts. Low MOQ, fast turnaround.', 17, '/api/uploads/custom-diwali-festive-gift-packaging-box.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-diwali-festive-gift-packaging-box.webp","/api/uploads/traditional-diwali-sweet-gift-box.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Diwali Gift Boxes | Printed Festive Packaging | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom Diwali gift boxes with gold foil, vibrant printing &amp; premium finishes. Low MOQ, fast USA delivery. Perfect for sweets, candles &amp; festive gifts.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.946Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.892Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (37, 'Custom Ring Boxes', 'custom-ring-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Ring Boxes With Logo for Jewelry Store Wholesale — The Perfect Setting for Every Ring</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">A ring is one of the most emotionally significant purchases a person makes in their lifetime. Whether it is an engagement ring, a wedding band, a birthday gift, or a personal reward, the moment of presentation matters profoundly — and the box in which the ring is presented plays a central role in creating that moment. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom ring boxes with logo for jewelry store wholesale supply are crafted to honor the significance of every ring presentation, delivering packaging that is as beautiful and memorable as the jewelry inside.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Jewelry stores, independent jewelers, online jewelry brands, and artisan jewelry makers all share a common packaging challenge — they need ring boxes that communicate the quality and value of their jewelry, reflect their brand identity, and create a presentation experience that makes the recipient feel the full emotional weight of the moment. Generic, unbranded ring boxes undermine that experience. Custom branded ring boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes enhance it, creating a complete and cohesive jewelry brand experience from the moment the box is held.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Ring Boxes Wholesale — Professional Supply for Jewelry Businesses of All Sizes</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom ring boxes wholesale program is designed to serve jewelry businesses across the full spectrum of scale — from independent jewelers and artisan jewelry makers ordering modest quantities for their boutique operations to established jewelry retailers managing significant ongoing packaging requirements across multiple store locations or a high-volume online store.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes makes custom branded ring box packaging commercially accessible at every level of jewelry business scale. Our tiered pricing delivers better unit economics as order quantities increase, while even minimum wholesale quantities are priced to work within the economics of independent jewelry businesses where packaging cost is a real consideration relative to product value and margin.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Every wholesale ring box order from Prime Packaging Boxes is produced to a consistent, archived specification that ensures your packaging looks and performs identically on every reorder. Jewelry customers who receive a beautifully presented ring in your branded box and then return to purchase another piece expect the same quality of packaging presentation on their second and subsequent purchases. Our production consistency management ensures that expectation is always met.</span> \n<h2><b>Velvet Ring Boxes With Custom Logo — Luxury Lining for Precious Jewelry</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Velvet has been the material of choice for premium jewelry presentation for generations, and for good reason. The soft, deep texture of quality velvet creates a visual and tactile contrast with metal and gemstone jewelry that makes the jewelry itself appear more vivid, more precious, and more beautiful than it does against any other background material. Velvet ring boxes with custom logo from Prime Packaging Boxes combine this timeless presentation material with your brand identity, creating ring packaging that is both classically luxurious and distinctively branded.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our velvet ring boxes are available in a comprehensive range of velvet colors — classic black for maximum visual contrast with bright metals and gemstones, deep navy for a sophisticated contemporary alternative, ivory and cream for romantic and bridal applications, blush pink for feminine and fashion jewelry brands, and custom colors for brands with specific brand palette requirements. The velvet interior lining is precision-fitted to the ring slot dimensions to hold your rings securely and present them at the optimal viewing angle.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom logo application on velvet ring boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes is achieved through premium foil stamping on the box lid exterior — a finishing technique that creates a metallic logo impression that is both visually striking and highly durable. Gold, silver, rose gold, and other metallic foil colors are available to complement different brand aesthetics and jewelry styles. The combination of premium velvet interior and foil-stamped logo exterior creates ring packaging that communicates luxury from every angle.</span> \n<h3><b>Ring Box Styles and Closure Options</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom ring box range covers several structural styles to suit different jewelry presentation preferences and retail display requirements. Clamshell ring boxes with a hinged lid and integrated ring slot are the classic jewelry box format — familiar, functional, and universally recognized as premium presentation packaging. Rigid two-piece ring boxes with a separate lid create a more dramatic opening reveal that works particularly well for engagement ring and special occasion presentations. Drawer-style slide ring boxes create a distinctive lateral reveal effect that photographs beautifully for online jewelry marketing. Magnetic closure ring boxes add the satisfying snap of a magnetic closure to the premium rigid box construction, creating a complete luxury presentation experience. All styles are available with velvet, satin, suede, or custom fabric interior lining.</span> \n<h2><b>Luxury Velvet Ring Boxes Custom Printed Wholesale — Premium Presentation at Scale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">For jewelry businesses that need luxury velvet ring boxes in wholesale quantities with consistent custom branding, Prime Packaging Boxes delivers the production capability and quality management that high-volume premium jewelry packaging requires. Luxury packaging produced at scale presents specific challenges — maintaining the consistency of velvet color and texture, ensuring the precision of foil stamping registration across large production runs, and delivering the structural uniformity that retail display and customer experience require.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our luxury velvet ring box wholesale production process incorporates multiple quality checkpoints that verify velvet color consistency, foil stamping accuracy, ring slot dimension precision, and structural integrity across every unit in every production run. This rigorous quality management approach ensures that the 500th box in a production run is as perfect as the first — a standard of consistency that jewelry retailers and their discerning customers rightfully demand.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing for luxury velvet ring boxes reflects the premium materials and production care that genuine luxury packaging requires, while remaining competitive within the commercial context of jewelry retail packaging economics. Our pricing is structured to make luxury velvet ring packaging commercially viable for jewelry businesses that sell at the quality price points where premium presentation packaging is both expected and commercially justified.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Ring Gift Boxes With Ribbon and Logo No Minimum — For Every Occasion</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Not every ring purchase is a proposal or a formal jewelry retail transaction. Birthday gifts, anniversary presents, fashion jewelry purchases, and self-reward jewelry buying all create ring gifting occasions where the packaging needs to communicate warmth, thoughtfulness, and celebration rather than the formal luxury of an engagement presentation. Custom ring gift boxes with ribbon and logo and no minimum order from Prime Packaging Boxes serve all of these gifting contexts with packaging that is appropriately celebratory and beautifully branded.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Ribbon-finished ring gift boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes are available with satin ribbon in a full range of colors, tied in a bow on the box exterior for immediate gift-ready presentation that requires no additional wrapping. Custom logo printing on the box surface beneath the ribbon ensures that your brand is still visible and present even in the gift-wrapped presentation format. The combination of ribbon gift presentation and branded box creates packaging that works perfectly both as a retail display item and as a ready-to-give gift.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">No minimum order on custom ribbon ring gift boxes means that jewelry brands, boutiques, and individual jewelers can order branded gift ring packaging in the small quantities that match their actual gifting sales volumes. Whether you sell five gift-wrapped rings per week or fifty per day, our no minimum program allows you to maintain a consistent supply of professionally branded gift packaging without inventory management challenges or capital commitment concerns.</span> \n<h2><b>Personalized Ring Boxes for Jewelry Brand Wholesale — Build Brand Loyalty Through Packaging</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">In the competitive jewelry market, brand loyalty is built through the accumulation of positive experiences across every customer touchpoint — the quality of the jewelry, the service in the store or online, and the packaging in which the purchase arrives. Personalized ring boxes for jewelry brand wholesale supply from Prime Packaging Boxes ensure that the packaging touchpoint consistently reinforces the positive brand impression that your jewelry quality and service create.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Personalization options for wholesale jewelry brand ring boxes go beyond simple logo printing. Brand story elements printed inside the box lid create a narrative touchpoint that jewelry customers read and remember. Care and cleaning instructions for specific metal and gemstone types add practical value that customers appreciate. QR codes linking to authentication certificates, product care videos, or brand story content create digital engagement opportunities that extend the brand relationship beyond the physical purchase moment.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom ring boxes also serve a powerful role in the word-of-mouth marketing ecosystem that drives jewelry brand growth. When a recipient opens a beautifully packaged ring gift, the quality of the packaging is part of the story they tell when they share the moment with friends and family — in person and on social media. A ring presented in a generic box is just a ring. A ring presented in a beautifully crafted, branded box from your jewelry store is a complete brand experience that your customer will enthusiastically recommend. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to explore our ring box range and request your <a href="https://www.primepackagingboxes.com/">wholesale quote today</a>.</span>', 'Elegant custom ring boxes in velvet, satin, or rigid construction for premium jewelry presentation. Fully branded with your logo. Ideal for engagement rings, fashion jewelry, and retail. Wholesale pricing with foam and pillow insert options, low MOQ.', 19, '/api/uploads/ring-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/ring-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/ring-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/ring-boxes-1.webp","/api/uploads/printed-ring-boxes-bulk.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Ring Boxes With Logo for Jewelry Store Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom ring boxes with logo for your jewelry store. Velvet lining, magnetic closure, ribbon options, low MOQ wholesale. Luxury ring packaging — Prime Packaging Boxes USA.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.951Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.827Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (39, 'Custom Tea Boxes', 'custom-tea-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Printed Tea Boxes for Tea Brands Wholesale — Packaging That Honors the Art of Tea</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Tea is one of the world''s oldest and most culturally significant beverages, and the brands that sell premium tea understand that the packaging is as important as the tea itself in communicating the quality, provenance, and character of what is inside. At Prime Packaging Boxes, we produce custom printed tea boxes for tea brands wholesale — packaging that honors the ritual and artistry of tea, presents your brand with the sophistication that premium tea commands, and creates gifting experiences that tea lovers genuinely cherish.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The specialty tea market in the United States has grown dramatically as consumers have expanded beyond mass-market tea bags into single-origin loose leaf teas, herbal and botanical blends, ceremonial grade matcha, and artisan tea collections that rival premium wine in their complexity and price point. These premium products require packaging that communicates their premium nature — packaging that a consumer is proud to display in their kitchen, happy to give as a gift, and that tells the story of the tea and the brand inside effectively.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Tea Boxes Wholesale — Consistent Elegance for Growing Tea Brands</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom tea boxes wholesale program serves independent tea companies, specialty food brands, wellness product companies, and gift businesses that include premium tea in their product range. Whether you are a dedicated artisan tea brand building your direct-to-consumer business or a specialty food retailer developing a private label tea collection, our wholesale program delivers the quality and consistency that professional tea packaging requires.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes makes premium custom tea box packaging commercially accessible for tea brands at every stage of growth. Our tiered pricing structure rewards volume with better unit economics while maintaining accessible minimum order quantities for brands that are still building their customer base and production volumes. Every tier of the wholesale program delivers the same standard of materials, printing, and finishing that premium tea brand packaging demands.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Tea packaging presents specific material requirements that our wholesale program addresses comprehensively. Food safety is paramount — all materials used in tea boxes must be appropriate for indirect food contact and free from chemical substances that could transfer to the tea or affect its flavor profile. Our tea box materials are fully food-safe and certified for indirect contact with tea and other food products. Moisture resistance is also important for tea packaging, and our materials and construction methods are selected to protect tea from the humidity and moisture exposure that degrades tea quality over time.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Tea Gift Boxes Bulk — Tea Gifting Made Beautiful</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Tea is one of the most popular gifting choices in the specialty food and wellness categories, and the quality of the gift box is central to the success of tea as a gifting product. Custom tea gift boxes in bulk quantities from Prime Packaging Boxes give tea brands, gift companies, and retailers the packaging they need to present tea gifts with the elegance and thoughtfulness that tea gifting deserves.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our tea gift box range covers the spectrum from individual tea variety presentation boxes to multi-variety collection boxes, sampler sets, and full tea ceremony gift packages. Every format is available with custom printing, premium finishing options, and interior configurations designed to present individual tea portions, loose leaf bags, or loose leaf containers attractively and securely within the gift box structure.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Bulk ordering of tea gift boxes delivers the pricing efficiency that makes gift packaging commercially viable for tea brands operating at meaningful production volumes. Our bulk program is structured to support tea brands during peak gifting seasons — particularly the Christmas and holiday gifting period, Mother''s Day, and Valentine''s Day — when demand for tea gifting products spikes significantly and reliable supply of branded gift packaging is essential for meeting customer demand and fulfillment commitments.</span> \n<h3><b>Seasonal Tea Gift Box Designs</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Tea gifting has strong seasonal patterns, and tea brands that develop seasonal packaging designs for their key gifting periods consistently outperform those that rely on year-round standard packaging for all gifting occasions. Prime Packaging Boxes works with tea brands to develop seasonal gift box designs for Christmas and holiday gifting, Spring and Mother''s Day collections, Valentine''s Day romantic tea gift sets, and Autumn harvest tea collection presentations. Seasonal designs can be developed as complete packaging redesigns for specific gifting collections, or as design variants that refresh the standard packaging with seasonal colors, patterns, and messaging while maintaining the core brand identity elements.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Printed Tea Boxes for Tea Brands — Tell Your Tea Story</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The best tea brands have compelling stories — about the origins of their teas, the relationships they maintain with growers and producers, their approach to blending and quality selection, and the values that inform every aspect of how they source and sell their products. Custom printed tea boxes for tea brands from Prime Packaging Boxes give you the canvas to tell that story compellingly on every box — creating packaging that communicates your brand''s depth and authenticity to every customer who picks up your product.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Printing on tea boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes is available across all exterior surfaces in full color, allowing brands to incorporate origin maps, grower photography, botanical illustrations, tasting notes, and brand narrative alongside the practical product information that consumers and retailers require. The combination of beautiful design and authentic brand storytelling on tea packaging creates a product that consumers engage with intellectually and emotionally — building the kind of deep brand connection that drives loyalty and recommendation.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our design team has particular experience working with specialty food and beverage brands to develop packaging that communicates artisan quality and brand authenticity. If you are developing your tea packaging design for the first time or refreshing an existing packaging identity, our designers bring both technical expertise and genuine category knowledge to the creative process.</span> \n<h2><b>Luxury Tea Gift Boxes Custom Logo Small Quantity — Premium Without Large Commitments</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Artisan tea brands, specialty food retailers, and gift companies creating curated tea gift collections often need luxury tea gift boxes in relatively small quantities — for new product launches, seasonal limited editions, event-specific gift programs, or corporate gifting initiatives where the specific requirements do not justify large production runs. Our luxury tea gift boxes with custom logo in small quantity orders from Prime Packaging Boxes make premium tea gift packaging accessible without forcing large inventory commitments.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small quantity luxury tea gift boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes start from as few as 50 units, with all the premium construction and finishing options available in our standard luxury range — rigid construction, foil stamping, soft-touch lamination, custom interior configurations, and full-color printing. The per-unit cost at small quantities reflects the production economics of limited runs, but the quality of the packaging is identical to that of our largest wholesale orders.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small quantity ordering also gives tea brands the practical ability to test multiple packaging designs or formats simultaneously — ordering small quantities of two or three options and evaluating the response from retail buyers, gift recipients, and consumers before committing to a single design direction at larger production volumes. This test-and-learn approach is standard practice among sophisticated specialty food brands and is well-supported by our small quantity production capabilities.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Kraft Tea Boxes With Window and Logo — Natural Packaging for Artisan Tea</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The natural, sustainable aesthetic of kraft paper packaging aligns perfectly with the values that many artisan and specialty tea brands embody and communicate to their customers. Custom kraft tea boxes with window and logo from Prime Packaging Boxes combine the authentic, eco-conscious appeal of natural kraft paper with a clear window that allows customers to see the tea inside before purchase — creating packaging that is both values-aligned and commercially effective as a retail display solution.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The window in a kraft tea box serves a powerful commercial function for loose leaf tea and specialty tea products where the visual quality of the tea itself is a purchase motivator. Customers who can see the vibrant green of a premium matcha, the distinctive appearance of a hand-rolled oolong, or the rich complexity of a specialty blend loose leaf tea are significantly more likely to make a purchase decision than customers who cannot see what they are buying. The combination of kraft aesthetics and a product-revealing window creates packaging that is honest, authentic, and commercially compelling.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Eco friendly tea boxes with custom printing and no minimum order from Prime Packaging Boxes complete our tea packaging range for artisan and small-batch tea brands that need professional, sustainable packaging without large order commitments. Starting from 50 boxes, tea entrepreneurs can order kraft window tea boxes with their logo and brand design at pricing that works for a small specialty food business. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to request samples and discuss your tea packaging requirements with our team.</span>', 'Custom tea boxes with premium printing for herbal, loose leaf, and tea bag packaging. Food-safe materials, foil-lined options for freshness. Fully branded with your logo and design. Ideal for tea brands, health food stores, and gift sets. Wholesale pricing.', 22, '/api/uploads/tea-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/tea-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/tea-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/printed-tea-boxes-bulk.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Printed Tea Boxes for Tea Brands Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom printed tea boxes for tea brands wholesale. Luxury gift options, kraft with window, eco-friendly, no minimum. Sampler box dividers available — Prime Packaging Boxes USA.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.954Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.838Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (38, 'Custom Kraft Pizza Boxes', 'custom-kraft-pizza-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Kraft Pizza Boxes for Restaurants Wholesale — Quality Packaging for Every Slice of Your Brand</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Pizza is one of America''s most beloved foods, and the box it arrives in is a significant part of the pizza experience — from the moment the delivery arrives at the door to the Instagram photo before the first slice. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom kraft pizza boxes for restaurants wholesale give pizzerias, restaurant chains, food trucks, and independent pizza operators the branded packaging they need to make every pizza delivery and takeaway a complete brand experience that customers remember and share.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The pizza box is one of the most high-visibility pieces of packaging in the food service industry. It sits on kitchen tables, gets carried through neighborhoods, appears in countless food photographs on social media, and is seen by every person in the room where pizza is being enjoyed. For restaurants and pizzerias that invest in custom branded pizza boxes, this visibility is a continuous and high-impact marketing opportunity that generic plain boxes completely fail to exploit. Prime Packaging Boxes helps pizza businesses turn every box into a brand ambassador.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Pizza Boxes Wholesale — Reliable Supply for High-Volume Pizza Operations</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Pizza restaurants go through packaging at a rate that very few other food businesses can match. A busy pizzeria or pizza delivery operation can easily consume hundreds or thousands of boxes per week, making reliable wholesale supply a critical operational requirement. Our custom pizza boxes wholesale program is built specifically for the high-volume, time-sensitive supply needs of pizza restaurants, chains, and delivery operations — ensuring that you never run out of boxes during a busy service.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes for pizza boxes is structured to deliver competitive per-unit costs at the volumes that pizza operations require. Our tiered pricing model rewards the high volumes that pizza businesses generate with the best possible unit economics, making custom branded pizza boxes an affordable brand investment rather than an operational cost burden. Even at modest wholesale quantities, our pricing makes branded kraft pizza boxes more accessible than many pizza operators expect.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Supply reliability is absolutely non-negotiable for pizza operations. A delivery service that runs out of boxes cannot fulfill orders, and a dine-in restaurant without pizza boxes cannot process takeaway orders. Prime Packaging Boxes manages production scheduling and inventory for wholesale pizza box clients to ensure consistent, reliable supply that keeps pace with your operational demand. We work with our pizza box clients to establish reorder schedules and safety stock levels that prevent supply disruptions during your busiest trading periods.</span> \n<h2><b>Kraft Pizza Boxes Custom Printed — The Natural Choice for Quality Pizza Brands</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Kraft paper pizza boxes have become the packaging of choice for artisan pizzerias, wood-fired pizza restaurants, gourmet pizza brands, and food-conscious pizza operators who want their packaging to communicate the same quality and authenticity as their pizza. The natural brown kraft aesthetic immediately signals an artisan, premium approach to food that resonates powerfully with the quality-conscious pizza consumers who are willing to pay more for a genuinely excellent product.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom printing on kraft pizza boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes allows pizza brands to apply their complete visual identity to the natural kraft surface. Logo printing, brand colors, slogan typography, origin and ingredient stories, and social media handles all translate beautifully to kraft paper in one, two, or full-color printing treatments. The contrast between brand colors and the warm natural kraft background creates a visual aesthetic that is both distinctive and authentically aligned with the artisan food positioning that premium pizza brands cultivate.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Beyond brand printing, kraft pizza boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes are available with food-safety treatments that are essential for pizza packaging performance. Grease-resistant coatings prevent oil penetration that would compromise the structural integrity of the box and affect its appearance on delivery. Moisture-resistant treatments protect the box from steam and condensation generated by hot pizza. These functional treatments are applied without compromising the natural kraft appearance or the printability of the box surface.</span> \n<h3><b>Available Sizes and Formats</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes produces kraft pizza boxes in all standard pizza sizes to accommodate every pizza format in your menu. 8-inch boxes for personal pizzas and deep dish individual portions. 10-inch boxes for medium pizzas and specialty gourmet formats. 12-inch boxes for large pizzas, the most popular delivery size. 14-inch boxes for extra-large pizzas and sharing formats. 16-inch and 18-inch boxes for party-size and family-size pizzas. Square and rectangular boxes for non-circular specialty pizza formats. Custom dimensions are available for pizza brands with distinctive pizza formats that require packaging engineered to their specific dimensions. Ventilated box options with die-cut ventilation holes are available for operators who prioritize crust crispness during delivery.</span> \n<h2><b>Printed Pizza Boxes With Logo for Food Trucks — Mobile Branding at Its Best</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Food trucks are one of the most exciting and rapidly growing segments of the food service industry, and pizza food trucks have established themselves as a distinctive and popular format in cities, at festivals, markets, and private events across the United States. For pizza food truck operators, the pizza box is a uniquely powerful mobile marketing tool — it travels away from the truck with every customer, displaying your brand name and logo in every location where your customers enjoy their pizza.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Printed pizza boxes with logo for food truck operators from Prime Packaging Boxes are available in the smaller quantities that food truck operations typically require, with the same quality of custom printing and kraft materials as our full restaurant wholesale program. Food truck operators benefit particularly from our no-minimum and small-order programs, which allow them to order branded pizza boxes in quantities that match the variable demand patterns of a mobile food business without over-committing to inventory that creates storage challenges on a truck.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Food truck pizza box designs often emphasize bold, graphic brand identity elements that communicate effectively at the speed of a busy service environment — where customers are making quick visual assessments of multiple options and your packaging needs to make an immediate and memorable impression. Our design team works with food truck brands to develop pizza box designs that are bold, memorable, and perfectly calibrated for the visual environment of street food markets and events.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Size Kraft Pizza Boxes Wholesale Small Order — For Artisan and Specialty Pizza Brands</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Not every pizza is a standard round. Artisan pizza brands, specialty pizza operators, and innovative pizza concepts often work with distinctive pizza shapes, sizes, and formats that standard pizza box dimensions cannot accommodate. Our custom size kraft pizza boxes in small wholesale orders from Prime Packaging Boxes give specialty pizza operators the packaging that fits their specific product without forcing minimum order commitments that a small specialty operation cannot practically justify.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom sizing for pizza boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes is available for both standard circular pizza formats in non-standard dimensions and for rectangular, square, and irregular specialty formats. Our packaging engineers will work with you to develop box dimensions that provide a secure fit for your specific pizza format, adequate ventilation to maintain crust quality during delivery, and structural integrity to protect the pizza through the transit conditions your delivery operation involves.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small wholesale orders of custom size kraft pizza boxes are particularly popular with artisan pizza brands launching a new format, food service operations testing a new menu concept, and catering businesses that need custom pizza packaging for specific events or client requirements. Starting from as few as 100 units, custom size kraft pizza boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes give specialty pizza operators the professional branded packaging their distinctive products deserve without large inventory commitments.</span> \n<h2><b>Eco Friendly Kraft Pizza Boxes With Custom Logo Bulk — Sustainable Pizza Packaging</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Consumer expectations around the environmental responsibility of food packaging have shifted significantly in recent years, and pizza operations that use clearly eco-friendly packaging are increasingly valued by the environmentally conscious consumers who make up a growing and influential segment of the pizza market. Our eco friendly kraft pizza boxes with custom logo in bulk orders give pizza brands the ability to demonstrate genuine environmental commitment through their packaging choices while maintaining the full custom branding that builds customer recognition and loyalty.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our eco-friendly kraft pizza boxes are manufactured from sustainably sourced, FSC-certified kraft paper. The grease-resistant and moisture-resistant treatments applied to food-contact surfaces use food-safe, environmentally responsible formulations that do not compromise the compostability of the kraft paper. Custom logo printing uses water-based inks that are free from harmful chemical components. The complete eco-friendly pizza box is suitable for composting where industrial composting facilities are available, providing a genuine end-of-life environmental benefit that resonates powerfully with sustainability-conscious consumers.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Bulk ordering of eco-friendly custom logo kraft pizza boxes delivers the pricing efficiency that makes sustainable packaging commercially viable for pizza operations at scale. The per-unit cost of eco-friendly packaging from Prime Packaging Boxes is competitive with conventional pizza box alternatives, making the choice of sustainable packaging a straightforward commercial decision rather than a costly premium investment. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to explore our full pizza box range and get started with your custom wholesale quote today.</span>', 'Custom kraft pizza boxes in food-safe, grease-resistant corrugated board. Available in all standard sizes with full-color exterior printing. Eco-friendly, compostable options available. Ideal for pizzerias, restaurants, and delivery. Wholesale low MOQ.', 21, '/api/uploads/custom-kraft-pizza-boxes-with-logo.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-kraft-pizza-boxes-with-logo.webp","/api/uploads/printed-kraft-pizza-boxes-bulk.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Kraft Pizza Boxes for Restaurants Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom kraft pizza boxes for restaurants and food trucks wholesale. All sizes, eco-friendly options, logo printing, low MOQ. Fast turnaround — Prime Packaging Boxes USA.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.953Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.843Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (40, 'Custom Printed Packaging Sleeves', 'custom-printed-packaging-sleeves', '<h2>Custom Printed Packaging Sleeves — High-Quality Custom Packaging & Wholesale Boxes</h2>
<p>When it comes to elevating your product''s market presence, <strong>Custom Printed Packaging Sleeves</strong> from Prime Packaging Boxes offers the ultimate combination of structural durability, eye-catching visual aesthetics, and brand protection. Designed specifically for retail, e-commerce, and promotional applications, our custom packaging solutions ensure your product stands out on store shelves and creates an unforgettable unboxing experience for your customers.</p>

<h3>Why Choose Custom Printed Packaging Sleeves for Your Brand?</h3>
<p>In today''s competitive retail landscape, consumers make split-second buying decisions based on packaging presentation. High-quality custom packaging communicates professionalism, product value, and care. Our Custom Printed Packaging Sleeves is engineered using premium food-safe, eco-friendly, and heavy-duty materials tailored to your exact product dimensions and branding requirements. Whether launching a new product line or upgrading your existing packaging, Prime Packaging Boxes delivers unmatched quality and precision.</p>

<h3>Product Highlights & Features</h3>
<div><h2>Custom Tray & Sleeve Packaging — Premium Wrap-Around Sleeves</h2>
<p>Tray and sleeve packaging is a sophisticated retail format used by premium consumer brands for electronics, food, cosmetics, and gift products. The outer sleeve slides over a custom tray to create a clean, two-piece design that feels premium, unboxes beautifully, and showcases products with elegance.</p>
<ul>
<li>Precision-cut sleeve sized to your inner tray dimensions</li>
<li>Premium 16pt–18pt SBS board for the sleeve with full-color printing</li>
<li>Matte, gloss, and soft-touch lamination for the outer sleeve</li>
<li>Inner tray available in matching board or kraft</li>
<li>Suitable for cosmetics, skincare sets, food gifts, and tech accessories</li>
<li>Retail-ready format with barcoded back panel on request</li>
<li>Custom sleeve removal experience — smooth pull or tabbed open</li>
<li>100-unit minimum with 6–8 business day production</li>
</ul>
<p>Tray and sleeve packaging is a simple way to elevate any product to premium status. Prime Packaging builds custom tray and sleeve sets for brands across all categories. Get a free quote today.</p></div>


<h3>Key Specifications & Customization Capabilities</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Fully Custom Dimensions:</strong> Tailor-made length, width, and depth to fit your products snugly without movement during shipping.</li>
  <li><strong>Vibrant Full-Color Printing:</strong> High-definition CMYK and PMS Pantone color matching printed inside and outside the box.</li>
  <li><strong>Premium Material Stocks:</strong> Choose from 100% recyclable Kraft, Solid Bleached Sulfate (SBS) cardstock, rigid chipboard, or durable fluted corrugated board.</li>
  <li><strong>Luxury Finishing Options:</strong> Enhance your design with Gold/Silver Foil Stamping, Spot UV Coating, Embossing, Debossing, Matte Lamination, or Soft-Touch Velvet finish.</li>
  <li><strong>Custom Protective Inserts:</strong> Optional die-cut foam, cardboard partitions, or molded pulp trays to hold delicate items securely.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Sustainability & Eco-Friendly Materials</h3>
<p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we are committed to environmental responsibility. Our Custom Printed Packaging Sleeves options include 100% recyclable, biodegradable, and post-consumer recycled paperboard materials. We use non-toxic, eco-friendly vegetable and soy-based inks that deliver vivid color reproduction while minimizing environmental impact.</p>

<h3>Wholesale Benefits & Ordering with Prime Packaging Boxes</h3>
<p>Partnering with Prime Packaging Boxes means getting direct factory-direct wholesale pricing with no hidden fees. We provide:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Low Minimum Order Quantity:</strong> Order as few as 100 units to start your custom packaging run.</li>
  <li><strong>Fast Turnaround Times:</strong> Standard production in 7-10 business days with rush options available.</li>
  <li><strong>Free Design Support:</strong> Work directly with our expert structural and graphic packaging designers at zero extra cost.</li>
  <li><strong>Free 3D Digital Proofing:</strong> Review your artwork on a realistic 3D model before manufacturing begins.</li>
  <li><strong>Free Shipping Across USA:</strong> Fast, reliable doorstep delivery included with every order.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h3>
<p><strong>Q: What is the minimum order quantity for Custom Printed Packaging Sleeves?</strong><br/>
A: Our minimum order quantity (MOQ) starts at just 100 units, making custom packaging accessible for startups and established brands alike.</p>
<p><strong>Q: Can I print inside the box?</strong><br/>
A: Yes! We offer full-color CMYK printing on both the interior and exterior surfaces of your Custom Printed Packaging Sleeves.</p>
<p><strong>Q: How do I get a free custom quote?</strong><br/>
A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'Custom wrap-around printed sleeves for tray and sleeve packaging. Cost-effective premium branding.', 23, '/api/uploads/custom-packaging-sleeves-with-logo.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-packaging-sleeves-with-logo.webp","/api/uploads/printed-packaging-sleeves-bulk.webp"]', true, true, 100, 'Custom Custom Printed Packaging Sleeves | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Custom Printed Packaging Sleeves with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.955Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.171Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (44, 'Custom Cardboard Gift Boxes', 'custom-cardboard-gift-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Cardboard Gift Boxes With Logo No Minimum Order — Beautiful Gift Packaging for Every Brand and Occasion</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Gift packaging is one of the most emotionally charged categories in the entire packaging industry. When someone gives a gift, the packaging is a direct expression of the care and thought they have invested in the act of giving. When a brand sends a product as a gift, the packaging communicates the brand''s values, its attention to detail, and the level of care it extends to its customers and partners. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom cardboard gift boxes with logo and no minimum order requirements make beautiful, professional gift packaging accessible to brands, businesses, and individuals at every scale — from a solo entrepreneur sending their first gift packages to an established brand managing a large-scale gifting program.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Cardboard gift boxes are among the most versatile and widely used packaging formats in the retail and gifting industries. Their structural simplicity, excellent printability, wide range of available sizes and styles, and competitive pricing make them the practical choice for brands across virtually every consumer product category. Combined with custom printing, premium finishing, and thoughtful interior presentation, cardboard gift boxes can deliver gifting experiences that are genuinely luxurious — without the cost premium of rigid box construction.</span> \n<h2><b>Cardboard Gift Boxes Wholesale — Consistent Quality for Retail and Gifting Programs</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our cardboard gift boxes wholesale program serves retailers, brands, event planners, corporate gifting managers, and organizations across the United States that need consistent, high-quality custom gift packaging at commercially viable pricing. The wholesale program covers the full range of cardboard gift box styles, sizes, and customization options in a pricing structure that makes professional branded gift packaging accessible at every volume level.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes is designed to reward commitment and volume without excluding growing brands and organizations that are still building their gifting program scale. Tiered pricing delivers better unit economics as quantities increase, while even minimum wholesale orders are priced to deliver genuine commercial value. Every tier of the wholesale program delivers the same quality of materials, printing, and finishing — only the unit cost changes as volumes grow.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Retail clients who purchase gift boxes wholesale from Prime Packaging Boxes particularly value the production consistency that our quality management system delivers across every reorder. Gift boxes that carry a retailer''s brand need to look identical every time a customer receives one — the same colors, the same materials, the same structural quality. Our archived specification management and pre-shipment quality inspection process ensures that consistency is maintained across every production run, every reorder, and every season.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Gift Boxes With Logo Bulk — Make Every Gift a Brand Statement</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">When a customer receives a product in a beautifully printed, custom logo gift box, they receive two gifts simultaneously — the product itself and the experience of the brand. Custom gift boxes with logo printing in bulk quantities from Prime Packaging Boxes give brands the ability to make that dual gift experience consistent across every transaction, every season, and every customer relationship.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Bulk logo printing on gift boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes is available in a wide range of printing approaches to suit different brand aesthetics and budget parameters. Full-color digital printing creates vibrant, complex designs that incorporate multiple colors, gradients, photographic elements, and intricate pattern work. One-color and two-color offset printing creates clean, bold brand statements that work particularly effectively on white and kraft box surfaces. Foil stamping produces premium metallic logo effects on any base material, creating the kind of luxurious first impression that premium brands need to justify premium pricing.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The quality of logo printing on your gift boxes directly affects how customers perceive the value of the gift inside. Sharp, accurate, beautifully rendered logo printing signals a brand that cares about every detail of the customer experience. Blurry, inaccurate, or poorly registered printing sends exactly the opposite signal — and in the gifting context, that negative signal can undermine the entire gifting gesture. Prime Packaging Boxes invests in the printing technology and quality control processes that ensure your logo always looks its very best on every box we produce.</span> \n<h3><b>Gift Box Styles Available</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our cardboard gift box range covers every structural style that retail and gifting applications require. Two-piece lid and base boxes create a classic, satisfying unboxing experience with a cleanly separated lid reveal. Tuck-end gift boxes offer a single-piece construction that is faster to assemble and more cost-effective for high-volume gifting programs. Drawer-style slide boxes create a distinctive and elegant opening experience that is particularly effective for jewelry, accessories, and specialty food products. Shoulder boxes combine a rigid exterior aesthetic with the cost advantage of cardboard construction. Collapsible rigid boxes offer the premium appearance of rigid construction with the shipping efficiency and storage convenience of a flat-pack format.</span> \n<h2><b>Printed Cardboard Gift Boxes for Small Business — Big Brand Presentation on a Small Business Budget</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small businesses compete every day against larger, better-resourced competitors — and in many markets, their packaging is one of the most visible competitive battlegrounds. Printed cardboard gift boxes for small business customers from Prime Packaging Boxes give independent brands the ability to present their products with the same visual quality and brand consistency as their larger competitors, without the large order commitments or long production lead times that large-format packaging suppliers typically require.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our small business gift box program is built around the practical realities of running an independent business. Cash flow management means you cannot commit to large packaging inventory purchases before your sales volumes justify them. Storage constraints mean you cannot warehouse hundreds of boxes waiting to be used. Customer service expectations mean your packaging needs to arrive reliably and on time, every time. Prime Packaging Boxes addresses all of these practical concerns with low minimums, competitive pricing at small quantities, fast production lead times, and reliable on-time delivery.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Beyond the practical advantages, our small business gift box program gives independent brands access to the same design expertise, material quality, and finishing options as our largest wholesale clients. Your 100-box order of custom printed gift boxes receives exactly the same quality assurance treatment as a 10,000-box wholesale order. Every box that carries your brand out into the world is an ambassador for your business, and we take that responsibility seriously at every order size.</span> \n<h2><b>Luxury Cardboard Gift Boxes Custom Wholesale — Premium Without the Rigid Box Price Tag</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Luxury cardboard gift boxes produced for custom wholesale orders by Prime Packaging Boxes occupy an important commercial space between standard retail cardboard boxes and fully rigid luxury packaging. They deliver a genuinely premium presentation quality that supports premium product pricing and creates a positive unboxing experience, while maintaining the cost efficiency of cardboard construction that makes them commercially viable for brands selling at moderate rather than ultra-premium price points.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The luxury positioning of our premium cardboard gift boxes is achieved through a combination of higher-grade cardboard materials, premium printing and finishing treatments, and thoughtful structural design that creates a more substantial and satisfying physical experience than standard gift boxes. Thicker board weights, soft-touch lamination, foil stamping, and precision construction all contribute to a box that feels genuinely premium in the hands of the recipient.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom wholesale luxury cardboard gift boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes are particularly popular with cosmetic brands, specialty food companies, wellness product brands, boutique fashion accessories labels, and artisan product makers who need gift packaging that reflects the premium quality of their products without the cost overhead of fully rigid packaging construction. If your product is genuinely premium but your price point does not support rigid packaging economics, our luxury cardboard gift box range is the commercially smart solution.</span> \n<h2><b>Eco Friendly Cardboard Gift Boxes Custom Printed — Gifts That Give Back to the Planet</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The intersection of gifting and sustainability is one of the most commercially significant trends in contemporary packaging. Consumers who care about environmental impact — and that community is growing rapidly across every demographic — actively prefer to give and receive gifts packaged in materials that are recyclable, biodegradable, or made from sustainably sourced materials. Our eco friendly cardboard gift boxes custom printed with water-based inks from Prime Packaging Boxes deliver genuine environmental credentials without compromising on presentation quality.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our eco-friendly gift box range uses cardboard manufactured from FSC-certified fiber, ensuring that the wood pulp used in production comes from sustainably managed forest sources. Water-based printing inks eliminate the chemical emissions and disposal challenges associated with solvent-based printing. Biodegradable lamination options replace conventional plastic laminate films with materials that break down safely under composting conditions. Every element of our eco-friendly gift box construction is chosen for genuine environmental performance, not just for the ability to make environmental claims.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Eco-friendly gift packaging from Prime Packaging Boxes is available with all the same customization and visual quality options as our standard gift box range. Beautiful full-color printing, foil accents, and premium finishing are all achievable within an eco-responsible material framework. Your brand does not need to choose between looking premium and being environmentally responsible — our eco-friendly gift boxes prove that both are possible simultaneously. Visit <a href="https://www.primepackagingboxes.com/">primepackagingboxes.com</a> to request samples and get a custom quote for your gift box requirements.</span>', 'Custom cardboard gift boxes in premium coated board with full-color printing for retail and corporate gifting. Ribbon, tissue, and insert options available. Ideal for holiday seasons, product launches, and branded gifting. Wholesale low MOQ pricing.', 27, '/api/uploads/cardboard-gift-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/cardboard-gift-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/custom-cardboard-gift-boxes-with-logo.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Cardboard Gift Boxes With Logo No Minimum | Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom cardboard gift boxes with logo and no minimum order. Luxury options, wholesale pricing, eco-friendly available. Perfect for retail, weddings, and events — Prime Packaging Boxes USA.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.960Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.818Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (43, 'Custom Vape Cartridge Packaging', 'custom-vape-cartridge-packaging', '<h1><b>Custom Vape Cartridge Packaging Boxes With Child Lock — Compliant, Professional, and Brand-Forward</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The vape and cannabis market operates in a regulatory environment that places specific and non-negotiable requirements on product packaging — requirements that exist to protect consumers, particularly children, and to ensure that products are clearly identified and responsibly presented. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom vape cartridge packaging boxes with child lock mechanisms are engineered to satisfy these regulatory requirements fully while still delivering the premium brand presentation that positions vape products effectively in a sophisticated and competitive consumer market.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Child-resistant packaging for vape cartridges is a legal requirement in most US states with legal cannabis markets, and it is an increasingly expected standard in the broader vape industry regardless of state-specific legal requirements. Brands that invest in genuinely compliant child-resistant packaging demonstrate responsible product stewardship that builds consumer trust, facilitates retail channel access, and protects the brand from regulatory risk. Prime Packaging Boxes provides the technical expertise and production capabilities to deliver child-resistant vape packaging that is compliant, premium, and powerfully branded.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Vape Cartridge Boxes Wholesale — Reliable Supply for the Cannabis and Vape Industry</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom vape cartridge boxes wholesale program serves vape brands, cannabis operators, CBD companies, and vape accessories businesses across the United States who need consistent, compliant, professionally branded vape packaging at commercially viable pricing. The vape packaging market has specific regulatory compliance requirements that add complexity to the production process, and our wholesale program is structured to manage that complexity efficiently on behalf of our clients.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes for vape cartridge packaging reflects the compliance engineering requirements of child-resistant and tamper-evident packaging structures while remaining competitive within the commercial context of vape brand packaging economics. Our production team has extensive experience with the specific structural requirements of compliant vape packaging, enabling us to produce it efficiently and reliably at the quality and consistency standards that wholesale clients require.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Consistency across reorders is particularly important in the vape packaging category where retail channel access often depends on packaging meeting specific compliance specifications that have been verified by retail buyers or regulatory inspectors. Your packaging specification is archived from your first approved order, and every subsequent reorder is produced and quality-checked to match that specification precisely. Regulatory compliance is not something that can vary between production runs, and our quality management process ensures it never does.</span> \n<h2><b>Vape Packaging Boxes Custom Printed — Brand Identity in a Competitive Market</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The vape and cannabis retail market is intensely visual and highly competitive. Consumers browsing dispensary shelves or online vape retail platforms make rapid purchasing decisions based heavily on brand presentation and packaging quality. Custom printed vape packaging boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes give vape brands the visual impact and brand consistency they need to compete effectively for consumer attention in this challenging retail environment.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom printing on vape cartridge boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes covers the full range of design approaches that vape brand aesthetics require. Bold, graphic designs with strong color contrasts create immediate shelf impact in competitive retail environments. Minimalist premium designs with clean layouts, restrained color palettes, and precise typography communicate the sophisticated brand positioning that premium vape brands cultivate. Detailed product information layouts that incorporate all required regulatory text alongside compelling brand messaging satisfy both compliance requirements and consumer communication objectives simultaneously.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Finishing options for custom printed vape boxes include all the premium treatments that contemporary vape brand packaging commonly uses. Matte lamination with spot UV highlights creates a distinctive tactile and visual contrast that photographs excellently for online retail and social media. Holographic and metallic foil treatments create the vibrant, attention-commanding visual effects that work powerfully in competitive dispensary and vape retail environments. Soft-touch lamination provides the premium tactile experience that positions vape brands at the quality end of the market.</span> \n<h3><b>Required Regulatory Information for Vape Packaging</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Vape product packaging in the United States must typically incorporate a range of regulatory information elements that vary by state and product type. Common requirements include nicotine or THC content disclosure, health warnings and age restriction statements, batch numbers and product traceability information, ingredient disclosure for cannabis products, tamper-evidence indicators, child-resistant packaging certification, and state-specific compliance marks where applicable. Our design team works with vape and cannabis brands to incorporate all required regulatory information into packaging designs that meet compliance requirements while maintaining the visual brand quality that competitive vape retail demands.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Printed Vape Pen Boxes Wholesale USA — Packaging Built for the American Market</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The US vape and cannabis market has specific regulatory requirements, retail conventions, and consumer expectations that differ from international markets, and vape packaging produced specifically for the US market needs to reflect these specifics. Custom printed vape pen boxes for wholesale supply in the USA from Prime Packaging Boxes are designed and produced with US market requirements at the center of every production decision.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">US market vape packaging from Prime Packaging Boxes incorporates the child-resistant closure mechanisms required by most state cannabis regulations, the warning label requirements of the FDA and state-level regulatory bodies, the tamper-evidence features required by responsible retail channels, and the structural specifications that US postal and shipping regulations require for direct-to-consumer and wholesale distribution of vape products.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale production in the USA means faster shipping lead times, no import duties or customs delays, easier communication with our production team in your time zone, and the quality assurance confidence that comes from working with a US-based packaging partner who understands your market and your regulatory environment. Our wholesale vape packaging clients value all of these practical advantages alongside the quality and competitive pricing of our US production.</span> \n<h2><b>Vape Cartridge Display Boxes Custom Logo Small Order — For New Brands and Product Launches</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">New vape brands, cannabis startups, and established brands launching new vape product lines all face the same challenge — they need professional, compliant, branded packaging for their initial market entry without the financial commitment of large-quantity wholesale orders before their sales velocity is established. Our vape cartridge display boxes with custom logo in small order quantities from Prime Packaging Boxes solve this challenge directly.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small order vape packaging from Prime Packaging Boxes starts from as few as 100 units — enough to supply an initial retail launch, test the packaging with dispensary buyers and consumers, and gather the market response needed to make confident decisions about design refinements before scaling to larger wholesale orders. Every small order is produced to the same compliance standards as our wholesale production, because regulatory requirements do not make exceptions for small quantities.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Display box formats for vape cartridges are particularly effective for retail dispensary and vape shop environments where products are presented in open display cases or on retail shelving where consumers can examine the packaging closely before making a purchase decision. Our display box designs incorporate strong visual brand elements and clear product information on the most visible surfaces, optimizing the product''s retail display presence within a compact packaging footprint.</span> \n<h2><b>Child Resistant Vape Packaging Boxes Custom Printed — Compliance and Brand Quality Together</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The technical challenge of producing child-resistant packaging that is also genuinely beautiful and on-brand is one that many packaging suppliers address by choosing one objective at the expense of the other — producing compliant packaging that looks generic, or attractive packaging that does not meet compliance requirements. Prime Packaging Boxes refuses to accept that compromise. Our child resistant vape packaging boxes with custom printing deliver genuine compliance and genuine brand quality simultaneously, because our clients need and deserve both.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Child-resistant closure mechanisms for vape cartridge packaging from Prime Packaging Boxes include push-and-turn slide mechanisms for drawer-style boxes, certified child-resistant snap closures for tuck-end carton formats, and locking tab mechanisms for folding carton applications. All mechanisms are tested to ASTM D3475 or equivalent child-resistance standards. The structural design of the child-resistant elements is integrated into the overall packaging design so that compliance features enhance rather than compromise the brand presentation quality.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom printing on child-resistant vape packaging covers all exterior surfaces with your brand design, product information, and required regulatory content in a layout that presents all elements clearly and compellingly. Interior printing is available for brands that want to create an additional brand touchpoint within the packaging experience. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to request samples of our compliant vape packaging range and speak with our specialist team about your specific requirements.</span>', 'Custom vape cartridge packaging with childproof mechanisms and premium printed finish. Foil stamping, embossing, and spot UV available. Compliant packaging for vape and cannabis brands. Wholesale pricing with low MOQ, fast turnaround times.', 26, '/api/uploads/vape-cartridge-packaging.webp', '["/api/uploads/vape-cartridge-packaging.webp","/api/uploads/vape-cartridge-packaging-wholesale.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Vape Cartridge Packaging Boxes With Child Lock | Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom vape cartridge packaging boxes with child lock. Printed vape pen boxes wholesale USA, low MOQ, display options. Compliant vape packaging — Prime Packaging Boxes.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.959Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.874Z');
