A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'Professional custom printed presentation folders for corporate meetings, real estate, legal documents, and marketing collateral. Premium pocket folders.', 25, '/api/uploads/printed-presentation-folders-bulk.webp', '["/api/uploads/printed-presentation-folders-bulk.webp","/api/uploads/custom-die-cut-boxes-with-logo.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Custom Presentation Folders | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Custom Presentation Folders with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.958Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.176Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (46, 'Custom Kraft Boxes', 'custom-kraft-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Kraft Boxes With Logo No Minimum Order — Natural Packaging That Builds Brand Trust</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">There is a reason that kraft packaging has become the go-to aesthetic for artisan brands, natural product companies, and sustainability-conscious businesses across every consumer product category. The natural brown texture and honest simplicity of kraft paper communicates authenticity, environmental responsibility, and genuine product quality in a way that no synthetic material or bleached white cardboard can replicate. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom kraft boxes with logo and no minimum order requirement make this powerful packaging aesthetic accessible to brands at every stage of growth — from a solo entrepreneur making their first batch of products to an established brand managing a nationwide retail distribution.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Kraft paper derives its distinctive color and texture from the kraft pulping process, which produces a stronger and more durable paper fiber than standard chemical pulping methods. This means kraft boxes are not just aesthetically appealing — they are genuinely tougher and more resistant to tearing, moisture, and crushing than equivalent weight white cardboard. For brands that use their packaging as evidence of product quality, kraft boxes deliver a message that is both aesthetically compelling and structurally honest.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Kraft Boxes Wholesale — Sustainable Packaging at Commercial Scale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom kraft boxes wholesale program serves brands across virtually every consumer product category that values natural aesthetics, sustainable credentials, and artisan positioning. Whether you produce candles, soaps, cosmetics, food products, gifts, apparel accessories, or specialty retail goods, kraft box packaging can elevate your brand presentation while communicating the environmental values that today''s consumers increasingly expect from the brands they choose to support.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes makes custom kraft box packaging commercially accessible for brands at every production scale. Our tiered wholesale pricing rewards growing order volumes with progressively better unit economics, while even our minimum wholesale order quantities are priced to make sense for small and emerging brands that are building their customer base and sales volumes. We do not penalize early-stage brands with pricing structures that only work at industrial volumes.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our wholesale kraft box program covers the full range of kraft box styles — tuck-end retail boxes, two-piece lid and base boxes, drawer-style slide boxes, gable boxes with handles, window boxes with clear PET panels, and custom structural designs for brands with distinctive product shapes or retail display requirements. Every style is available in standard sizes for fast-turnaround orders and in fully custom dimensions for brands with specific product or shelf-fit requirements.</span> \n<h2><b>Eco Friendly Kraft Boxes With Custom Logo — Packaging That Tells Your Sustainability Story</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Sustainability is no longer a niche concern for a minority of environmentally motivated consumers — it has become a mainstream expectation that influences purchasing decisions across virtually every product category and consumer demographic. Eco friendly kraft boxes with custom logo from Prime Packaging Boxes give brands a packaging solution that genuinely meets this expectation, not through greenwashing or superficial environmental claims, but through the use of materials and production processes that have real and verifiable environmental credentials.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our eco-friendly kraft boxes are manufactured from FSC-certified kraft paper sourced from sustainably managed forests. The kraft pulping process uses fewer harmful chemicals than alternative pulping methods, producing a material that is stronger, more sustainable, and more easily recycled and composted than many alternative packaging materials. We print using water-based and soy-derived inks that eliminate the VOC emissions and chemical waste associated with solvent-based printing systems.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The environmental story of kraft packaging is one that brands can and should communicate proudly to their customers. Increasingly, consumers actively seek out brands that use sustainable packaging, and they reward those brands with their loyalty and their advocacy. By choosing eco-friendly kraft boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes, you are not just making a responsible environmental choice — you are making a smart commercial decision that builds brand affinity with the growing community of sustainability-conscious consumers.</span> \n<h3><b>Finishing Options for Kraft Boxes</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Kraft packaging does not have to mean plain packaging. Our custom kraft boxes are available with a range of finishing options that add premium visual and tactile quality while maintaining the natural aesthetic integrity of the kraft material. Matte lamination in a natural finish protects the printing and enhances durability while preserving the authentic kraft look. Uncoated natural finishes are available for brands that want the purest expression of the kraft aesthetic with maximum recyclability. Spot printing in one or two colors is the most popular option for kraft boxes, creating clean, graphic brand designs that work beautifully against the natural brown background. Full-color printing is available for more complex designs and photographic elements. Foil stamping in gold, silver, copper, and other metallic finishes creates striking premium details on kraft backgrounds that photograph exceptionally well for marketing purposes.</span> \n<h2><b>Printed Kraft Packaging Boxes for Small Business — Professional From Day One</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small businesses and independent entrepreneurs represent the largest and most diverse segment of Prime Packaging Boxes customers for kraft packaging. From handmade soap makers and artisan candle brands to boutique food producers, independent jewelry designers, small clothing labels, and specialty retail stores, our printed kraft packaging boxes for small business customers are the foundation of hundreds of growing brands across the United States.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The appeal of kraft packaging for small businesses goes beyond aesthetics. Kraft boxes communicate the brand values that are central to most small and independent businesses — authenticity, craft, environmental responsibility, and genuine quality. These are values that large corporate brands struggle to communicate credibly, but that small independent brands embody naturally. Kraft packaging amplifies those authentic values through a material choice that customers immediately and intuitively understand as the packaging of a brand that genuinely cares about what it makes and how it presents it.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our small business kraft packaging program includes free design consultation with our in-house team, who understand the visual language of artisan and independent brands and can help you create kraft box designs that connect authentically with your specific customer community. Whether you are refining an existing brand identity or building your packaging design from scratch, our designers bring both technical expertise and genuine market knowledge to the process.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Kraft Boxes for Product Packaging Wholesale — Every Product Deserves the Right Box</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Different products have different packaging requirements, and our custom kraft boxes for product packaging wholesale program covers the full spectrum of product types, sizes, and packaging functions that our clients need to serve. We engineer kraft box solutions for retail display packaging, gift presentation boxes, shipping and transit packaging, subscription box inserts, sample and tester packaging, promotional and seasonal packaging, and branded storage solutions that customers keep and reuse.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The wholesale program is structured to support brands that need multiple SKUs of kraft packaging — different sizes for different products in their range, different structural formats for different retail and gifting applications, and different design treatments for different product lines or seasonal collections. Our account management team helps wholesale clients plan their packaging requirements across their full product range, optimizing specifications and order quantities to minimize cost and inventory complexity.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Production lead times for custom kraft boxes wholesale orders are typically 10 to 14 business days from artwork approval for standard designs, with rush production available for urgent requirements. Reorders of previously produced specifications typically have faster turnaround times as your production files are already archived and approved in our system.</span> \n<h2><b>Natural Kraft Boxes Custom Size and Logo — Bespoke Packaging for Distinctive Products</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Standard box sizes do not fit every product, and forcing a distinctive product into a generic box size is a compromise that affects both the presentation and the protection of your product. Our natural kraft boxes in custom sizes and with your logo give you the freedom to specify packaging that fits your product perfectly — not the other way around. Custom sizing ensures your product sits correctly in the box, minimizes unnecessary void space that wastes material and increases shipping weight, and creates a more premium presentation that communicates the bespoke quality of your brand.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom sizing from Prime Packaging Boxes covers any dimension within our standard production range — length, width, and depth can each be specified to your exact requirements in millimeter increments. Our technical team will review your product dimensions and advise on the optimal internal dimensions, board weight, and structural format to achieve the best balance of product protection, presentation quality, and material efficiency for your specific application.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Logo and brand printing on custom-size kraft boxes follows exactly the same process as our standard range — full design consultation, accurate print color matching, premium finishing options, and rigorous quality control before shipping. Custom sizing never compromises print quality or finishing options at Prime Packaging Boxes. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to request a custom size quote and take the first step toward kraft packaging that fits your brand and your product perfectly.</span>', 'Sustainable custom kraft boxes from natural brown board — eco-friendly, sturdy, and fully printable. Suitable for retail, food, cosmetics, and gifts. Multiple sizes and styles available. Wholesale pricing with low MOQ for businesses of all sizes.', 29, '/api/uploads/custom-kraft-boxes-wholesale.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-kraft-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/custom-kraft-boxes-with-logo.webp","/api/uploads/printed-kraft-boxes-bulk.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Kraft Boxes With Logo No Minimum Order | Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom kraft boxes with logo and no minimum order. Eco-friendly, natural kraft packaging for small businesses and wholesale brands. Fast turnaround — Prime Packaging Boxes USA.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.966Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.814Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (47, 'Custom Kraft Seed Packet Envelopes', 'custom-kraft-seed-packet-envelopes', '<h1>Custom Seed Packet Envelopes That Grow Your Brand With Every Planting Season</h1>\n <p>There''s something deeply personal about buying seeds. Whether your customer is a backyard gardener in Vermont picking up heirloom tomato seeds at a Saturday market, a plant enthusiast in Los Angeles shopping your Etsy store for rare herb varieties, or a school community garden in Austin sourcing seed packets for a spring project — they''re investing in something that grows. Your packaging should feel like it''s part of that story.</p>\n <p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we produce custom seed packet envelopes for seed companies, nurseries, hobby farms, botanical shops, and independent gardeners who''ve turned their passion into a business. The envelopes we make aren''t generic — they''re printed to match your brand, scaled to your seed varieties, and built from paper stocks that hold up to display, shipping, and the occasional enthusiastic gardener handling them in the rain.</p>\n\n <h2>Why the Seed Packet Envelope Is One of the Most Underrated Branding Opportunities in Retail</h2>\n <p>It''s a small envelope. It costs very little per unit. And it gets handled, kept, written on, planted from, and sometimes framed or collected by the people who love your seeds. The surface area per impression ratio on a seed packet envelope is genuinely excellent — tiny format, big storytelling potential.</p>\n <p>The front panel is your brand moment — logo, product name, illustrated botanical art if that''s your style, or clean modern typography if you''re going contemporary. The back panel is your functional moment — planting instructions, germination rates, days to harvest, spacing information, water and sun requirements. Done well, the back of a seed packet is almost as valuable as a product insert because customers refer back to it all season.</p>\n <p>We print both sides with full-color, and our envelope sizes are fully customizable around your specific seed types — from tiny herb seeds to large bean or squash varieties.</p>\n\n <h2>Personalized Seed Envelopes Custom Printed — Material Choices That Match Your Brand Identity</h2>\n <p>The envelope material communicates your brand before a single word is read.</p>\n <ul>\n <li><strong>Natural kraft paper</strong> is the go-to for seed brands with an earthy, organic, heritage identity. The raw brown of kraft paper reads immediately as natural and farm-sourced — it''s a tactile signal that matches the product perfectly. Kraft holds ink beautifully and looks excellent at farmers markets and garden centers. It''s also slightly more moisture-resistant than standard paper, which matters when packets are displayed outdoors or in humid greenhouse settings.</li>\n <li><strong>White coated stock</strong> gives you a brighter canvas for full-color botanical illustration, vibrant color palettes, or a more contemporary, clean design direction. If your brand appeals to the modern urban gardening demographic — think rooftop herb gardens in Brooklyn or balcony container gardens in Chicago — white coated stock often fits better visually.</li>\n <li><strong>Recycled uncoated stock</strong> bridges both worlds — naturally textured, print-ready, and a genuine sustainability story you can tell on the back panel. For brands targeting eco-conscious buyers, the recycled stock itself becomes a selling point.</li>\n </ul>\n\n <h2>Custom Seed Packet Envelopes Wholesale — Pricing for Seed Companies at Every Stage</h2>\n <p>We''ve worked with a botanical herb company just starting out in Portland with 200 envelopes per SKU, a regional seed library in the Carolinas ordering 5,000 mixed variety packets seasonally, and a garden center chain across three Midwest states ordering in the tens of thousands.</p>\n <p>Every one of them gets the same print quality. The difference is unit pricing — which gets significantly better as volume increases. Our minimum order is 100 envelopes, and we can handle mixed variety orders across a single print run with proper file setup.</p>\n <p>For seed companies launching multiple new varieties each season, our repeat order program means your dielines and approved artwork stay on file. Reordering takes minutes instead of starting the artwork process from scratch.</p>\n\n <h2>Custom Seed Packets for Gardeners Bulk USA — Getting the Details Right</h2>\n <p>Seed packets have specific practical requirements that generic envelope suppliers often miss.</p>\n <ul>\n <li><strong>Closure type</strong> matters more than people expect — a glassine inner envelope keeps seeds dry inside a printed outer envelope, while a simple self-seal closure works well for thicker seeds that don''t require humidity protection. We can spec the right closure based on your seed category.</li>\n <li><strong>Sizing accuracy</strong> affects seed count and display consistency. If your packets need to hold exactly 25 seeds of a specific variety, we build the envelope dimensions around that specific fill volume — not a standard size that doesn''t quite fit.</li>\n <li><strong>Display hanging holes</strong> — many nurseries and garden centers peg-display seed packets. A reinforced hole punch at the top of your envelope allows your packets to hang without tearing, which is a small detail that makes a real difference for retail placement in garden shops from Vermont to California.</li>\n </ul>\n\n <h2>Personalized Seed Envelopes Wholesale No Minimum — Perfect for Makers Markets, Gifting, and Branded Giveaways</h2>\n <p>Custom seed packet envelopes have found an enthusiastic second market beyond the commercial seed industry. Botanical wedding favors, plant shop loyalty gifts, community garden fundraisers, school science projects, and corporate gifting programs (especially for sustainability-focused brands) all drive demand for small-batch custom seed packets.</p>\n <p>For these use cases, our 100-unit minimum is genuinely accessible. You can order 100 envelopes of a single custom design, or split across multiple varieties with proper artwork setup.</p>\n\n <h3>Ready to Print Your Seed Packets?</h3>\n <p>Submit your dimensions, artwork, and quantity and we''ll turn around a same-day quote. If you''re not sure on dimensions or paper type yet, our team is happy to talk through options before you commit to anything.</p>\n <p>Browse our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/paper-bags/">custom paper bags</a> for related flexible format options, or visit our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product/custom-kraft-boxes/">custom kraft boxes</a> page if you also package seed starter kits or gardening gift sets. Reach us at <a href="mailto:help@primepackagingboxes.com">help@primepackagingboxes.com</a> or call <a href="tel:8187584076">818-758-4076</a>.</p>', 'Custom seed packet envelopes with full-color printing for your plant or garden brand. Kraft or coated stock, low MOQ, fast turnaround. Perfect for nurseries, farmers markets, and seed companies.', 30, '/api/uploads/custom-kraft-seed-packet-envelope.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-kraft-seed-packet-envelope.webp","/api/uploads/printed-seed-packet-bulk-envelopes.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Seed Packet Envelopes | Printed Seed Packaging | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom seed packet envelopes with logo printing. Kraft or coated paper, low MOQ, fast USA delivery. Ideal for seed companies, nurseries &amp; garden brands.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.967Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.885Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (48, 'Custom Microgreens Packaging', 'custom-microgreens-packaging', '<h1>Microgreens Packaging That Keeps Them Fresh, Sellable, and Worth the Premium</h1>\n <p>Microgreens are one of the fastest-growing categories in local food — and that''s not hyperbole. Urban farms in Chicago, rooftop operations in New York, garage-scale growers in Sacramento, and everything in between have found a market for microgreens that barely existed a decade ago. Restaurants want them. Farmers markets love them. Natural grocery buyers actively seek local producers. And the home delivery subscription market for fresh microgreens has built real businesses for growers who figured out the logistics.</p>\n <p>But here''s where a lot of growers leave money behind: the packaging. You can grow a flawless tray of sunflower shoots or a picture-perfect pea tendril harvest — and lose the sale because the packaging doesn''t signal quality, doesn''t preserve freshness, or doesn''t sit properly on a retail shelf.</p>\n <p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we produce custom microgreens packaging for urban farms, commercial growers, CSA operations, and specialty produce suppliers who''ve put the work into the product and want packaging that reflects it.</p>\n\n <h2>Clamshell vs. Tray vs. Box — Choosing the Right Format for Your Channel</h2>\n <p>The format that works best for your microgreens operation depends almost entirely on where you''re selling — because the handling, display, and purchase behavior are different across channels.</p>\n <ul>\n <li><strong>Custom microgreens clamshell packaging</strong> is the standard format for farmers markets, independent grocery, and food co-ops. The hinged clamshell holds product upright and visible, creates a contained retail-ready unit that stacks consistently, and protects delicate greens from the jostling of a busy market environment. Clear-lid versions let the color and density of your harvest do the selling — and in a farmers market setting, visual appeal is your primary marketing tool. We print your branding on a custom insert card that fits inside the clamshell, or produce heat-shrink sleeve labels for a cleaner branded look.</li>\n <li><strong>Microgreens tray packaging</strong> suits wholesale restaurant and food service channels — the chefs buying your product don''t need a retail-ready clamshell, they need a format that delivers in quantity and stores cleanly in a walk-in. Printed kraft or SBS trays with a perforated ventilation pattern maintain airflow around the roots while keeping the product organized for kitchen use. Your brand, harvest date, and variety information printed directly on the tray builds professional credibility with restaurant buyers in cities like Philadelphia, Minneapolis, and Portland.</li>\n <li><strong>Custom microgreens boxes printed logo</strong> are a growing choice for premium direct-to-consumer subscriptions and gift produce boxes. A folding box with a window panel or a rigid gift format with your brand story printed inside communicates a level of care and intentionality that commands premium pricing — and earns the kind of unboxing social media share that grows subscription lists.</li>\n </ul>\n\n <h2>Eco Microgreens Packaging Boxes Custom Logo — The Sustainability Angle That Actually Matters Here</h2>\n <p>Microgreens buyers are almost universally environmentally conscious. They''re buying local produce, supporting urban agriculture, and thinking about food miles. Packaging that contradicts those values — non-recyclable plastic, excessive material — creates a friction point that can genuinely cost you repeat business.</p>\n <p>Our eco microgreens packaging options use compostable PLA clamshells, FSC-certified kraft board trays, and recycled SBS for box formats — all printed with soy-based inks. The PLA clamshell is particularly well-suited to microgreens because it''s fully compostable in municipal systems, which lets you add a genuine "100% compostable packaging" call-out to your brand story without greenwashing.</p>\n <p>For growers selling at markets or through co-ops where eco credentials carry real weight with buyers, this isn''t just a feel-good choice — it''s a competitive advantage.</p>\n\n <h2>Microgreens Packaging Boxes Wholesale — Consistent Supply for Growers on a Production Schedule</h2>\n <p>Microgreens production runs on tight cycles — a week from seed to harvest for some varieties, two weeks for others. Your packaging supply needs to keep pace with your harvest schedule without you having to reorder every two weeks and stress about lead times. Our wholesale program and dieline-on-file system means reorders are fast and consistent. You place the order, we produce to your approved spec, and it ships on our standard timeline.</p>\n <p>For growers managing multiple varieties with different packaging sizes — sunflower, pea, radish, broccoli, mixed salad blends — we maintain each SKU''s dieline separately so you can reorder individual sizes independently as your production mix changes week to week.</p>\n\n <h2>Custom Microgreens Boxes Printed Logo — What Your Label Needs to Say</h2>\n <p>Farmers market buyers and natural grocery customers have gotten sophisticated about fresh produce labeling. They want to know the variety, the farm name, the harvest date, and ideally something about your growing practices — whether that''s organic, pesticide-free, locally grown, or hydroponic. Microgreens packaging that carries this information clearly — and in a format that''s readable in a busy market environment — converts browsers into buyers faster than packaging that leads only with visual design.</p>\n <p>We lay out your label information on every printable panel of your clamshell insert, sleeve, or box so that the required compliance data (net weight, farm identity) and the brand story content (variety name, flavor notes, suggested use) each get the real estate they need without crowding each other.</p>\n\n <h2>Custom Microgreens Packaging No Minimum USA — Starting With What You Need</h2>\n <p>If you''re a newer grower building your first retail accounts or testing a farmers market setup, committing to thousands of clamshells or trays before you know your weekly volume is a real risk. Our 100-unit minimum means you get professionally printed, correctly sized packaging from the start — without over-investing in inventory you''re not ready for.</p>\n <p>Standard production: 9 to 10 business days from artwork approval. Rush: 5 to 7 days. Free shipping to all 48 contiguous states.</p>\n <p>Browse our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/food-boxes/">food boxes</a> for additional fresh produce and food packaging options. For eco-forward packaging, check our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product/custom-kraft-boxes/">custom kraft boxes</a> page. Contact us at <a href="mailto:help@primepackagingboxes.com">help@primepackagingboxes.com</a> or <a href="tel:8187584076">818-758-4076</a>.</p>', 'Custom microgreens packaging boxes and clamshells with full-color printing. Ventilated, food-safe, and available in low MOQ for urban farmers, grocery suppliers, and microgreens businesses.', 30, '/api/uploads/custom-microgreens-retail-packaging-box.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-microgreens-retail-packaging-box.webp","/api/uploads/printed-microgreens-wholesale-box.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Microgreens Packaging | Clamshells &amp; Boxes | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom microgreens packaging boxes and clamshells. Ventilated, food-safe, full-color printing, low MOQ. Fast USA delivery for microgreens farms and suppliers.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.969Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.900Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (45, 'Custom Corrugated Mailer Boxes', 'corrugated-custom-mailer-boxes', '<h2>Custom Corrugated Mailer Boxes — High-Quality Custom Packaging & Wholesale Boxes</h2>
<p>When it comes to elevating your product''s market presence, <strong>Custom Corrugated Mailer Boxes</strong> from Prime Packaging Boxes offers the ultimate combination of structural durability, eye-catching visual aesthetics, and brand protection. Designed specifically for retail, e-commerce, and promotional applications, our custom packaging solutions ensure your product stands out on store shelves and creates an unforgettable unboxing experience for your customers.</p>

<h3>Why Choose Custom Corrugated Mailer Boxes for Your Brand?</h3>
<p>In today''s competitive retail landscape, consumers make split-second buying decisions based on packaging presentation. High-quality custom packaging communicates professionalism, product value, and care. Our Custom Corrugated Mailer Boxes is engineered using premium food-safe, eco-friendly, and heavy-duty materials tailored to your exact product dimensions and branding requirements. Whether launching a new product line or upgrading your existing packaging, Prime Packaging Boxes delivers unmatched quality and precision.</p>

<h3>Product Highlights & Features</h3>
<div><h2>Custom Corrugated Mailer Boxes — Strong E-Commerce Shipping</h2>
<p>In e-commerce, your box is your brand — and it needs to survive the shipping journey while creating a memorable unboxing experience. Our custom corrugated mailer boxes are built for DTC brands, subscription boxes, and online retailers who want the strength of corrugated with the beauty of full-color printing.</p>
<ul>
<li>Single-wall (B/E-flute) and double-wall construction for heavy or fragile items</li>
<li>Full-color outside and inside printing for immersive unboxing experiences</li>
<li>Self-locking tuck closure — no tape needed for clean, easy opening</li>
<li>Custom sizes to minimize dimensional weight fees</li>
<li>Eco-friendly 100% recycled corrugated options</li>
<li>Amazon FBA-compliant sizes available</li>
<li>Bulk pricing from 100 units — competitive for high-volume operations</li>
<li>6–8 business day turnaround with rush options available</li>
</ul>
<p>Every corrugated box you ship is a brand impression. Prime Packaging builds custom corrugated mailer boxes for DTC and e-commerce brands across the USA. Get a free quote and 3D proof today.</p></div>


<h3>Key Specifications & Customization Capabilities</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Fully Custom Dimensions:</strong> Tailor-made length, width, and depth to fit your products snugly without movement during shipping.</li>
  <li><strong>Vibrant Full-Color Printing:</strong> High-definition CMYK and PMS Pantone color matching printed inside and outside the box.</li>
  <li><strong>Premium Material Stocks:</strong> Choose from 100% recyclable Kraft, Solid Bleached Sulfate (SBS) cardstock, rigid chipboard, or durable fluted corrugated board.</li>
  <li><strong>Luxury Finishing Options:</strong> Enhance your design with Gold/Silver Foil Stamping, Spot UV Coating, Embossing, Debossing, Matte Lamination, or Soft-Touch Velvet finish.</li>
  <li><strong>Custom Protective Inserts:</strong> Optional die-cut foam, cardboard partitions, or molded pulp trays to hold delicate items securely.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Sustainability & Eco-Friendly Materials</h3>
<p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we are committed to environmental responsibility. Our Custom Corrugated Mailer Boxes options include 100% recyclable, biodegradable, and post-consumer recycled paperboard materials. We use non-toxic, eco-friendly vegetable and soy-based inks that deliver vivid color reproduction while minimizing environmental impact.</p>

<h3>Wholesale Benefits & Ordering with Prime Packaging Boxes</h3>
<p>Partnering with Prime Packaging Boxes means getting direct factory-direct wholesale pricing with no hidden fees. We provide:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Low Minimum Order Quantity:</strong> Order as few as 100 units to start your custom packaging run.</li>
  <li><strong>Fast Turnaround Times:</strong> Standard production in 7-10 business days with rush options available.</li>
  <li><strong>Free Design Support:</strong> Work directly with our expert structural and graphic packaging designers at zero extra cost.</li>
  <li><strong>Free 3D Digital Proofing:</strong> Review your artwork on a realistic 3D model before manufacturing begins.</li>
  <li><strong>Free Shipping Across USA:</strong> Fast, reliable doorstep delivery included with every order.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h3>
<p><strong>Q: What is the minimum order quantity for Custom Corrugated Mailer Boxes?</strong><br/>
A: Our minimum order quantity (MOQ) starts at just 100 units, making custom packaging accessible for startups and established brands alike.</p>
<p><strong>Q: Can I print inside the box?</strong><br/>
A: Yes! We offer full-color CMYK printing on both the interior and exterior surfaces of your Custom Corrugated Mailer Boxes.</p>
<p><strong>Q: How do I get a free custom quote?</strong><br/>
A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'Durable corrugated mailer boxes for e-commerce shipping. Single and double-wall construction with custom printing.', 28, '/api/uploads/corrugated-mailer-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/corrugated-mailer-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/corrugated-mailer-boxes-wholesale.webp"]', true, true, 100, 'Custom Custom Corrugated Mailer Boxes | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Custom Corrugated Mailer Boxes with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.963Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.178Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (52, 'Custom Tallow Balm Packaging', 'custom-tallow-balm-packaging', '<h2>Custom Tallow Balm Packaging — Luxury Boxes for Organic Skincare Brands</h2>
<p>As natural skincare and traditional tallow balm products rapidly gain popularity, establishing a distinct brand presence on retail shelves and online storefronts is paramount. Custom Tallow Balm Packaging Boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes provide the perfect blend of structural protection, eco-friendly materials, and high-end visual appeal. Designed specifically for glass jars, metal tins, and ointment containers, our custom boxes elevate your brand''s craft quality while keeping your skincare products safe during shipping and retail display.</p>

<h3>The Importance of Custom Packaging for Natural Skincare</h3>
<p>Consumers who purchase organic tallow balms, salve jars, and artisanal body creams value purity, quality, and craftsmanship. Your packaging is the very first physical connection your customer has with your product. A custom-printed box with tactile finishes, clean typography, and sturdy paperboard signals premium quality before the customer even opens the lid. Protective inner inserts ensure that heavy glass jars do not rattle or break during transit.</p>

<h3>Key Features & Product Specifications</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Precision Fit for Jars & Tins:</strong> Custom-engineered box dimensions for 1oz, 2oz, 4oz, and 8oz tallow balm jars, glass containers, and aluminum tins.</li>
  <li><strong>Secure Box Styles:</strong> Available in reverse tuck end, straight tuck end, rigid setup boxes, and two-piece lid-and-base configurations.</li>
  <li><strong>Protective Custom Inserts:</strong> Die-cut foam, cardboard, or Kraft paper inserts to cushion fragile glass jars during nationwide shipping.</li>
  <li><strong>High-Resolution Full-Color Printing:</strong> Crisp CMYK and PMS color matching for vibrant logos, ingredient lists, usage instructions, and batch details.</li>
  <li><strong>Eco-Friendly Cardboard Stocks:</strong> Made from 100% recyclable, FSC-certified Kraft and virgin paperboard materials.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Material Options & Finishes</h3>
<p>Choose from our wide selection of sustainable paper stocks and luxury embellishments:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Unbleached Recycled Kraft Paperboard:</strong> Gives your tallow balm an earthy, authentic, zero-waste aesthetic that resonates with natural skincare buyers.</li>
  <li><strong>Premium White SBS Cardstock:</strong> Smooth, bright surface ideal for high-definition photographic prints, botanical illustrations, and pastel colors.</li>
  <li><strong>Foil Stamping & Embossing:</strong> Highlight your brand logo with metallic gold, rose gold, or copper foil, or add raised relief text for a tactile hand-feel.</li>
  <li><strong>Soft-Touch & Matte Lamination:</strong> Delivers a velvet-like texture that communicates pure luxury upon contact.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Order Custom Tallow Balm Boxes Wholesale</h3>
<p>Partner with Prime Packaging Boxes for reliable USA packaging manufacturing. We offer low MOQs starting at 100 boxes, free digital 3D proofing, 100% free graphic design consultation, and fast delivery. Request a custom quote today to elevate your tallow balm brand packaging!</p>', 'Luxury custom tallow balm boxes and retail packaging designed for natural skincare brands. Durable, eco-friendly, and beautifully printed with premium finishes.', 31, '/api/uploads/tallow-balm-unscented-product-box.webp', '["/api/uploads/tallow-balm-unscented-product-box.webp","/api/uploads/printed-tallow-balm-skincare-packaging-box.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Tallow Balm Boxes | Eco Printed Skincare Packaging | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom tallow balm boxes with logo printing. Eco-friendly kraft and coated options, low MOQ, fast USA delivery for tallow balm and natural skincare brands.', 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.974Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.111Z');
