<li>100-unit minimum — accessible for beauty startups and indie brands</li>
</ul>
<p>Premium skincare packaging starts with the right box. Prime Packaging builds custom cream jar boxes for indie beauty brands and luxury skincare lines. Get a free quote and 3D design proof today.</p></div>


