A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'Premium custom cream jar packaging for skincare and cosmetic brands. Soft-touch, foil, and spot UV finishes.', 31, '/api/uploads/custom-cream-jars.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-cream-jars.webp","/api/uploads/custom-cream-jars-wholesale.webp"]', true, true, 100, 'Custom Custom Cream Jar Packaging | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Custom Cream Jar Packaging with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.970Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.180Z');
