A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'Exquisite custom perfume boxes and fragrance packaging designed for luxury perfume bottles. Rigid construction, velvet inserts, foil stamping, and premium finishes.', 31, '/api/uploads/printed-perfume-boxes-bulk.webp', '["/api/uploads/printed-perfume-boxes-bulk.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Custom Perfume Boxes | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Custom Perfume Boxes with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.973Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.182Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (56, 'Custom Resealable Mylar Bags', 'custom-resealable-mylar-bags', '<h1><b>Custom Printed Resealable Mylar Bags for Food Packaging — Keep Your Product Fresh and Your Brand Visible</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">In the food packaging industry, two things matter above everything else — freshness and presentation. Your customers need to trust that the product inside your bag is fresh, safe, and properly protected. And before they even open the bag, your packaging needs to communicate your brand identity clearly and compellingly. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom printed resealable mylar bags for food packaging deliver on both fronts, helping food brands across the USA protect their products and grow their businesses.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Mylar bags — made from biaxially oriented polyethylene terephthalate film — are the industry standard for food preservation. The material creates a powerful barrier against oxygen, moisture, light, and odors, dramatically extending the shelf life of a wide range of food products. Combined with a resealable ziplock closure, mylar packaging gives consumers the convenience they expect while keeping your product at its best from first opening to last use. Add your brand logo, colors, product information, and custom design, and you have packaging that works as hard for your marketing as it does for your food science.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Mylar Bags Wholesale — Scalable Packaging for Growing Food Brands</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom mylar bags wholesale program is built for food businesses that need consistent, high-quality branded packaging at volumes that make commercial sense. Whether you are a small-batch artisan producer ordering a few hundred bags or an established food brand placing orders in the tens of thousands, Prime Packaging Boxes delivers the same quality and service at every scale.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes is structured to reward volume without penalizing growing brands that are not yet at industrial scale. Our tiered pricing model means you benefit from better unit costs as your order quantities grow, but even our entry-level wholesale quantities come with pricing that works for a food business operating at reasonable margins. We understand the economics of the food industry, and we structure our packaging pricing to be a genuine business asset rather than a financial burden.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">All our wholesale mylar bags are available in a comprehensive range of standard sizes covering everything from individual single-serve snack portions to large multi-pound bulk storage bags. Standard sizes can be ordered with a fast turnaround from existing production templates, while fully custom dimensions are available for brands with specific product or retail shelf requirements. Every size is available with full custom printing, your choice of finish, and your selection of closure type.</span> \n<h2><b>Resealable Mylar Bags Custom Printed — Your Brand on Every Bag</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">A plain, unbranded mylar bag communicates nothing positive about your product or your business. Custom printed resealable mylar bags from Prime Packaging Boxes transform functional food packaging into a powerful brand marketing tool that works every time a customer picks up your product, opens your bag, or displays it in their pantry or kitchen.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">We print using high-quality rotogravure and digital printing technologies that deliver vivid, accurate color reproduction across your entire bag surface. Up to ten-color printing is available for complex brand designs with multiple colors, photographic elements, or detailed product photography. Pantone color matching ensures your brand colors are reproduced accurately and consistently across every production run, maintaining the visual coherence your brand identity requires.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom printing options include full wraparound designs that cover every surface of the bag, front and back panel printing for brands that prefer a cleaner structural aesthetic, and spot printing for logos, barcodes, and product information panels. Finish options include matte, gloss, and soft-touch surface treatments that give your bags a premium tactile and visual quality that communicates brand confidence at the retail shelf.</span> \n<h3><b>Printing Information You Can Include</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Your custom mylar bags from Prime Packaging Boxes can carry all the product and brand information your customers and retailers need. This includes your brand logo and product name, ingredient lists and nutritional information, allergen warnings and certifications, barcode and QR code panels, storage instructions and best-before information, your website and social media handles, and any certifications or quality marks relevant to your product and market. Our design team will help you organize all required information into a clean, compliant, and visually compelling bag design.</span> \n<h2><b>Smell Proof Mylar Bags Custom Printed With No Minimum — For Specialty and Herbal Products</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The smell proof properties of high-quality mylar film make these bags the preferred packaging choice for a range of specialty product categories where odor containment is a functional and regulatory necessity. Our smell proof mylar bags custom printed with no minimum order restrictions are particularly popular with brands selling herbal products, specialty teas, artisan coffee, dried botanicals, pet treats, and a range of other products where aroma containment is a valued product feature.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our no minimum order policy on smell proof mylar bags means that small brands, startup businesses, and entrepreneurs testing new products can access professional, fully custom printed packaging without committing to large quantities before their sales volumes justify the investment. You can order as few as 50 bags to launch a new product, test a new design, or create a seasonal limited edition without financial pressure.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The smell proof barrier in our premium mylar bags is achieved through a multi-layer film construction that combines polyester, aluminum foil, and polyethylene layers engineered specifically for maximum barrier performance. This construction not only contains odors effectively but also provides outstanding protection against moisture ingress, UV light degradation, and oxygen exposure — all of which are primary causes of premature product deterioration in dry food and herbal product categories.</span> \n<h2><b>Stand Up Mylar Bags With Ziplock Custom Logo Wholesale — Retail-Ready Packaging</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Stand up mylar bags with ziplock custom logo for wholesale supply have become one of the most popular packaging formats in the specialty food, coffee, tea, snack, and herbal products markets. The stand-up pouch format — sometimes called a Doypack — offers a combination of functional benefits and retail display advantages that flat bags and rigid containers simply cannot match.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The stand-up design allows your product to display itself vertically on retail shelves, creating a larger visible brand presence and a more professional retail appearance. The integrated ziplock reseal closure gives consumers the convenience of easy opening and repeated secure resealing, extending the practical usability of your packaging and encouraging positive reviews and repeat purchases. The flat base gusset that enables the stand-up functionality also creates additional surface area on the base panel for supplementary brand information, certifications, or decorative design elements.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our stand-up ziplock mylar bags are available with a range of additional functional features including one-way degassing valves for fresh coffee and other products that off-gas after processing, tear notches for easy first opening, hang holes for peg display in retail environments, and clear window panels that allow consumers to see the product inside before purchase. Every feature can be combined with your full custom printed design and logo to create a complete retail-ready packaging solution.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Mylar Bags for Coffee and Food Storage — Engineered for Long-Term Freshness</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Coffee is one of the most packaging-sensitive food products on the market. Freshly roasted coffee begins losing its optimal flavor profile almost immediately upon exposure to oxygen, moisture, and light. Custom mylar bags for coffee and food storage from Prime Packaging Boxes provide the multi-barrier protection that premium coffee deserves, helping roasters and coffee brands deliver the freshest possible product to their customers.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our coffee mylar bags are available with integrated one-way degassing valves that allow carbon dioxide released by freshly roasted beans to escape from the bag without allowing oxygen to enter. This valve technology is essential for packaging coffee shortly after roasting and is a key differentiator for specialty coffee brands that compete on freshness and quality. The valve can be positioned on the front or back panel of the bag according to your design preferences.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Beyond coffee, our food storage mylar bags are trusted by brands selling dried fruits, nuts, granola, protein powders, spices, herbs, freeze-dried foods, pet treats, and a wide range of other dry and semi-dry food products. The exceptional barrier properties of our mylar film keep these products fresh, flavorful, and nutritionally intact significantly longer than standard flexible packaging alternatives.</span> \n<h2><b>Why Food Brands Across the USA Trust Prime Packaging Boxes for Mylar Bags</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes has established itself as a reliable and trusted supplier of custom mylar bag packaging to food brands, specialty product companies, and entrepreneurs across the United States. Our clients return to us repeatedly because we consistently deliver on the commitments that matter most to food businesses: packaging quality that protects their products, print quality that represents their brands accurately, production reliability that keeps their supply chains running smoothly, and service that makes the ordering process genuinely simple.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our mylar bags are produced from food-safe, FDA-compliant materials that meet the regulatory requirements for direct food contact packaging in the United States. We maintain full traceability of all raw materials and can provide material safety data and compliance documentation on request for brands operating in regulated food categories. Visit primepackagingboxes.com today to request samples, get a custom quote, and speak with our packaging specialists about your specific product and packaging requirements.</span>', 'Custom resealable mylar bags with high-barrier foil construction for superior freshness. Ideal for food, cannabis, supplements, and snacks. Fully printed with your branding in stand-up or flat pouch styles. FDA-compliant materials, wholesale pricing.', 34, '/api/uploads/resealable-mylar-bags.webp', '["/api/uploads/resealable-mylar-bags.webp","/api/uploads/resealable-mylar-bags-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/printed-resealable-mylar-bags-bulk.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Printed Resealable Mylar Bags for Food Packaging | Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom printed resealable mylar bags for food packaging. Stand-up ziplock bags, smell-proof options, low MOQ. Trusted by food brands across the USA — Prime Packaging Boxes.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.982Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.796Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (55, 'Custom Die-Cut Stickers', 'custom-die-cut-stickers', '<h1><b>Custom Die Cut Stickers With Logo for Small Business — Affordable Branding That Goes Everywhere</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Stickers are one of the most versatile, cost-effective, and genuinely popular brand marketing tools available to small businesses. A well-designed, professionally produced custom die cut sticker with your logo travels further, lasts longer, and creates more brand impressions per dollar than almost any other marketing investment a small business can make. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom die cut stickers with logo for small businesses are produced with the same quality and precision that large brands expect — at pricing and minimum quantities that work for businesses of every size.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Die cutting takes sticker production beyond the standard rectangle or circle. Die cut stickers are cut to the precise outline of your logo, illustration, or design shape — creating stickers that have no wasted background material and present your brand design in its exact intended form. A logo sticker cut to the exact shape of the logo is dramatically more impactful and professional-looking than the same logo printed inside a square or circle of background color. This precision cutting is what makes die cut stickers the preferred format for serious brands that want their sticker marketing to look genuinely professional.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Die Cut Stickers Wholesale — Bulk Branding at Scale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom die cut stickers wholesale program serves businesses, brands, event organizers, marketing agencies, and promotional merchandise companies that need large quantities of consistently high-quality branded stickers at commercially competitive pricing. The wholesale program covers the full range of sticker materials, shapes, sizes, and finish options in a pricing structure that makes professional branded stickers accessible and commercially viable at every volume level.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes for die cut stickers delivers the per-unit economics that make sticker marketing commercially practical at scale. Stickers are inherently a high-volume marketing tool — their effectiveness comes partly from their quantity, from placing your brand in many places simultaneously and giving customers multiple stickers to share across their own networks and belongings. Our wholesale pricing reflects this volume-dependent marketing logic, delivering better unit costs at the quantities where sticker marketing generates meaningful reach.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale die cut stickers from Prime Packaging Boxes are available on continuous roll formats for brands that need to apply stickers mechanically at scale, in sheet formats for hand-application and pack inclusion, and in individual unit formats for retail, gifting, and promotional distribution. Every format is available with the same quality of die cutting, printing, and material specification — the format choice is determined by your intended application rather than by quality differences between options.</span> \n<h2><b>Die Cut Stickers Bulk Order — Maximum Reach for Your Brand</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The commercial logic of sticker marketing is simple — the more stickers you distribute, the more places your brand appears, and the more impressions your brand accumulates over time. Bulk ordering of die cut stickers from Prime Packaging Boxes gives brands the sticker inventory they need to execute genuinely impactful sticker marketing campaigns across multiple channels simultaneously — packaging inclusion, event distribution, retail display, customer reward programs, and social media marketing kit assembly.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Bulk die cut stickers are particularly effective as packaging inserts — including a sticker or sticker sheet in every order creates an immediate gifting moment that customers appreciate, while simultaneously distributing your brand across the personal belongings and social media posts of your customer base. This packaging insert sticker strategy has become a signature marketing tactic of some of the most successful direct-to-consumer brands in the US market, and Prime Packaging Boxes produces the bulk sticker quantities that make it practically executable.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Bulk sticker orders from Prime Packaging Boxes benefit from volume pricing that makes including stickers in every single package a financially practical decision even for brands with high daily order volumes. Our production capacity supports large bulk sticker orders with consistent quality and reliable delivery timelines that accommodate the supply chain planning requirements of fast-growing direct-to-consumer brands.</span> \n<h3><b>Sticker Materials and Durability Options</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes produces custom die cut stickers in several material specifications to match different application environments and durability requirements. Standard white vinyl stickers provide excellent printability, weather resistance, and a clean, professional appearance suitable for most promotional and packaging label applications. Clear vinyl stickers create a transparent background effect that allows the surface beneath to show through — ideal for window displays, glass surfaces, and product packaging where a no-label look is desired. Matte vinyl stickers provide a sophisticated, non-reflective surface finish that works particularly well for logo stickers on dark or textured surfaces. Holographic vinyl creates rainbow metallic effects that command attention and are popular for lifestyle, music, and fashion brand sticker marketing. All vinyl sticker materials are waterproof, UV-resistant, and durable enough for outdoor and high-wear application environments.</span> \n<h2><b>Waterproof Die Cut Stickers Custom Bulk Wholesale — Built to Last Everywhere</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The most effective sticker marketing requires stickers that last. A sticker that fades, peels, or deteriorates within weeks of application creates a negative brand impression rather than the positive one it was designed to deliver. Our waterproof die cut stickers in custom bulk wholesale quantities from Prime Packaging Boxes are manufactured from premium vinyl materials with UV-resistant inks and lamination treatments that ensure your stickers maintain their visual quality for years across a wide range of application environments and weather conditions.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Waterproof sticker construction from Prime Packaging Boxes uses a three-layer manufacturing process — premium vinyl face stock, high-quality fade-resistant printing, and a laminate overcoat that protects the print from moisture, scratching, UV exposure, and general wear. This construction ensures that stickers applied to water bottles, laptops, vehicles, outdoor equipment, and other high-wear surfaces maintain their brand-building visual quality throughout their application life.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Bulk wholesale waterproof stickers are particularly popular with outdoor sports and lifestyle brands, beverage brands that want their stickers on water bottles and gear, automotive and vehicle accessory brands, and any brand whose customers live active, outdoor-oriented lives where packaging-quality stickers would quickly deteriorate. Our waterproof bulk stickers deliver the durability these applications demand at the competitive wholesale pricing that bulk sticker marketing requires.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Die Cut Vinyl Stickers No Minimum Order — Professional Stickers for Every Budget</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">One of the most common barriers for small businesses wanting to use professional custom stickers for their marketing is the minimum order requirement at most sticker printing suppliers. When you only need a few hundred stickers for a product launch, an event, or a packaging run, being forced to order thousands creates inventory management problems and unnecessary cost. Our custom die cut vinyl stickers with no minimum order from Prime Packaging Boxes remove that barrier completely.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Starting from as few as 50 stickers, small businesses, solo entrepreneurs, market vendors, and event organizers can order professional die cut vinyl stickers with their exact logo shape, custom colors, and chosen material specification. No minimum order stickers from Prime Packaging Boxes are produced on the same production equipment as our wholesale orders, using the same materials and quality standards — the only difference is the quantity produced per order.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">No minimum order is particularly valuable for businesses testing a new sticker design before committing to a large order, for seasonal or event-specific sticker designs that have a defined and limited distribution period, and for small businesses that are still building their customer base and want to include stickers in their early orders without over-investing in sticker inventory. Order what you need, when you need it, and scale your sticker orders as your brand and customer base grow.</span> \n<h2><b>Kiss Cut Sticker Sheets Custom Printed Wholesale — Versatile Sticker Marketing</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Kiss cut sticker sheets — where multiple sticker designs are cut to their individual outlines but remain on a shared backing sheet — are one of the most popular sticker formats for brands that want to distribute multiple sticker designs in a single packaged format. The sheet format makes kiss cut stickers easy to include in packaging, bags, and mailers without individual stickers becoming tangled or losing their backing paper, and it creates an attractive presentation that increases the perceived value of the sticker inclusion.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom printed kiss cut sticker sheets from Prime Packaging Boxes in wholesale quantities serve brands that use sticker sheets as packaging inserts, promotional giveaways, merchandise products, and event marketing materials. The sheet format allows multiple design variations — different logo treatments, different illustrations, different product-specific designs — to be presented together in a single, coherent brand collection that gives recipients genuine variety and encourages them to use multiple stickers across multiple surfaces.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale kiss cut sticker sheet production from Prime Packaging Boxes is available in custom sheet sizes from small postcard-format sheets to large A4 and letter-format sheets with multiple sticker designs per sheet. Die cutting precision ensures that every sticker on every sheet is cut cleanly to its design outline, with easy peel-and-apply performance that makes the consumer experience of using your sticker sheets as satisfying as the brand impression they create. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to explore our full sticker range and get your custom wholesale quote today.</span>', 'Custom die cut stickers in any shape, made from premium vinyl with UV-resistant inks. Perfect for product labeling, branding, packaging, and promotional use. Waterproof, scratch-resistant, and fully customizable. Wholesale pricing, low MOQ.', 33, '/api/uploads/custom-die-cut-stickers-with-logo.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-die-cut-stickers-with-logo.webp","/api/uploads/custom-die-cut-boxes-with-logo.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Die Cut Stickers | Printed Vinyl Stickers Wholesale', 'Custom die cut stickers printed in any shape &amp; size. Waterproof vinyl, vibrant colors &amp; your logo. Wholesale pricing, fast USA shipping. Get a free quote today!', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.980Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.856Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (54, 'Custom Mushroom Chocolate Bar Boxes', 'custom-mushroom-chocolate-bar-boxes', '<h1>Mushroom Grow Kit Boxes That Turn a Humble Hobby Into a Brandable Business</h1>\n <p>Home mushroom growing has gone from a niche permaculture hobby to a mainstream wellness trend — and if you''re selling grow kits, you already know how fast this market has grown. Oyster kits on Etsy. Lion''s mane blocks at farmers markets in Portland and Denver. Subscription boxes shipped to customers in Chicago and Charlotte who are growing their first flush on a kitchen counter. It''s a genuinely exciting space — and the brands building real businesses from it are treating their packaging as seriously as the product inside.</p>\n <p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we produce custom mushroom grow kit boxes for independent cultivators, commercial kit producers, and gift kit brands who want packaging that reflects the quality of what''s inside the box — not just a plain brown shipper that arrived from a generic supplier.</p>\n\n <h2>What Makes Grow Kit Packaging Different From a Regular Product Box</h2>\n <p>A mushroom grow kit has some specific physical demands that most generic box formats aren''t built around. The substrate block is heavy and moist. The kit contents — block, bag, spray bottle, instructions — have irregular shapes. And unlike most retail products, the box has a functional life after unpacking: many customers keep the grow kit inside the box during the fruiting stage, using the box itself as a humidity chamber or display base.</p>\n <p>That last point matters more than most kit sellers realize. If your box falls apart the moment it gets misted, you''ve got a customer support problem and a brand credibility problem at the same time.</p>\n <p>We spec mushroom grow kit boxes from moisture-resistant corrugated board — typically 200# or 275# single or double-wall — which handles the weight of the substrate block, survives the humidity of a fruiting environment, and still ships cleanly through standard carrier networks. We also offer die-cut ventilation slots on the front or side panels for sellers whose customers use the box as an active fruiting chamber, which is common with oyster and lion''s mane kits.</p>\n\n <h2>Mushroom Grow Kit Packaging Wholesale — Designed for Every Stage of Your Business</h2>\n <p>Whether you''re producing 200 grow kits a month out of a garage in Oregon or running a commercial cultivation facility in Pennsylvania supplying co-ops and specialty grocery stores across the mid-Atlantic, your packaging needs to work at your current volume and be ready to scale with you.</p>\n <p>Our wholesale mushroom grow kit box pricing starts at 100 units. For commercial producers, we offer tiered pricing across higher quantities — and because we keep your approved dieline on file, reordering is as simple as sending a message with your quantity. No resubmitting artwork, no re-approval delays, no surprises on the final print.</p>\n <p>For kit producers running multiple varieties — oyster, lion''s mane, shiitake, reishi, pink oyster — we can set up your dielines so that the artwork changes per variety while the box structure stays identical. This keeps production efficient and your inventory manageable.</p>\n\n <h2>Oyster Mushroom Grow Kit Boxes Custom Printed — The Visual Angle That Sells the Kit</h2>\n <p>The visual language of the mushroom grow market has developed a pretty consistent personality — earthy tones, botanical illustration, nature-forward photography, clean educational typography. Customers in this space respond to packaging that feels honest and craft-oriented. An overly slick, corporate-looking box can actually work against you in this market.</p>\n <p>That said, there''s real room to stand out within that aesthetic range. The most memorable grow kit brands we''ve worked with aren''t following the category template — they''re using their specific mushroom variety as a visual hero. A full-bleed macro photo of clustered oyster mushrooms emerging from substrate on the front panel, with your logo living cleanly in that environment, is the kind of packaging that stops a browser mid-scroll and earns an Instagram tag on flush day.</p>\n <p>Our design team can help you find the right visual approach whether you have full artwork ready or you''re starting from a logo and a general direction.</p>\n\n <h2>Mushroom Grow Kit Gift Boxes Custom Logo USA — Tapping the Gift Market</h2>\n <p>A significant and growing portion of mushroom grow kit sales are gift purchases — birthday gifts, holiday gifts, corporate wellness gifts, and Father''s Day presents for the foodie dad who has everything. This gift-buying occasion is where premium packaging pays for itself fastest.</p>\n <p>A gift-oriented grow kit box benefits from a slightly more elevated presentation than a standard retail pack — a magnetic closure or tuck-front with a ribbon pull, interior printing with grow instructions designed to look like a premium insert, and exterior print that reads like a gift on its own before it''s even opened.</p>\n <p>Brands selling grow kits in gift formats at specialty retailers in cities like San Francisco, Boston, and Nashville have seen meaningful lift in average order value when the packaging is clearly gift-ready out of the box — no wrapping required.</p>\n\n <h2>Turnaround, Shipping, and Samples</h2>\n <p>Standard production runs 9 to 10 business days from artwork approval. Rush available in 5 to 7 days. Free shipping to all 48 contiguous states — corrugated orders included.</p>\n <p>We recommend requesting physical samples before your first large run so you can test moisture resistance and structural performance with an actual inoculated substrate block. That''s not something you want to discover is a problem on order 500.</p>\n <p>Visit our <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product-category/food-boxes/">food boxes</a> page for related formats, or browse <a href="https://primepackagingboxes.com/product/custom-kraft-boxes/">custom kraft boxes</a> if you''re looking for a more earthy, uncoated aesthetic. Reach us at <a href="mailto:help@primepackagingboxes.com">help@primepackagingboxes.com</a> or call <a href="tel:8187584076">818-758-4076</a>.</p>', 'Custom mushroom grow kit boxes with your logo and full-color printing. Sturdy corrugated cardboard with ventilation windows available. Ideal for mushroom farming and hobby grow kit brands.', 32, '/api/uploads/custom-mushroom-infused-chocolate-bar-box.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-mushroom-infused-chocolate-bar-box.webp","/api/uploads/custom-mushroom-cultivation-kit-box.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Mushroom Grow Kit Boxes | Custom Logo Printed | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Custom mushroom grow kit boxes with logo printing. Ventilation window options, corrugated cardboard, low MOQ. Fast USA delivery for mushroom farming brands.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.977Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.888Z');
