<h3>Sustainability & Eco-Friendly Materials</h3>
<p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we are committed to environmental responsibility. Our Custom Kratom Mylar Pouches options include 100% recyclable, biodegradable, and post-consumer recycled paperboard materials. We use non-toxic, eco-friendly vegetable and soy-based inks that deliver vivid color reproduction while minimizing environmental impact.</p>

