<p><strong>Q: Can I print inside the box?</strong><br/>
A: Yes! We offer full-color CMYK printing on both the interior and exterior surfaces of your Custom Kratom Mylar Pouches.</p>
<p><strong>Q: How do I get a free custom quote?</strong><br/>
A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'Compliant custom kratom mylar stand-up pouches with child-resistant zippers and full-color branding.', 34, '/api/uploads/custom-kratom-mylar-stand-up-pouch.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-kratom-mylar-stand-up-pouch.webp","/api/uploads/printed-kratom-resealable-packaging-bag.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Custom Kratom Mylar Pouches | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Custom Kratom Mylar Pouches with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.983Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.186Z');
