<div><h2>Custom Kava & Adaptogen Packaging — Herbal Wellness Brands</h2>
<p>Kava, ashwagandha, lion''s mane, and adaptogen blends are among the fastest-growing supplement categories. Our custom kava and adaptogen packaging pouches and boxes are built for the wellness-forward consumer who trusts premium, clearly labeled products from brands that look as credible as their clinical claims.</p>
