<li>High-barrier mylar pouches and rigid box options for adaptogen products</li>
<li>Earthy, wellness-forward design printing — kraft, forest green, deep brown palettes</li>
<li>Full-color printing with botanical illustration support</li>
<li>Resealable zip-lock and tin-tie closure options for powders</li>
<li>Supplement facts and botanical sourcing panel space</li>
<li>QR code integration for product origin and lab testing transparency</li>
<li>Sustainable and eco-friendly board and pouch options</li>
