INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (50, 'Custom Lip Gloss Boxes', 'custom-lip-gloss-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Lip Gloss Boxes With Logo  Packaging That Sells Your Brand</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Your lip gloss deserves packaging that stops customers in their tracks. At Prime Packaging Boxes, we specialize in custom lip gloss boxes with logo printing that helps beauty brands — big and small — stand out on shelves, in subscription boxes, and across social media. Whether you are launching your first product line or scaling an established brand, our packaging solutions are built to impress and convert.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">We understand that for many beauty entrepreneurs, the packaging is just as important as the product inside. A poorly designed or flimsy box can hurt your brand image before a customer even tries your gloss. That is why every box we produce at Prime Packaging Boxes is crafted with precision, premium materials, and your brand identity at its core. From the moment a customer receives your product, the packaging communicates the quality, care, and personality of your brand.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Lip Gloss Boxes Wholesale — Bulk Pricing Without Compromising Quality</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">When you order custom lip gloss boxes wholesale from Prime Packaging Boxes, you get the best of both worlds — competitive bulk pricing and uncompromising quality. Our wholesale program is designed for beauty brands, distributors, salons, and retailers who need consistent, high-quality packaging at scale.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our wholesale clients enjoy dedicated account management, faster turnaround times, and priority production slots. We work with brands shipping hundreds of units per week all the way up to large retailers placing orders of tens of thousands of units. No matter your volume, you receive the same attention to detail and quality assurance process that our brand has become known for.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Pricing is transparent at Prime Packaging Boxes. There are no hidden fees, no surprise charges, and no compromises on print quality. Every custom lip gloss box we produce goes through a strict quality check before it ships to you. We print using state-of-the-art digital and offset printing technology to ensure your brand colors, logo, and design elements look exactly as intended — every single time.</span> \n<h2><b>Printed Lip Gloss Packaging Wholesale — Full Customization From Design to Delivery</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our printed lip gloss packaging wholesale options cover every customization you could possibly need for your beauty line. Choose from a wide range of box styles including tuck-end boxes, sleeve boxes, two-piece rigid boxes, and window boxes that let customers see your product before buying. Every style is available with full custom printing on all sides.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Customization options at Prime Packaging Boxes include matte and gloss lamination, spot UV coating, foil stamping in gold, silver, rose gold, and holographic finishes, embossing, debossing, and soft-touch lamination. These finishing options transform a simple printed box into a luxury unboxing experience that customers remember, photograph, and share across social media platforms.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our design team is available to help you create or refine your artwork at no additional cost. If you already have a design ready, simply send us your print-ready files and we will produce your boxes exactly as designed. If you need help developing your packaging design from scratch, our in-house designers will work closely with you to create something that reflects your brand personality and appeals to your target market.</span> \n<h3><b>Materials We Use for Lip Gloss Packaging</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">We use only high-quality, sustainable materials for all our lip gloss packaging. Our standard options include 14pt, 16pt, and 18pt cardstock for lightweight retail packaging, rigid board for luxury gift-style boxes, and kraft paper for eco-conscious brands. All materials are sourced from certified suppliers and are safe for cosmetic product applications. Food-safe and skin-safe certifications are available on request.</span> \n<h2><b>No Minimum Order — Custom Lip Gloss Boxes for Startups and Small Brands</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">One of the most common challenges beauty entrepreneurs face is finding a packaging supplier that offers custom lip gloss boxes no minimum order restrictions. Most large factories require minimum order quantities of 500, 1000, or even 5000 units — quantities that simply do not make sense for small brands, Etsy sellers, or entrepreneurs just getting started. At Prime Packaging Boxes, we break that barrier completely.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">We offer low minimum order quantities starting from as few as 50 boxes. This means you can order exactly what you need, test new designs without committing to thousands of units, and manage your inventory and cash flow smartly. As your business grows, we scale with you — offering better pricing as your volumes increase and your brand expands.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">This flexible approach is especially popular with indie beauty brands, handmade cosmetic sellers, and entrepreneurs launching their first lip gloss line. You get the same professional, fully custom packaging that established brands use — without being forced to order more stock than you can realistically sell in the near term.</span> \n<h2><b>Small Batch Lip Gloss Packaging Boxes Wholesale — Built for the Indie Beauty Market</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The demand for small batch lip gloss packaging boxes wholesale has grown significantly as the indie beauty market has expanded across the United States and beyond. More and more entrepreneurs are launching their own lip gloss lines on platforms like Etsy, Shopify, TikTok Shop, and Instagram. These independent brands need packaging that looks professional and polished, reflects their unique identity, and can be ordered in quantities that match their actual production volumes.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes was built to serve exactly this growing market. Our small batch wholesale program allows you to order premium custom packaging in quantities that make sense for your current business stage. You are not forced to warehouse thousands of boxes you do not yet need. Order small, grow confidently, and reorder as your sales increase and your customer base expands.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small batch orders from Prime Packaging Boxes typically ship within 8 to 12 business days from artwork approval. We also offer rush production options for brands that need their packaging on a tighter timeline. Our customer service team will work directly with you to meet your delivery requirements without ever compromising on quality.</span> \n<h2><b>Eco Friendly Lip Gloss Boxes Custom Printed — Packaging That Reflects Your Values</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Today''s beauty consumers care deeply about sustainability and ethical practices. Brands that use eco friendly lip gloss boxes custom printed with soy-based inks and recyclable materials consistently report higher customer satisfaction, stronger brand loyalty, and better organic word-of-mouth marketing. If your brand has an eco-conscious identity — or if you simply want to do right by the environment and your customers — Prime Packaging Boxes has the green packaging solutions you need.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our eco-friendly lip gloss packaging is made from FSC-certified kraft paper and post-consumer recycled cardboard. We print using water-based and soy-based inks that are completely free from harmful VOCs and chemical solvents. The result is beautiful, fully custom packaging that is genuinely kind to the planet and tells a compelling sustainability story to your customers.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Eco packaging at Prime Packaging Boxes does not mean plain or boring. Our green packaging options are available with the same full customization as our standard premium line — including custom colors, logo printing, foil accents, embossing, and bespoke structural design. You can have packaging that is simultaneously beautiful, branded, and sustainable. Many of our clients find that highlighting their eco-friendly packaging actually becomes a core part of their brand marketing strategy.</span> \n<h2><b>Why Choose Prime Packaging Boxes for Your Lip Gloss Packaging</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">At Prime Packaging Boxes, we are more than a box manufacturer. We are a packaging partner committed to helping your beauty brand succeed in a competitive market. Here is what consistently sets us apart from other packaging suppliers in the industry:</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Fast turnaround: standard orders ship in 10 to 14 business days from artwork approval, with rush options available for urgent timelines. Low minimums: order as few as 50 boxes to test a new design, launch a new product, or create a limited edition collection. Full customization: every dimension, material, print finish, and structural style is completely customizable to your exact specifications. Free design support: our in-house design team helps bring your vision to life at no additional charge. Quality guarantee: every single order goes through a multi-point quality inspection before it leaves our facility. Dedicated support: you get a real, knowledgeable person who helps you from your first quote all the way through to final delivery.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Custom lip gloss packaging boxes for beauty brands is our specialty, and we take genuine pride in every box we produce. Whether you are packaging a single hero product or a full collection of lip products, <a href="https://www.primepackagingboxes.com/">Prime Packaging Boxes</a> delivers the packaging that makes your brand look as exceptional as your formulas perform. Visit primepackagingboxes.com today to request your free quote and take the first step toward packaging that truly represents your brand</span>', 'Elevate your beauty brand with custom lip gloss boxes made from premium kraft or coated cardboard. Fully printed with your logo, available in matte, gloss, or foil finish. Low minimum order, fast turnaround — ideal for cosmetic brands and wholesale buyers.', 31, '/api/uploads/custom-lip-gloss-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-lip-gloss-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/custom-lip-gloss-boxes-with-logo.webp","/api/uploads/printed-lip-gloss-boxes-bulk.webp","/api/uploads/printed-lip-gloss-boxes-bulk-1.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Lip Gloss Boxes With Logo | Low MOQ &amp; Fast Shipping | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom lip gloss boxes with logo for your beauty brand. No minimum order, eco-friendly options, fast turnaround. Prime Packaging Boxes — trusted by beauty brands across the USA.', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.972Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.783Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (64, 'Custom Cake Boxes', 'custom-cake-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Printed Cake Boxes With Window for Bakeries — Show Off Every Creation</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">A beautiful cake deserves packaging that does it justice. Whether you run a professional bakery, a home-based cake business, a patisserie, or a cafe, your packaging is the very first thing customers see — and it sets the expectation for everything inside. At Prime Packaging Boxes, we produce custom printed cake boxes with window for bakeries that display your creations beautifully, protect them reliably during transport, and make every single purchase feel like a genuinely special occasion worth remembering.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The window feature in cake box packaging is not simply an aesthetic choice — it is a proven and powerful retail sales tool. Customers are dramatically more likely to select a cake, pastry, or baked treat when they can see exactly what they are buying before they commit to the purchase. A clear, strategically positioned window in your custom cake box effectively turns every product on your counter into its own display piece, consistently driving impulse purchases, upselling opportunities, and repeat customer visits.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Cake Boxes Wholesale — Reliable Quality for High-Volume Bakeries</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Running a bakery at any scale means you need packaging you can depend on — week in and week out, season after season. Our custom cake boxes wholesale program is designed specifically for bakeries, patisseries, cafes, catering operations, and food businesses that need high-quality, branded packaging in regular bulk quantities at pricing structures that genuinely work within the tight margins of the food industry.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes is structured in tiers — the more you order per run, the lower your unit cost becomes. Even at our minimum wholesale quantities, our pricing is carefully calibrated to be accessible for independent bakeries and small food businesses operating on food-industry margins. We understand the economics of running a bakery, and our pricing model reflects that understanding.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our wholesale cake boxes are available in all standard bakery sizes — from individual cupcake boxes and single-slice presentation boxes all the way through to large multi-tier wedding and celebration cake boxes. Every size in our range is fully customizable with your bakery name, brand logo, color scheme, tagline, and seasonal messaging. We also develop seasonal designs for major gifting occasions including Valentine''s Day, Mother''s Day, Eid, Christmas, and New Year celebrations — occasions that consistently drive above-average gifting sales for bakeries that have the right packaging ready.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Production consistency is non-negotiable for bakery clients ordering on a regular wholesale basis. Every reorder you place with Prime Packaging Boxes will precisely match your original approved specification — the same materials, the same color accuracy, the same print quality, and the same structural dimensions. We archive your complete design files and production specifications so that reordering is a simple, fast, and consistently reliable process.</span> \n<h2><b>Printed Cake Boxes for Bakeries — Your Brand Travels With Every Sale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Every single box that leaves your bakery counter is a marketing asset working actively for your brand. Printed cake boxes for bakeries from Prime Packaging Boxes put your brand identity directly in front of your customers and, crucially, in front of everyone who sees them carrying your distinctive box — at an office celebration, a birthday party, a family gathering, or simply walking down the street. Your packaging travels with your product and your customer. Make absolutely certain it tells your brand story well.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">We print using high-resolution digital and offset printing technology that faithfully reproduces your brand colors, logo, and design artwork with genuine visual accuracy. Whether your bakery brand identity is warmly rustic and artisanal, clean and contemporary, playfully colorful, or classically elegant, Prime Packaging Boxes produces packaging that authentically matches and reinforces your brand aesthetic with every box.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our printed cake box range covers the full spectrum from full-coverage wraparound printing across all exterior surfaces to simpler and more economical one-color and two-color print treatments for cost-conscious bakeries. Every print option includes your bakery name, logo, and contact details so new customers — and customers buying as gifts — know exactly where to find you when they want to order again.</span> \n<h3><b>Box Styles and Formats Available</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes offers a comprehensive range of structural cake box styles to accommodate every product in your baked goods range. Standard tuck-top cake boxes are the most practical and popular format for everyday retail counter use — easy and fast to assemble, reliably sturdy, and fully printable across all surfaces. Auto-bottom self-erecting boxes significantly speed assembly for high-output bakeries where counter staff need to box products quickly during busy service periods. Boxes with integrated carry handles are an especially popular format for individual whole cakes, layer cakes, and premium pastry gifts. Window boxes featuring clear food-safe PET panels are the premium retail presentation option for showcasing your most beautifully decorated cakes, cupcakes, macarons, tarts, and individually plated desserts. Extended-height tall boxes accommodate tower cakes, architectural layer cakes, tall cheesecakes, and other statement baked creations that standard box heights cannot contain.</span> \n<h2><b>Cake Slice Boxes With Custom Logo in Small Quantity — Ideal for Cafes and Pop-Up Bakeries</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Not every bakery operation needs or wants to order thousands of boxes at a time. Our cake slice boxes with custom logo in small quantity are precisely the right solution for cafes, pop-up bakeries, market stalls, home-based bakers, and food businesses that sell individual slices, single portions, or small-format baked goods as a core part of their retail offering.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Individual cake slice packaging has grown dramatically in popularity as portion-controlled sales, grab-and-go food formats, and single-serve gifting have expanded throughout the food service industry. A well-designed, thoughtfully branded slice box elevates even a simple slice of cake into a properly presented, branded product that customers feel good about purchasing and carrying. These individual slice boxes are also increasingly popular for building premium bakery hampers and curated dessert gift boxes for special occasions.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our small quantity options for cake slice boxes start from as few as 50 units, making it genuinely practical to test a new packaging design, introduce slice boxes as a new format for your operation, or create a special limited-run design for a seasonal promotion or collaboration — without committing a significant portion of your operational budget to packaging stock.</span> \n<h2><b>Kraft Cake Boxes With Handle Custom Size Wholesale — Natural Packaging for Artisan Bakeries</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The sustained consumer trend toward natural, sustainable, and authentically artisan food products has driven consistent and growing demand for kraft cake boxes with handle in custom sizes for wholesale supply. Kraft packaging communicates a clear and compelling set of brand values — authenticity, craftsmanship, environmental consciousness, and honest quality — that resonate powerfully with today''s food-aware, sustainability-conscious consumers across the United States.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our kraft cake boxes are manufactured from high-quality natural brown kraft paper that combines real structural strength with genuine eco credentials. The integrated carry handles make them ergonomically convenient and comfortable for customers to carry, while eliminating the operational need for separate carrier bags in most retail situations. The honest, natural kraft aesthetic pairs beautifully with clean one or two-color printing treatments, hand-stamp style logo applications, and the kind of minimalist design language that modern artisan food brands consistently favor.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Full custom sizing is a standard offering across our kraft cake box range. If your signature product — a whole loaf cake, a large cheesecake, a multi-piece pastry selection, or a bespoke celebration cake — does not conform to any standard box dimension, we engineer and produce boxes to your precise measurements. Custom sizing ensures your product fits perfectly with zero movement during transport, eliminates damage from unnecessary internal space, and gives your packaging a distinctly bespoke quality that customers consciously associate with artisan producers who care about every detail.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Cake Boxes for Home Bakers With No Minimum — Start Small, Build With Confidence</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Home baking has evolved into a genuinely serious and commercially significant business for a large and rapidly growing number of food entrepreneurs across the United States. If you are operating a home-based cake business selling through social media, local markets, referral networks, or online ordering platforms, custom cake boxes for home bakers with no minimum order requirements allow you to present your work with complete professional credibility from your very first sale.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes was designed and built with small and emerging food businesses firmly in mind. We understand completely that cash flow management is a fundamental challenge when you are building a business in its early stages, and we know that committing to large packaging orders before your sales volumes clearly justify that commitment is an unnecessary financial risk that should not be forced upon you. Our low minimum order program gives you the freedom to order exactly what you need, precisely when you need it, without waste and without financial pressure.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Starting with a carefully considered small order also creates a genuinely valuable opportunity to evaluate the physical boxes in real use before scaling to a larger quantity commitment. Many of our home baker clients begin with a modest initial order, gather direct feedback from their customers about the packaging experience, make small design refinements, and then move with full confidence to significantly larger reorders as their order volumes and customer base grow organically. We support and actively encourage that measured, sustainable growth journey at every step.</span> \n<h2><b>Why Bakeries and Home Bakers Across the USA Trust Prime Packaging Boxes</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes has earned the trust of bakeries, patisseries, home bakers, and food entrepreneurs across the United States by consistently delivering on our core commitments: quality that exceeds expectations, pricing that respects the economics of food businesses, flexibility that accommodates businesses at every growth stage, and service that makes the packaging process genuinely simple and stress-free.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Every cake box we produce uses food-safe, FDA-compliant materials appropriate for direct and indirect contact with baked goods. Grease-resistant and moisture-resistant material options are available for products with high fat or moisture content including butter cakes, cream-filled pastries, and fresh fruit tarts. Our production facility maintains strict hygiene and quality standards throughout the manufacturing process.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">From your very first <a href="http://primepackagingboxes.com/get-quote">quote reques</a>t to your ongoing reorder schedule, Prime Packaging Boxes provides the attentive, knowledgeable support that makes packaging one less thing for you to worry about — leaving you free to focus on the baking. Visit primepackagingboxes.com today to request a free sample, submit your artwork, or speak directly with our bakery packaging specialists about your specific requirements. Let us help you package your passion and present it to the world.</span>', 'Custom printed cake boxes in food-safe cardboard, ideal for bakeries, home bakers, and pastry shops. Available in window, handle, and tuck-end styles. Branded with your logo and colors. Bulk wholesale pricing with low minimum order quantity.', 37, '/api/uploads/custom-cake-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-cake-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/custom-cake-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/custom-cake-boxes-with-logo.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Printed Cake Boxes With Window for Bakeries | Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom printed cake boxes with window for your bakery. Wholesale pricing, low MOQ, kraft options with handle. Personalized birthday cake boxes available. Prime Packaging Boxes USA.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.993Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.792Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (28, 'Custom Kraft Soap Boxes', 'custom-kraft-soap-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Kraft Soap Boxes With Window for Handmade Soap — Packaging That Shows Your Craft</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Handmade soap is a product that sells itself — when customers can see it. The rich swirls of color, the embedded botanicals, the hand-cut rustic edges that tell the story of the craft process — these are the visual details that make handmade soap irresistible at the point of sale. At Prime Packaging Boxes, our custom kraft soap boxes with window for handmade soap are designed to showcase exactly those qualities, letting your soap do its own selling while your branded packaging communicates the quality and values of your soap making business.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The window in a kraft soap box is more than a design feature — it is a commercial decision. Research consistently shows that consumers are more likely to purchase products when they can see what they are buying, and this is especially true for handmade and artisan products where the visual evidence of craft and quality is a primary purchasing motivator. Combined with the natural, sustainable aesthetic of kraft paper packaging, a window soap box creates an immediate and compelling presentation that resonates powerfully with the values-driven consumers who are the core market for handmade soap brands.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Kraft Soap Boxes Wholesale — Reliable Supply for Growing Soap Brands</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">As your soap business grows from a kitchen hobby to a serious commercial operation, your packaging requirements grow with it. Our custom kraft soap boxes wholesale program is designed to support soap makers at every stage of that growth journey, from the first small batch runs of a new brand to the consistent high-volume reorders of an established soap business supplying retailers, spas, hotels, and online customers across the country.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes is structured to deliver genuine commercial value at every volume tier. Our minimum wholesale quantities are deliberately set low to make professional custom packaging accessible for soap makers who are still building their customer base and sales volumes. As your order quantities increase, our tiered pricing delivers progressively better unit economics that protect and improve your product margins as you scale.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Every wholesale order of custom kraft soap boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes is produced to a consistent, archived specification that ensures your packaging looks identical on every reorder. Color accuracy, material quality, window placement, and structural dimensions are all quality-checked against your approved sample before any production run ships to you. This consistency is essential for maintaining the professional brand image that builds customer recognition and loyalty over time.</span> \n<h2><b>Eco Friendly Soap Boxes Wholesale — Packaging That Matches Your Values</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Handmade soap brands are almost universally founded on values of naturalness, sustainability, and environmental responsibility. Consumers who choose handmade soap over commercial alternatives are making a values-based purchasing decision — and they expect the packaging that carries their chosen product to reflect those same values. Eco friendly soap boxes wholesale from Prime Packaging Boxes give handmade soap brands packaging that is genuinely aligned with the values that define their brand and attract their customers.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our eco-friendly kraft soap box range is manufactured from FSC-certified natural brown kraft paper — a material that is renewable, biodegradable, compostable, and widely recognized by consumers as a genuine marker of environmental commitment. We print using water-based and soy-based inks that are free from harmful chemical solvents, completing a packaging solution that is responsible at every stage of its lifecycle from raw material through to disposal.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The natural brown kraft aesthetic of our eco-friendly soap boxes is not just environmentally responsible — it is also commercially compelling. The rustic, honest aesthetic of kraft paper packaging communicates authenticity and artisan quality in a way that bleached white cardboard or plastic packaging never can. For handmade soap brands competing against commercial mass-market products, kraft packaging is a powerful differentiator that reinforces exactly the brand story that attracts and retains loyal customers.</span> \n<h3><b>Window Options and Styles</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our kraft soap boxes with window are available with several window configuration options to showcase different soap formats and shapes. Standard rectangular windows are the most popular format, providing a clear view of the soap face. Oval windows create an elegant frame that works particularly well for round or dome-shaped soap bars. Full-length window strips running the length of the box create a dramatic display effect for layered or patterned soaps. Custom window shapes are available for brands that want a distinctive packaging design element that becomes part of their brand identity. All windows use food-grade, recyclable clear PET film.</span> \n<h2><b>Eco Friendly Kraft Soap Packaging With No Minimum Order — For Independent Soap Makers</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The handmade soap market is dominated by independent makers — artisans who produce their soaps in small batches, sell through farmers markets, craft fairs, Etsy shops, and their own websites, and who need packaging that looks professional without requiring the kind of large upfront investment that only makes sense for high-volume producers. Our eco friendly kraft soap packaging with no minimum order program is built specifically for this community of independent makers.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Starting from as few as 50 boxes, independent soap makers can access fully custom printed, professionally produced kraft soap packaging with window at pricing that is genuinely accessible for a small handmade business. There are no minimum order quantities that force you to tie up working capital in packaging inventory you will not use for months. Order what you need, test your designs with real customers, and scale your packaging orders as your sales grow.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">No minimum order packaging from Prime Packaging Boxes is produced to exactly the same quality standard as our wholesale orders. Your 50-box order receives the same precision printing, the same material quality, and the same quality control inspection as an order of 5000 boxes. Every soap maker who sells with our packaging represents our quality to their customers, and we take that responsibility seriously regardless of order size.</span> \n<h2><b>Brown Kraft Soap Boxes Custom Label Printing Wholesale — Professional Branding Made Easy</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">For soap makers who want the flexibility to update their product information, scent descriptions, ingredient lists, or seasonal messaging without reprinting their entire box supply, our brown kraft soap boxes custom label printing wholesale program offers the ideal solution. The natural kraft box provides the premium eco-aesthetic, while custom printed labels carry the variable product-specific information that changes between batches, scents, and seasons.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">This approach is especially practical for soap makers who produce a wide range of scents and formulations using the same basic box template. A single design of kraft window box combined with custom labels for each scent and formulation significantly reduces the number of individual packaging SKUs you need to manage, simplifies your inventory, and allows you to update product information quickly and cost-effectively without reprinting boxes.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom label printing service produces high-quality labels in any size and shape to fit your kraft soap boxes precisely. Labels are available in paper, kraft, and clear film materials with matte or gloss finishes. Full-color printing, foil accents, and embossed effects are all available for labels that want to add a premium finish to a kraft box design. Labels are supplied on rolls or sheets depending on your preferred application method.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Soap Boxes for Small Batch Soap Makers — From Craft to Commerce</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The journey from making soap as a personal passion to selling soap as a business begins with the decision to take your presentation seriously. Custom soap boxes for small batch soap makers from Prime Packaging Boxes give independent artisans the professional packaging foundation they need to take that step confidently — packaging that communicates quality, tells your brand story, and makes your handmade soap look as good as it feels and smells.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Small batch soap makers who invest in professional custom packaging consistently report that it transforms the commercial performance of their products. Professional packaging changes how customers perceive the value of the product, allowing soap makers to price their products at the premium level that genuinely reflects the quality of their ingredients and the craft of their making process. Customers who see professional packaging expect and are willing to pay for a premium product — and handmade soap made with quality ingredients absolutely justifies that premium positioning.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our small batch custom soap box program includes free design consultation with our in-house packaging designers, who understand the handmade soap market and can help you create packaging that connects authentically with your target customer. From choosing the right window style to selecting the perfect kraft weight and print finish for your brand aesthetic, our design team is a genuine resource for soap makers building their brand identity. Visit primepackagingboxes.com to start the conversation and take the first step toward packaging your soap business professionally.</span>', 'Natural custom kraft soap boxes made from 100% recyclable brown board. Ideal for handmade, organic, and artisan soap brands. Printable with eco inks, window-cut styles available. Wholesale pricing with low MOQ, perfect for small and large soap businesses.', 14, '/api/uploads/custom-kraft-soap-boxes.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-kraft-soap-boxes.webp","/api/uploads/custom-kraft-soap-boxes-wholesale.webp","/api/uploads/custom-kraft-soap-boxes-with-logo.webp","/api/uploads/custom-kraft-soap-boxes-1.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Kraft Soap Boxes With Window for Handmade Soap | Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom kraft soap boxes with window for handmade soap brands. Eco-friendly, no minimum, wholesale pricing. Custom label printing available. Prime Packaging Boxes USA.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.936Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.805Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (53, 'Custom Luxury Chocolate Boxes', 'luxury-chocolate-boxes', '<h1><b>Custom Luxury Chocolate Boxes With Logo Wholesale — Packaging That Elevates Every Piece</b></h1> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Premium chocolate is as much about the experience of receiving and opening the box as it is about the taste of the chocolate itself. The world''s most celebrated chocolate brands understand this deeply — their packaging is an integral part of the product, not an afterthought. At Prime Packaging Boxes, we produce custom luxury chocolate boxes with logo for wholesale supply that give artisan chocolate makers, confectionery brands, gift companies, and corporate gifting programs the packaging they need to deliver a complete luxury chocolate experience from the first moment the box is held.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The chocolate gifting market in the United States represents one of the largest and most consistently performing segments of the premium food gifting industry. Chocolate is the gifting choice for Valentine''s Day, Mother''s Day, Christmas, corporate appreciation, wedding favors, and everyday premium gifting across virtually every consumer demographic. In this market, the quality of the chocolate box is directly and immediately associated with the quality of the chocolate inside — and brands that invest in beautiful, well-crafted chocolate boxes consistently command higher price points and stronger customer loyalty than those that do not.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Chocolate Boxes Wholesale — Consistent Luxury at Commercial Scale</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our custom chocolate boxes wholesale program serves artisan chocolatiers, confectionery brands, specialty food companies, gift businesses, and corporate gifting operators across the United States who need consistent, premium quality chocolate packaging at commercially viable pricing. The wholesale program covers the full range of luxury chocolate box styles, sizes, and interior configurations in a pricing structure that makes professional branded chocolate packaging accessible at every production scale.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Wholesale pricing from Prime Packaging Boxes is structured to deliver genuine commercial value for chocolate businesses at every production scale. Tiered pricing improves unit economics as order quantities increase, while minimum wholesale quantities are set at levels that work for artisan chocolatiers who produce in smaller batch sizes alongside larger confectionery operations with higher volume packaging requirements. Every tier delivers the same quality of materials, print, and finishing — only the unit cost changes as volumes grow.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Production consistency for wholesale chocolate box reorders is managed through our archived specification system. Every reorder you place will precisely match your approved reference specification in all dimensions, material quality, print accuracy, and interior configuration. For chocolate brands that supply premium retailers, this consistency is essential — retail buyers expect and require that every delivery of your product arrives in packaging that is identical to what they originally accepted to their shelves.</span> \n<h2><b>Luxury Chocolate Gift Boxes Custom — The Art of Presentation</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Great chocolate deserves a great stage. Luxury chocolate gift boxes custom produced by Prime Packaging Boxes give artisan chocolatiers and premium confectionery brands the presentation platform that their products genuinely deserve. Our luxury chocolate box range combines premium rigid board construction, beautiful exterior print and finishing, and precision-engineered interior configurations to create packaging that makes every piece of chocolate look as precious and desirable as it genuinely is.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Interior configuration is where chocolate box packaging engineering becomes truly specialized. The size, depth, and arrangement of individual chocolate compartments must be precisely calibrated to hold each piece securely in its display position, prevent movement and damage during transit, and create the visually balanced and aesthetically pleasing arrangement that premium chocolate presentation demands. Our chocolate packaging engineers work with you to develop interior tray specifications that are optimized for your specific chocolate dimensions, shapes, and collection arrangements.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Exterior design and finishing options for luxury chocolate gift boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes cover the complete spectrum of luxury packaging aesthetics. Deep jewel-toned matte lamination creates a sophisticated, indulgent aesthetic that resonates perfectly with premium chocolate brand positioning. Gold and silver foil stamping on dark matte surfaces creates a dramatic contrast that communicates luxury immediately and compellingly. Soft-touch lamination in warm tones creates an inviting, tactile quality that makes the box itself a pleasure to hold. Full-color printing for brands with complex designs, photographic elements, or distinctive brand color identities is produced with the accuracy and vibrancy that premium food gifting packaging demands.</span> \n<h3><b>Piece Count Options and Interior Tray Configurations</b></h3> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Prime Packaging Boxes produces luxury chocolate boxes in all the piece count configurations that the chocolate gifting market requires. Two-piece boxes for intimate gifting occasions. Four and six-piece boxes for moderate gifting. Nine, twelve, and sixteen-piece boxes for the most popular mid-size gifting formats. Twenty-four and thirty-six-piece boxes for premium collection gifting and corporate programs. Custom piece count configurations are available for brands with distinctive chocolate collection sizes. Interior trays are available in food-safe cardboard, thermoformed plastic in clear and custom colors, molded pulp for eco-conscious brands, and velvet-lined formats for ultra-premium chocolate presentation.</span> \n<h2><b>Custom Chocolate Gift Boxes With Insert for 12 Pieces — The Most Popular Gifting Format</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The twelve-piece chocolate gift box is the single most popular size in the premium chocolate gifting market, and for good reason. It strikes the ideal balance between perceived generosity and practical consumption — large enough to feel genuinely luxurious as a gift, manageable enough to be enjoyed over a reasonable period without waste. Custom chocolate gift boxes with insert for twelve pieces from Prime Packaging Boxes are produced in formats that make this popular gifting size look and feel as premium as it deserves.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our twelve-piece chocolate box inserts are available in several configurations to accommodate different chocolate shape combinations. Standard twelve-piece grids in equal-sized compartments work perfectly for collections of uniform chocolates. Mixed configuration trays with varying compartment sizes accommodate collections that combine different chocolate formats — full-size pieces, half-pieces, and specialty shapes in a single curated collection presentation. Custom tray designs are engineered around your specific chocolate dimensions for brands with distinctive or unusual chocolate forms.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">The exterior packaging for twelve-piece chocolate gift boxes from Prime Packaging Boxes is available in all our standard luxury chocolate box construction options — rigid lift-off lid boxes, rigid magnetic closure boxes, and premium folding carton formats for brands that need a more economical production approach without compromising on exterior presentation quality. Every exterior option is available with the full range of print and finishing treatments that luxury chocolate brand positioning requires.</span> \n<h2><b>Rigid Chocolate Boxes Custom Foil Printed — Maximum Luxury Impact</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">For chocolate brands positioned firmly at the premium end of the market, rigid box construction with foil printing is the packaging specification that best communicates the extraordinary quality of their product. Rigid chocolate boxes with custom foil printing from Prime Packaging Boxes combine the heavyweight, substantial feel of premium rigid board construction with the visual drama of metallic foil printing to create packaging that commands attention and communicates luxury at the highest level.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Foil printing on rigid chocolate boxes is available in gold, silver, rose gold, copper, holographic, and custom metallic colors. Foil can be applied to logo elements and design accents for a selective metallic highlight effect on a matte or soft-touch laminated background, or as a broader surface treatment for designs that call for more extensive metallic coverage. The contrast between a deep matte background and precise metallic foil printing is one of the most visually powerful effects available in premium packaging, and it is a signature aesthetic of many of the world''s most celebrated chocolate brands.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Rigid construction for our custom foil-printed chocolate boxes uses premium 2mm and 3mm greyboard wrapped in specialty printing papers engineered for optimum foil adhesion and color accuracy. The structural quality of our rigid chocolate boxes ensures that the packaging maintains its pristine appearance throughout the retail journey and the gifting experience, protecting the precious contents and preserving the luxury presentation quality that justifies premium chocolate pricing.</span> \n<h2><b>Luxury Chocolate Packaging for Small Brands With No Minimum — Premium Access for Artisan Chocolatiers</b></h2> \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Artisan chocolate making is a craft that demands investment of time, skill, and premium ingredients. The packaging that carries artisan chocolate to its recipients should reflect that investment with the same level of care and quality. Luxury chocolate packaging for small brands with no minimum order from Prime Packaging Boxes gives independent chocolatiers and small confectionery brands access to genuinely premium packaging without the large order commitments that only make commercial sense for established brands with predictable high-volume requirements.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Starting from as few as 50 boxes, artisan chocolate brands can order luxury branded chocolate packaging with all the premium features — rigid construction, foil printing, velvet interior trays, and magnetic closures — that their chocolate quality deserves and their customers expect at premium price points. No minimum order means you can test your packaging design with your customer base, refine it based on their response, and scale your orders as your sales volumes grow.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Many of our most loyal artisan chocolate packaging clients began with small initial orders, used the packaging to establish their brand at farmers markets, specialty food stores, and online, built their customer base and sales velocity, and then scaled to regular wholesale reorders as their business grew. Prime Packaging Boxes supports that entire journey from first order to established wholesale relationship. Visit <a href="http://primepackagingboxes.com">primepackagingboxes.com</a> to get started with your luxury chocolate packaging today.</span> \n \n<span style="font-weight: 400;"> \n \n</span>', 'Premium luxury chocolate boxes to elevate your confectionery brand. Available in rigid, magnetic, and window styles with gold foil, embossing, and ribbon. Perfect for gifting, retail, and seasonal collections. Wholesale pricing, low MOQ.', 32, '/api/uploads/custom-luxury-chocolate-boxes-with-logo.webp', '["/api/uploads/custom-luxury-chocolate-boxes-with-logo.webp","/api/uploads/custom-luxury-chocolate-boxes-with-logo-1.webp","/api/uploads/printed-luxury-chocolate-boxes-bulk.webp"]', false, true, 100, 'Custom Luxury Chocolate Boxes With Logo Wholesale | Prime Packaging Boxes', 'Order custom luxury chocolate boxes with logo for wholesale. Rigid boxes, foil printing, insert trays for 6-24 pieces. Low MOQ for small brands — Prime Packaging Boxes USA.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.976Z', '2026-08-08T23:16:19.830Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (65, 'Printed Magnetic Closure Boxes', 'printed-magnetic-closure-boxes', '<h2>Printed Magnetic Closure Boxes — High-Quality Custom Packaging & Wholesale Boxes</h2>
<p>When it comes to elevating your product''s market presence, <strong>Printed Magnetic Closure Boxes</strong> from Prime Packaging Boxes offers the ultimate combination of structural durability, eye-catching visual aesthetics, and brand protection. Designed specifically for retail, e-commerce, and promotional applications, our custom packaging solutions ensure your product stands out on store shelves and creates an unforgettable unboxing experience for your customers.</p>

<h3>Why Choose Printed Magnetic Closure Boxes for Your Brand?</h3>
<p>In today''s competitive retail landscape, consumers make split-second buying decisions based on packaging presentation. High-quality custom packaging communicates professionalism, product value, and care. Our Printed Magnetic Closure Boxes is engineered using premium food-safe, eco-friendly, and heavy-duty materials tailored to your exact product dimensions and branding requirements. Whether launching a new product line or upgrading your existing packaging, Prime Packaging Boxes delivers unmatched quality and precision.</p>

<h3>Product Highlights & Features</h3>
<div><h2>Printed Magnetic Closure Boxes — Full-Color Luxury Rigid Packaging</h2>
<p>Printed magnetic closure boxes take luxury unboxing to the next level. Unlike plain magnetic boxes, our fully printed versions feature stunning full-color artwork on the exterior and interior — making every surface a brand canvas that creates an immersive, premium experience for the recipient.</p>
<ul>
<li>Rigid chipboard core with full-color lithographic printing wrap</li>
<li>Full inside printing — transform the interior into a brand story</li>
<li>Magnetic snap closure with premium neodymium magnets</li>
<li>Custom exterior finish: soft-touch matte, gloss, foil, embossing</li>
<li>Satin, velvet, and foam interior lining options</li>
<li>Available in lift-lid, clamshell, and drawer configurations</li>
<li>Custom compartment inserts for product organization inside</li>
<li>100-unit minimum with competitive wholesale pricing at 500+ units</li>
</ul>
<p>Turn every unboxing into a brand experience with fully printed magnetic closure boxes. Prime Packaging builds custom printed rigid boxes for luxury brands across jewelry, cosmetics, and premium gifting. Get a free quote and sample today.</p></div>


<h3>Key Specifications & Customization Capabilities</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Fully Custom Dimensions:</strong> Tailor-made length, width, and depth to fit your products snugly without movement during shipping.</li>
  <li><strong>Vibrant Full-Color Printing:</strong> High-definition CMYK and PMS Pantone color matching printed inside and outside the box.</li>
  <li><strong>Premium Material Stocks:</strong> Choose from 100% recyclable Kraft, Solid Bleached Sulfate (SBS) cardstock, rigid chipboard, or durable fluted corrugated board.</li>
  <li><strong>Luxury Finishing Options:</strong> Enhance your design with Gold/Silver Foil Stamping, Spot UV Coating, Embossing, Debossing, Matte Lamination, or Soft-Touch Velvet finish.</li>
  <li><strong>Custom Protective Inserts:</strong> Optional die-cut foam, cardboard partitions, or molded pulp trays to hold delicate items securely.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Sustainability & Eco-Friendly Materials</h3>
<p>At Prime Packaging Boxes, we are committed to environmental responsibility. Our Printed Magnetic Closure Boxes options include 100% recyclable, biodegradable, and post-consumer recycled paperboard materials. We use non-toxic, eco-friendly vegetable and soy-based inks that deliver vivid color reproduction while minimizing environmental impact.</p>

<h3>Wholesale Benefits & Ordering with Prime Packaging Boxes</h3>
<p>Partnering with Prime Packaging Boxes means getting direct factory-direct wholesale pricing with no hidden fees. We provide:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Low Minimum Order Quantity:</strong> Order as few as 100 units to start your custom packaging run.</li>
  <li><strong>Fast Turnaround Times:</strong> Standard production in 7-10 business days with rush options available.</li>
  <li><strong>Free Design Support:</strong> Work directly with our expert structural and graphic packaging designers at zero extra cost.</li>
  <li><strong>Free 3D Digital Proofing:</strong> Review your artwork on a realistic 3D model before manufacturing begins.</li>
  <li><strong>Free Shipping Across USA:</strong> Fast, reliable doorstep delivery included with every order.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h3>
<p><strong>Q: What is the minimum order quantity for Printed Magnetic Closure Boxes?</strong><br/>
A: Our minimum order quantity (MOQ) starts at just 100 units, making custom packaging accessible for startups and established brands alike.</p>
<p><strong>Q: Can I print inside the box?</strong><br/>
A: Yes! We offer full-color CMYK printing on both the interior and exterior surfaces of your Printed Magnetic Closure Boxes.</p>
<p><strong>Q: How do I get a free custom quote?</strong><br/>
A: Simply contact our team via phone at 818-758-4076 or fill out our online quote form to receive a detailed quote within 2 hours!</p>', 'Premium printed magnetic closure gift boxes with full inside/outside printing. Ideal for luxury retail brands.', 38, '/api/uploads/printed-magnetic-closure-boxes-bulk.webp', '["/api/uploads/printed-magnetic-closure-boxes-bulk.webp","/api/uploads/custom-magnetic-closure-boxes-wholesale.webp"]', true, true, 100, 'Custom Printed Magnetic Closure Boxes | Wholesale Custom Packaging USA', 'Order custom Printed Magnetic Closure Boxes with logo printing, premium finishes, and food-safe eco materials. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T22:43:26.996Z', '2026-08-08T23:18:23.196Z');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "description", "short_description", "category_id", "image_url", "images", "is_featured", "is_active", "min_order", "meta_title", "meta_description", "sort_order", "regular_price", "sale_price", "sku", "weight", "box_length", "box_width", "box_height", "focus_keyword", "tags", "attributes", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES (66, 'Custom Pillow Boxes', 'custom-pillow-boxes', '<h2>Custom Pillow Boxes - Elegant Curved Packaging for Gifts & Retail</h2>
<p>Make a lasting visual impression with <strong>Custom Pillow Boxes</strong> from Prime Packaging Boxes. Featuring a distinctive curved profile that pops open effortlessly into a stylish pillow shape, these packaging boxes are the ideal choice for retail merchandise, jewelry items, gift card holders, party favors, cosmetics, and lightweight apparel accessories.</p>

<h3>Why Choose Pillow Packaging Boxes?</h3>
<p>Unlike standard square or rectangular cartons, pillow boxes offer a soft, organic aesthetic that immediately captures customer interest. Their sleek, space-saving design ships flat to save on warehousing and transportation costs, yet pops open instantly for fast fulfillment during high-volume retail seasons.</p>

<h3>Key Features & Specifications</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Unique Curved Contour:</strong> Eye-catching pillow shape that elevates unboxing aesthetics.</li>
  <li><strong>Space-Saving Flat Shipping:</strong> Delivered flat-packed for easy storage and effortless assembly.</li>
  <li><strong>Premium Board Options:</strong> Choice of eco-friendly brown Kraft, smooth white SBS cardstock, or metallic foil board (14pt to 24pt thickness).</li>
  <li><strong>Vibrant Full-Color Printing:</strong> Crisp CMYK and Pantone color printing for brand logos, patterns, and messaging.</li>
  <li><strong>Optional Handles & Windows:</strong> Add die-cut clear display windows or die-cut handles for carry convenience.</li>
  <li><strong>Luxury Surface Treatments:</strong> Gold/Silver foil stamping, Spot UV highlights, embossed textures, and soft-touch matte lamination.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Ideal Applications Across Industries</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Jewelry & Accessories:</strong> Rings, bracelets, necklaces, and watches.</li>
  <li><strong>Cosmetics & Skincare:</strong> Lip balms, mini perfume bottles, soaps, and sample kits.</li>
  <li><strong>Retail & Gift Cards:</strong> Gift cards, vouchers, ribbons, and branded merchandise.</li>
  <li><strong>Events & Weddings:</strong> Party favors, candy treats, and wedding giveaways.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Wholesale Custom Pillow Boxes USA</h3>
<p>Order custom pillow packaging boxes directly from Prime Packaging Boxes. Benefit from low minimum order quantities starting at just 100 units, fast 7-10 day turnarounds, free graphic design support, and 100% free nationwide USA shipping. Request your free quote today!</p>', 'Elegant custom pillow boxes for jewelry, gift items, apparel accessories, and party favors. Unique curved shape with vibrant logo printing and luxury finishes.', 20, '/api/uploads/custom-kraft-gable-boxes-wholesale.webp', '[]', true, true, 100, 'Custom Pillow Boxes Wholesale | Printed Gift Packaging USA', 'Order custom pillow boxes with logo printing, clear windows, and luxury foil finishes. Low 100 MOQ, free design support & free USA shipping.', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-08T23:20:22.598Z', '2026-08-08T23:20:22.598Z');

